  101,Introduction to q-de Rham Cohomology,"https://guests.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/ferdinand/q-deRham.pdf",mpg.de,math.AG,math.AG math.DG math.NT mathematics differential-geometry prismatic-cohomology survey,null,null,null,"Introduction to q-de Rham Cohomology. Ferdinand Wagner's exposition of $q$-de Rham cohomology, $q$-connections, and Habiro rings."
  102,Sheaves on Manifolds and Efimov K-Theory,"https://www.uni-muenster.de/IVV5WS/WebHop/user/nikolaus/Papers/sheaves-on-manifolds.pdf",uni-muenster.de,math.KT,math.KT math.AT math.CT math.AG mathematics k-theory category-theory sheaf-theory formalization,null,null,null,"Sheaves on Manifolds and Efimov K-Theory. Nikolaus's paper constructing six-functor formalisms on $\\operatorname{Shv}(X; \\mathcal{D}(\\mathbb{Z}))$ for locally compact Hausdorff spaces via compactly assembled presentable stable $\\infty$-categories and Efimov's continuous $K$-theory. Details dualizable categories, rigid monoidal categories, Frobenius algebras, and self-duality of $\\operatorname{Shv}(X; \\operatorname{Sp})$."
