  1038,The Mitchell-Benabou Language,"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Mitchell-B%C3%A9nabou+language",ncatlab.org,math.LO,math.LO math.CT mathematics mathematical-logic topos-theory category-theory constructive-mathematics nlab,null,null,null,"The Mitchell-Benabou Language. Category-theoretic logic interpreting higher-order intuitionistic predicate logic inside elementary topoi using subobject classifiers $\\Omega$, power objects, and Heyting algebras."
