  1462,Noncommutative Geometry and Physics,"https://alainconnes.org/wp-content/uploads/poincareseminar2007.pdf",alainconnes.org,math-ph,math-ph math.OA math.QA hep-th physics mathematics noncommutative-geometry mathematical-physics index-theory,null,null,null,"Noncommutative Geometry and Physics. Poincare Seminar paper on noncommutative geometry, Dirac operators $D$, line elements $ds = D^{-1}$, inner automorphisms $\\operatorname{Inn}(\\mathcal{A})$, and spectral actions."
  1463,Noncommutative Geometry Monograph,"https://alainconnes.org/wp-content/uploads/bookwebfinal-2.pdf",alainconnes.org,math.OA,math.OA math-ph math.DG math.QA mathematics physics noncommutative-geometry operator-algebras index-theory algebraic-topology book,null,null,null,"Noncommutative Geometry Monograph. Alain Connes' 600+ page foundational textbook covering: - **Operator Algebras & Factors:** Classification of Type I, II, and III von Neumann factors. Type II factors exhibit continuous dimensions. - **Time Evolution & the KMS Condition:** The Tomita–Takesaki theorem and the canonical homomorphism $\\delta: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\operatorname{Out}(M) = \\operatorname{Aut}(M)/\\operatorname{Inn}(M)$ showing that noncommutativity naturally generates time evolution. - **Foliations & Cyclic Cohomology:** Leaf spaces as noncommutative spaces, longitudinal index theorems, cyclic cohomology $HC^*(A)$, and noncommutative de Rham homology. - **Quantum Mechanics & Uncertainty:** Noncommuting variables $[P, Q] = i\\hbar$, spectral geometry, Dirac operators as square roots of Laplacians, and Dixmier traces."
