  2362,"Enumerative Tropical Algebraic Geometry in $\\mathbb{R}^2$","https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0312530",arxiv.org,math.AG,math.AG math.CO mathematics tropical-geometry algebraic-geometry combinatorics enumerative-geometry arxiv,Grigory Mikhalkin,2003,math/0312530,"Enumerative Tropical Algebraic Geometry in $\\mathbb{R}^2$. Proves the correspondence theorem counting complex and real plane curves through points by tropical curves with multiplicities."
