  2364,Solving the KPZ Equation,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.6811",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR math.AP mathematics stochastic-analysis arxiv,Martin Hairer,2011,"1109.6811",Solving the KPZ Equation. Constructs solutions of the KPZ equation via rough path theory and shows they coincide with the Cole–Hopf solutions.
  2365,Paracontrolled Distributions and Singular PDEs,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1210.2684",arxiv.org,math.AP,math.AP math.PR math.FA mathematics stochastic-analysis functional-analysis pde harmonic-analysis arxiv,Massimiliano Gubinelli and Peter Imkeller and Nicolas Perkowski,2012,"1210.2684","Paracontrolled Distributions and Singular PDEs. Uses Bony's paraproducts to define and solve singular SPDEs via paracontrolled ansatz, an alternative to regularity structures."
  2366,Stein's Method on Wiener Chaos,"https://arxiv.org/abs/0712.2940",arxiv.org,math.DS,math.DS math.CA math.PR mathematics ode-and-dynamical-systems real-analysis stochastic-analysis arxiv,Ivan Nourdin and Giovanni Peccati,2007,"0712.2940",Stein's Method on Wiener Chaos. Combines Stein's method with Malliavin calculus to obtain explicit bounds in normal approximation for functionals of Gaussian fields.
