  2392,Good Moduli Spaces for Artin Stacks,"https://arxiv.org/abs/0804.2242",arxiv.org,math.AG,math.AG mathematics moduli-spaces stacks geometric-invariant-theory arxiv,Jarod Alper,2008,"0804.2242",Good Moduli Spaces for Artin Stacks. Introduces good moduli spaces for Artin stacks generalizing GIT quotients.
