  2701,Statistical Inference and Analysis,"https://github.com/HadiHz88/LU-M1S1/blob/master/IN400-%20Math%20%26%20Statistics/Chap-5/pres_ch5.pdf",github.com,math.ST,math.ST stat.ME mathematics statistics software-engineering lecture-notes survey slides github,Youssef SALMAN,2025,null,"Statistical Inference and Analysis. Beamer slides by Youssef SALMAN, 2025; 36 pages. Part of LU M1S1 - Course Materials, Summaries & Resources: Hi, this is Hadi. This repository is a comprehensive collection of course materials, summaries, notes, and external resources for Master Year 1, Semester 1 courses at Lebanese University, Hadath, academic year 2025/2026. Sections: Introduction to Statistical Inference; Point Estimation; Confidence Intervals; Hypothesis Testing; Scenarios and ML Links; Inference in Linear Regression."
