  2764,High Temperature Limit of Beta Ensembles and MOPS,"https://github.com/mitmath/18338/blob/master/projects/2025/nguyen_duythuc_bell_polynomials/nguyenduythuc_188881_5944716_Slides-1.pdf",github.com,math.RA,math.RA math.NA math.PR math-ph mathematics physics linear-algebra random-matrix-theory combinatorics functional-analysis lecture-notes slides github,Duy Thuc Nguyen,2025,null,"High Temperature Limit of Beta Ensembles and MOPS. Beamer slides by Duy Thuc Nguyen, 2025; 14 pages. Part of 18.338: Eigenvalues of random matrices, Fall 2025: This is the repository for public materials for the MIT course 18.338, Eigenvalues of random matrices, for the Fall 2025 semester. Sections: Beta-Laguerre Ensemble in the High Temperature Limit; Relationship between -cumulants and Moments for General Distributions; Multivariate Orthogonal Polynomials Symbolically. Subsections include Background, and Moments for Beta-Laguerre. Slides cover High Temperature Limit, Generating Functions for γ-cumulants and Moments, Relation to Bell Polynomials, Numerical Verification, Recurrence Relation, General Moments from γ-cumulants, and Symbolic Computation of MOPs."
