  2985,CS480/640 Robustness,"https://github.com/kpc-simone/cs480-f24/blob/main/lectures/20_furlong_robustness.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes book slides problem-list github,P. Michael Furlong,2024,null,"CS480/640 Robustness. Beamer lecture slides by P. Michael Furlong, 2024; 58 pages. Part of Course Homepage for CS 480/680: The suggested readings make use of the following abbreviations to refer to textbook sources:. Slides cover What do we mean by robustness?, Formally Stating the Problem Setting, Lack of Robustness Arise from Model Errors, Formally Stating the Problem, Attacker’s Goal (Formally), How to Find the Perturbation, ∆x?, What Kinds of Norms Are There?, Projected Gradient Descent, Turning Untargeted Attacks into Targeted Attacks, and Attacks on Defenses: Obfuscated Gradients."
  2986,"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Games: Models of Multi-Agent Interaction","https://github.com/marl-book/slides/blob/main/marl-book-ch3-games.pdf",github.com,cs.AI,cs.AI cs.LG cs.MA cs.SE computer-science ai-agents machine-learning reinforcement-learning probability book slides github,Stefano V. Albrecht and Filippos Christianos,2024,null,"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Games: Models of Multi-Agent Interaction. Beamer slides by Stefano V. Albrecht, and Filippos Christianos, 2024; 58 pages. Part of Slides for MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\": This repository contains slides for the MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\" by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer. Sections: Game Models; Modeling Communication; Assumptions in Games. Slides cover The MARL Book, Lecture Outline, Normal-Form Games, Normal-Form Game Process, Matrix Games, Repeated Normal-Form Games, Stochastic Games, Stochastic Game Process, Example: Level-Based Foraging, and POSG Process."
  2987,Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Deep Reinforcement Learning,"https://github.com/marl-book/slides/blob/main/marl-book-ch8-deep-rl.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG cs.AI stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning reinforcement-learning ai-agents algorithms book slides github,Stefano V. Albrecht and Filippos Christianos,2024,null,"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Deep Reinforcement Learning. Beamer slides by Stefano V. Albrecht, and Filippos Christianos, 2024; 80 pages. Part of Slides for MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\": This repository contains slides for the MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\" by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer. Sections: Deep Q-Learning; Policy Gradient Algorithms; Concurrent Training. Slides cover The MARL Book, Lecture Outline, The Moving Target Problem, Correlation of Consecutive Experiences, Deep Q-Networks, Deep Q-learning in Practice, Advantages of Learning a Policy, Policy Gradient Theorem – Continued, REINFORCE: Monte Carlo, and Baselines Continued."
  2988,Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Multi-Agent Deep Reinforcement Learning – Part 1,"https://github.com/marl-book/slides/blob/main/marl-book-ch9-part1-deep-marl.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG cs.AI cs.MA cs.SE computer-science ai-agents machine-learning reinforcement-learning algorithms book slides github,Stefano V. Albrecht and Filippos Christianos and Lukas Schäfer,2024,null,"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Multi-Agent Deep Reinforcement Learning – Part 1. Beamer slides by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer, 2024; 88 pages. Part of Slides for MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\": This repository contains slides for the MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\" by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer. Sections: Training and Execution Modes; Independent Learning with Deep Reinforcement Learning; Multi-Agent Policy Gradient Algorithms; Value Decomposition in Common-Reward Games. Slides cover The MARL Book, Lecture Outline, Independent Learning with Deep, Independent Deep Q-Networks, Multi-Agent Policy Gradient, The Multi-Agent Policy-Gradient Theorem, Centralized Advantage Actor-Critic, Counterfactual Multi-Agent Policy Gradient, Example for the Equilibrium Selection Problem, and Pareto Actor-Critic for Equilibrium Selection."
  2989,Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Multi-Agent Deep Reinforcement Learning – Part 2,"https://github.com/marl-book/slides/blob/main/marl-book-ch9-part2-deep-marl.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG cs.AI cs.MA cs.SE computer-science ai-agents machine-learning reinforcement-learning markov-chains book slides github,Stefano V. Albrecht and Filippos Christianos and Lukas Schäfer,2024,null,"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning - Multi-Agent Deep Reinforcement Learning – Part 2. Beamer slides by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer, 2024; 123 pages. Part of Slides for MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\": This repository contains slides for the MIT Press textbook \"Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning: Foundations and Modern Approaches\" by Stefano V. Albrecht, Filippos Christianos, and Lukas Schäfer. Sections: Agent Modeling with Deep Learning; Parameter and Experience Sharing; Policy Self-Play in Zero-Sum Games; Population-Based Training. Slides cover The MARL Book, Lecture Outline, Recap: Joint-Action Learning with Agent Models, Joint-Action Learning with Deep Agent Models, Learning Compact Representations of Agent Policies, Parameter and Experience Sharing – Motivation, Parameter Sharing, Shared Experience Actor-Critic (SEAC), The Challenge of Zero-Sum Board Games, and Monte Carlo Tree Search (MCTS)."
  2990,Fast eigendecomposition of unitary upper Hessenberg matrices 18.338 final project,"https://github.com/mitmath/18338/blob/master/projects/2024/RMT_Project_Presentation.pdf",github.com,math.RA,math.RA cs.DS math.NA math.PR mathematics computer-science linear-algebra algorithms random-matrix-theory lecture-notes slides github,Nicholas West,2024,null,"Fast eigendecomposition of unitary upper Hessenberg matrices 18.338 final project. Beamer slides by Nicholas West, 2024; 12 pages. Part of 18.338: Eigenvalues of random matrices, Fall 2025: This is the repository for public materials for the MIT course 18.338, Eigenvalues of random matrices, for the Fall 2025 semester. Slides cover Aim of the report, Summary of results: 3 plots, Main idea of algorithm [1], Visual algorithm, Algorithm details, Random matrix connection, Sampling algorithm [2], Why does this work? (Blackboard), Next steps, and Bibliography I."
  2991,"School of Computer: 命题符号化, 永真公式","https://github.com/openwhu/OpenWHU/blob/main/%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E8%AF%BE/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%A1%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89/1-%E5%91%BD%E9%A2%98.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics combinatorics graph-theory slides github,null,2024,null,"School of Computer: 命题符号化, 永真公式. Beamer slides, 2024; 392 pages, in Chinese. Part of WHU课代表计划 - 武汉大学课程资料整理: 华中科技大学研究生课程资料 - CityU GuideBook A comprehensive platform for CityUHK students. - 浙江大学课程攻略共享计划 - 气垫船计划——免费、去中心化的北京大学往年题资料库 - 北京大学信科学生会学术部资料库 - 北大计算机课程大作业 - 清华大学计算机系课程攻略 - 东南大学课程共享计划 - 中国科学技术大学计算机学院课程资源 - 上海交通大学课程资料分享 - 北京大学课程资料分享. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory. Sections: 命题符号化; 永真公式; 联结词的扩充和归约; 推理和证明方法. Subsections include 符号化, 合式公式的形式文法, 合式公式的形式语义, 公式的分类, 逻辑等价, 永真蕴含, 恒等变换和不等变换, 对偶性, 析取范式和合取范式, and 主析取范式. Slides cover 本章内容, 公式简化规则, Remarks(2/2), 逻辑恒等式与不等式的证明, Example(1/3), 极小项的性质, 主析取范式求解–Example(I), 主析取范式和主合取范式–对偶性, Programming Example, and Example."
  2992,"School of Computer: 函数、复合函数, 函数的递归定义","https://github.com/openwhu/OpenWHU/blob/main/%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E8%AF%BE/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%A1%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89/6-%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics combinatorics graph-theory slides github,null,2024,null,"School of Computer: 函数、复合函数, 函数的递归定义. Beamer slides, 2024; 149 pages, in Chinese. Part of WHU课代表计划 - 武汉大学课程资料整理: 华中科技大学研究生课程资料 - CityU GuideBook A comprehensive platform for CityUHK students. - 浙江大学课程攻略共享计划 - 气垫船计划——免费、去中心化的北京大学往年题资料库 - 北京大学信科学生会学术部资料库 - 北大计算机课程大作业 - 清华大学计算机系课程攻略 - 东南大学课程共享计划 - 中国科学技术大学计算机学院课程资源 - 上海交通大学课程资料分享 - 北京大学课程资料分享. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory. Sections: 函数、复合函数; 函数的递归定义. Subsections include 函数的定义, 复合函数, 单射、满射和双射, 自然数集合上的递归函数, Euclid算法和尾递归, List集合上的递归函数, Ackermann函数, and 高阶函数. Slides cover Wuhan University, 本章内容, 函数的像和逆像, 函数的合成, 单射、满射和双射, Theorem, 双射的充要条件, Examples, 自然数集上的递归函数, and Fibonacci序列递归定义如下,求其解析式."
  2993,"WHU课代表计划 - 武汉大学课程资料整理, 集合的基数: 可数集合和不可数集合","https://github.com/openwhu/OpenWHU/blob/main/%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E8%AF%BE/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%A1%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89/7-%E5%9F%BA%E6%95%B0.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS math.CO computer-science mathematics algorithms combinatorics graph-theory slides github,null,2024,null,"WHU课代表计划 - 武汉大学课程资料整理, 集合的基数: 可数集合和不可数集合. Beamer slides, 2024; 142 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 华中科技大学研究生课程资料 - CityU GuideBook A comprehensive platform for CityUHK students. - 浙江大学课程攻略共享计划 - 气垫船计划——免费、去中心化的北京大学往年题资料库 - 北京大学信科学生会学术部资料库 - 北大计算机课程大作业 - 清华大学计算机系课程攻略 - 东南大学课程共享计划 - 中国科学技术大学计算机学院课程资源 - 上海交通大学课程资料分享 - 北京大学课程资料分享. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory; algorithms and data structures. Sections: 可数集合和不可数集合. Subsections include 自然数的定义, 有限集和无限集, 可数集, and 不可数集. Slides cover School of Computer, 本章内容, Theorem (Peano自然数公理), Definition (等势(Equinumerous)), 有限集和无限集, Theorem, 可数无限集判别, N × N的枚举, Q+的枚举(一), and 字典序(Lexicographic order)."
  2994,"Магнітне поле у вакуумі: Лекції з електрики та магнетизму","https://github.com/sergiokapone/ElMagLectures/blob/main/MagFieldVacuum/MagFieldVacuum.pdf",github.com,cs.RO,cs.RO computer-science robotics slides github,null,2024,null,"Магнітне поле у вакуумі: Лекції з електрики та магнетизму. Beamer slides, 2024; 35 pages, in Ukrainian. Part of Лекції з дисципліни \"Електрика та магнетизм\": 1. Постійне електричне поле в вакуумі 2. Subject (translated): robotics. Sections: Означення; Характеристика магнітного поля; Дія магнітного поля на заряджені частинки та сруми; Закон Біо-Савара-Лапласа; Вектор-потенціал магнітного поля; Теореми магнітостатики; Магнітний момент; Потенціальна енергія диполя та сила, що діє на диполь в магнітному полі. Slides cover Зміст лекції, Сила Лоренца та сила Ампера, Елемент струму, Зв'язок сили Лоренца та сили Ампера, Робота магнітного поля, Відносність величини магнітного поля, Приклади застосування закону Біо-Савара-Лапласа, Взаємодія струмів, Теорема Гаусса для магнітного поля, and Теорема про циркуляцію магнітного поля у вакуумі."
  2995,10 DNA 技术及生物信息学分析简介,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-10.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics computational-biology lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"10 DNA 技术及生物信息学分析简介. Beamer slides, 2024; 57 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Subject (translated): bioinformatics and computational biology. Sections: 10.2 生物信息学分析; 10.4 遗传工程的应用; 10.5 遗传工程的风险和伦理学问题. Slides cover 生物技术 (biotechnology) 是在生物学理论的基础上建立, Figure 2. Southern 印迹, 1. PCR 技术的基本原理. PCR 反应过程, 2. Taq DNA 聚合酶, 10.2.2 蛋白质序列和结构分析, 4. 限制性内切酶的识别序列, 逆转录酶, Figure 12. pBR322 图谱, 引入宿主细胞和筛选鉴定, and 生产新型疫苗."
  2996,"第 3 篇: 生物演化 - 11 演化理论与微演化","https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-11.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN math.PR q-bio.QM quantitative-biology mathematics bioinformatics probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"第 3 篇: 生物演化 - 11 演化理论与微演化. Beamer slides, 2024; 70 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Subject (translated): probability. Sections: 11.1 演化理论的创立: 历史和证据; 11.2 自然选择和人工选择; 11.3 微演化与中性理论. Slides cover 例子: 持久性的害虫, Nothing in Biology Makes Sense Except in the, 在达尔文以前, 法国的博物学, Figure 6. 贝格尔号环球航行的路线, 1859. 11,达尔文的《物种起源》(On the Origin Species, Galapagos Islands 的生物, Figure 10. 现代基因组学视角下的地雀, 化石记录的证据, 自然选择 如果具有某种可遗传性状的个体能够比其他个, and Figure 18. 新生儿的体重."
  2997,12 物种形成和灭绝,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-12.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"12 物种形成和灭绝. Beamer slides, 2024; 32 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 12.2 物种形成的方式. Slides cover 迄今为止没有一个定义能够令所有的博物学家都, 亚里士多德的物种 物种是真实存在的事物, 具有其本质特, 12. 1.2生殖障碍造成物种分化, 12. 1.3空间上不连续, 时间上是连续的, 每一个分类群的物种都有共同来源 — 时间上的连续性, 12.2. 1地理隔离条件下的物种形成, Figure 4. 地理隔离, Figure 6. 地雀, 12.2.2 彼此独立发生的相似的物种形成, and Figure 8. 丽鱼."
  2998,13 生命起源与宏演化,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-13.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"13 生命起源与宏演化. Beamer slides, 2024; 22 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Slides cover Figure 1. 各种生命形式, 13. 1. 1生命的起源是自然的历史事件, 3. 自然发生说, Figure 2. Francesco Redit 实验, Figure 3. 巴斯德 “鹅颈瓶” 实验, 4. 生命进化起源说, 生命的摇篮 — 地球的进化, 原始地球, 13. 1.2生命的化学进化 — 有机小分子的非生物合成, Figure 4. 米勒, Stanley Miller, Figure 5. 米勒放电实验, and 13. 1.3生命的化学进化 — 生物大分子的非生物合成."
  2999,"第 2 篇: 遗传与变异 - 6 遗传的基本规律","https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-6.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"第 2 篇: 遗传与变异 - 6 遗传的基本规律. Beamer slides, 2024; 47 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 6.1 性状的孟德尔式遗传; 6.2 遗传的染色体学说与遗传第三定律. Slides cover 6. 1性状的孟德尔式遗传, 6. 1. 1性状的颗粒式遗传与孟德尔第一定律, Figure 3. 豌豆性状, 6. 1.2自由组合与孟德尔第二定律, 6. 1.3人类性状的孟德尔式遗传, 新近产生的表型, 复等位基因的遗传, Figure 12. 镰刀形贫血症, 绝大多数生物学表型特征, 都由多个基因及环境条件决定, and 萨顿和博韦里的假说."
  3000,7 基因与基因组,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-7.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"7 基因与基因组. Beamer slides, 2024; 68 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 7.1 DNA 是遗传物质; 7.3 基因的概念与演变; 7.5 非孟德尔式遗传. Slides cover 7. 1 DNA是遗传物质, 肺炎链球菌转化实验, Figure 4. 放射性标记 T2 噬菌体, DNA 与 RNA 是多核苷酸的聚合体, Figure 8. X-射线衍射实验, Figure 12. Model of DNA built by James Watson and Francis, DNA 复制依赖于碱基配对, Figure 18. 大肠杆菌中的 DNA 复制1, 复制的半不连续性, and 基因组及基因组学."
  3001,8 遗传物质的突变,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-8.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"8 遗传物质的突变. Beamer slides, 2024; 21 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 8.2 染色体畸变. Slides cover DNA 作为遗传物质, 需兼具 稳定性 与 灵活性, 置换 (substitution), Figure 1. 镰刀形贫血症, 同义突变, 插入 (insertion), 突变的诱发, Figure 2. TT 二聚体, Figure 3. 切除修复, Figure 4. 同源重组修复, and 8.2. 1染色体的结构畸变."
  3002,9 性状的决定与形成,"https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/ch-9.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"9 性状的决定与形成. Beamer slides, 2024; 63 pages, in Chinese. Part of Markdown to lecture slides: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 9.1 遗传信息解读的中心法则; 9.2 基因表达的调控. Slides cover 9. 1遗传信息解读的中心法则, 9. 1. 1性状决定的分子基础 — 基因主要通过其产物决定, RNA 的结构与功能, Figure 3. tRNA 三级结构, Figure 6. 基因转录起始, RNA 剪接, 1. tRNA 携带氨基酸, 对基因表达过程的调节控制被称为基因表达调控. 基因, Figure 18. The lac Operon, and 操纵子: 只存在于原核生物中, 由功能上彼此相关的几."
  3003,"Markdown to lecture slides, 达尔文的时代背景: Darwin","https://github.com/wang-q/lecture-slides/blob/master/slides/darwin.slides.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides github,null,2024,null,"Markdown to lecture slides, 达尔文的时代背景: Darwin. Beamer lecture slides, 2024; 50 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: The slides directory contains slides for my course \"General Biology\". Sections: 古典时代: 亚里士多德; 中世纪: 神学之下的发展; 文艺复兴: 自然历史 — 自然哲学 — 自然科学. Slides cover 每个人都有他自己所处的时代背景, 伟大的科学家也不, 理性精神 亚里士多德的方式是从最简单的现象开始, 多, 介质对于运行其中的物体有阻滞, 这种阻滞称为粘度, 调查方法, Figure 5. 自然的阶梯 (the ladder of nature), 史上最伟大的神学家, 阿奎那, 上帝存在的五个证明 iii, and 阿拉伯世界."
  3004,``Dollo'' after all? Puzzling behaviour of models of vocabulary evolution can be explained by effects of ascertainment correction,"https://gitlab.com/Philipp_Ronchen/c-leste-talk-slides/-/blob/main/Puzzling_behaviour_of_models_effects_ascertainment_correction.pdf",gitlab.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability slides gitlab,Philipp Rönchen and Tilo Wiklund,2024,null,"``Dollo'' after all? Puzzling behaviour of models of vocabulary evolution can be explained by effects of ascertainment correction. Beamer slides by Philipp Rönchen, and Tilo Wiklund, 2024; 46 pages. Slides cover Background: Using vocabulary for inferences on proto-languages, Models of vocabulary evolution, Two main models, CTMC model, Realisticness Stochastic Dollo, Ascertainment (cont.), Ascertainment correction, Ascertainment correction and model parameters, Results of simulation studies (cont.), Ascertained Dollo death model, Proof sketch, Open questions, and Simulation studies."
