  3468,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 表达式, 代换模型","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter1_1.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL cs.SE computer-science programming-languages software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 表达式, 代换模型. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 60 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): software engineering; programming languages. Sections: 表达式; 代换模型; 条件表达式和谓词. Slides cover 第一章讲了什么故事, 涉及的LISP语法, 当你要定义一个函数,而等式左右两边都有这个函数时,(可能), 1.1节的内容, 嵌套的表达式, 这就是小学的四则运算流程啊。为什么不说“先计算最内层括号的, 为了求值表达式名字, 图片化表示, 过程作为模块, and 很明显,除非明确了解自己的程序会有什么样的执行后果,否则不."
  3469,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 递归的改进一","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter1_2.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 递归的改进一. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 107 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Sections: 递归的改进一:迭代; 递归的改进二:去掉重复计算; 内部定义; 增长阶; 递归的改进三:二分. Slides cover 第一章知识间的关系, 1.2节讲了什么故事, 1.2节的PPT涉及哪些内容, 递归算法的设计流程似乎是先写出一个等式,然后再把等式改写为, 递归算法的实现, 使用迭代计算阶乘, (fib 43)的运行的时间就已经超过了1分钟, 针对本问题的设计思路, 使用牛顿法计算方程的根, and 例子:factorial过程的时间和空间增长阶."
  3470,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 以过程为参数的高阶过程, 以过程为执行结果的高阶过程","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter1_3.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE computer-science software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第一章构造过程抽象: 以过程为参数的高阶过程, 以过程为执行结果的高阶过程. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 70 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): software engineering. Sections: 以过程为参数的高阶过程; 以过程为执行结果的高阶过程; let语句; 使用高阶过程. Slides cover 第一章知识间的关系, 1.3节讲了什么故事, 1.3节的PPT涉及哪些内容, 让我们从生活中的例子回到计算机, (newtons-method g guess):通用的牛顿法代码。注意,g是由方, 共同的模式, 通过先定义过程f-result,再让(deriv g)的求值结果就是这个过程的, Lambda与过程定义, 如何完成从第i轮到第i+1轮的计算, and (newton-transform g)."
  3471,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 数据的必要性, 数据抽象","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter2_1.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.SE computer-science algorithms software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 数据的必要性, 数据抽象. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 63 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): software engineering; algorithms and data structures. Sections: 数据的必要性; 数据抽象; 抽象屏障; 合约(规约),以及数据的过程性表示. Slides cover 第二章讲了什么故事, 涉及的LISP语法, 构造数据需要一种机制把数据粘合起来, 2.1节的PPT涉及哪些内容, 数据需要被有层次地组织起来, 我们甚至还不知道make-rat、numer和denom到底如何实现, 分隔数据的使用和表示, 使用序对构造有理数, 在每次使用make-rat构造有理数时,分子分母同时约去最大公约数, and 第一层抽象屏障."
  3472,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 表的定义和操作, 树的定义和操作","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter2_2.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE computer-science software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 表的定义和操作, 树的定义和操作. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 112 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): software engineering. Sections: 表的定义和操作; 树的定义和操作; 序列作为约定的界面; 嵌套映射. Slides cover 第二章的学习思路, 2.2节讲了什么故事, 2.2节的PPT涉及哪些内容, 多样的嵌套可能, 令fibBase为表(1 1 1 0)对应的2*2矩阵, 6. 处理表中特定下标的元素, 不同于表,树有着多层结构, 递归地拆开树+使用proc处理每一个子树+通过递归调用时生成的中, 课堂思考题, and 过滤表的元素."
  3473,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 使用符号数据, 实例","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA%28SICP%29/resources/ppt/chapter2_3.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.SE computer-science algorithms software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"计算机科学导论-SICP: 第二章构造过程抽象: 使用符号数据, 实例. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 71 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; software engineering. Sections: 使用符号数据; 实例:符号求导; 实例:集合的表示. Slides cover 第二章的学习思路, 2.3节讲了什么故事, 2.3节的PPT涉及哪些内容, 判断字符串的相同, (deriv expr1 var), 实现加法相关的过程, 求导过程中明显的冗余计算, (union-set set1 set2):合并两个表的元素,类似append, (intersection-set set1 set2), and 树的节点."
  3474,A Quick Tour of Cryptographic Protocols Zoo,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/10protocols.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR math.AG computer-science mathematics security-and-privacy algebraic-geometry schemes probabilistic-combinatorics slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"A Quick Tour of Cryptographic Protocols Zoo. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 48 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: Protocols; Three-Pass Protocol and Interlock Protocol; Pairing and Identity-Based Encryption; Blind/Group/Ring Signatures; Secret Sharing/Threshold Crytpography; Commitment Scheme; Zero Knowledge Proofs; Oblivious Transfer; Secure Multi-Party Computation and Homomorphic Enc.; End-to-End Voting; Quantum Cryptography. Slides cover What’s in the zoo?, Attacks against Protocols, The Man-In-The-Middle Attack, Bilinear Maps, Boneh-Franklin’s IBE Scheme, Group Signature, Secret Sharing, Zero-Knowledge Proof, ZKP and Commitment, and 1-out-of-2 Oblivious Transfer."
  3475,Theoretical Constructions of Pseudorandom Objects,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/5owf.pdf",github.com,cs.CC,cs.CC computer-science complexity-theory slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"Theoretical Constructions of Pseudorandom Objects. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 16 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: One-Way Functions; From OWF to PRP. Slides cover One-Way Functions (OWF), Definitions of OWF/OWP [Yao], Candidate One-Way Function, Examples, Hard-Core Predicates (HCP) [Blum-Micali], A HCP for Any OWF, PRG from OWP: Blum-Micali Generator, PRF from PRG [Goldreich, Goldwasser, Micali], PRP from PRF [Lucy, Rackoff], and Necessary Assumptions."
  3476,Public-Key Encryption Theory,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/8.1pubkey.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR computer-science security-and-privacy quiver-representations slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"Public-Key Encryption Theory. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 35 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: Definitions and Securities of Public-Key Encryption; Trapdoor Permutations; Security Against Chosen-Ciphertext Attacks; Public-Key Encryption from TDP in ROM. Slides cover Limitations of Private-Key Cryptography, Merkle Puzzles (Key Exchange W/O TTP), Alice and Bob [xkcd:177], Security against Eavesdroppers= CPA, Key Size Comparison, Security of Hybrid Encryption, Families of Functions, Examples, Proof, and Definition of Security Against CCA/CCA2."
  3477,RSA Problem and Encryption,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/8.2RSA.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR math.RT computer-science mathematics security-and-privacy quiver-representations algorithms number-theory survey book slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"RSA Problem and Encryption. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 33 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: RSA Problem; Attacks against ``Textbook RSA'' Encryption; RSA Encryption in Practice. Slides cover RSA Overview, Primes and Modular Arithmetic, N Group, Arithmetic algorithms, Permutation by Group Exponentiation Function, The RSA Problem Is Hard, Generating RSA Problem, Constructing Trap-Door Permutations, Recall “Textbook RSA”, and A Quadratic Improvement in Recoveringm."
  3478,Diffie-Hellman Problem and Cryptography,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/8.3DH.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR math.AG math.NT computer-science mathematics security-and-privacy algebraic-geometry algorithms elliptic-curves survey slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"Diffie-Hellman Problem and Cryptography. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 32 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: Cyclic Groups and Discrete Logrithms; Diffie-Hellman Assumptions and Applications; The ElGamal Encryption Scheme; Elliptic Curve Cryptography. Slides cover Cyclic Groups and Generators, Overview of Discrete Logarithm Algorithms, Generating Prime-Order (Sub)Groups inZ∗, Secure Key-Exchange Experiment, Proof of Security in DH Key-Exchange Protocol, Triparties Key Exchange, Lemma on Perfectly-secret Private-key Encryption, Example of ElGamal Encryption, Proof (Cont.), and CCA in ElGamal Encryption."
  3479,Digital Signature,"https://github.com/YuZhang/cryptography/blob/master/pdf/9digital-sig.pdf",github.com,math.AG,math.AG cs.CR mathematics computer-science algebraic-geometry schemes security-and-privacy survey book slides github,Yu Zhang,2022,null,"Digital Signature. Beamer slides by Yu Zhang, 2022; 33 pages. From a repository described as: Yu Zhang, Harbin Insitute of Technology, 2011, 2012, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024. Sections: Definitions of Digital Signatures; RSA Signatures; Digital Signature from The Discrete-Log Problem; One-Time Signature and Signature from Hash; Certificates and Public-Key Infrastructures. Slides cover Digital Signatures – An Overview, Defining Signature Security, Insecurity of “Textbook RSA”, Schnorr Identification Scheme, Schnorr Signature Scheme by Fiat-Shamir Transform, Security of DSS/DSA, One-Time Signature, Example of Lamport’s OTS, Stateful Signature Scheme, and “Tree-Based” Signatures."
  3480,"Методы оптимизации Лекция 1: Введение. Выпуклые множества","https://github.com/amkatrutsa/optimization-fivt/blob/master/Fall2022/01-IntroConvSets/lecture1.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG cs.DS cs.PL mathematics computer-science optimization algorithms programming-languages slides github,null,2022,null,"Методы оптимизации Лекция 1: Введение. Выпуклые множества. Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 129 pages, in Russian. Part of Optimization methods, Department of Innovation and High Technologies: 1. Introduction. Subject (translated): optimization; programming languages. Slides cover О чём этот курс?, Организационные вопросы, Зачем этот курс?, Постановка задачи, История развития, Линейное программирование (linear programming), Задача наименьших квадратов (linear least squares, Сжатие: real problem, Почему выпуклость так важна?, Структура задачи, Пересечение выпуклых множеств, Арифметические операции над выпуклыми множествами, and Дробно-линейное отображение."
