  3539,Clustering - Victor Kitov (yandexdataschool/MLatImperial2022),"https://github.com/yandexdataschool/MLatImperial2022/blob/main/Lectures/23-Clustering.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"Clustering - Victor Kitov (yandexdataschool/MLatImperial2022). Beamer lecture slides, 2022; 42 pages. Part of Machine Learning & Deep Learning Course at ICL: Alternatively you can open Seminars/00-Welcome.ipynb locally on your computer via Jupyter notebook. Sections: Clustering introduction; Representative-based clustering; Hierarchical clustering; Outlier filtering. Subsections include Top-down hierarchical clustering, Bottom-up hierarchical clustering, and DBScan. Slides cover Aim of clustering, Comments, Example of K-means, K-means for data without clusters, Hierarchical clustering may be, Top-down hierarchical clustering, Bottom-up hierarchical clustering, DBScan, and Isolation forest."
  3540,"Monitores: Chapter 6: Mon Extra","https://gitlab.com/A_sousa/hso_uporto_lectures/-/blob/main/%5BSOPE%202022%5D%20Sistemas%20Operativos/teoricas/ch06_mon_extra.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems book slides gitlab,Carlos Baquero @ FEUP,2022,null,"Monitores: Chapter 6: Mon Extra. Beamer lecture slides by Carlos Baquero @ FEUP, 2022; 22 pages, in Portuguese. Subject (translated): operating systems. Slides cover Problemas com semáforos, Exemplo: bounded-buffer como monitor, Notas, Variáveis de condição – condition variables, Operações sobre variáveis de condição (monitores clássicos), Exemplo: implementar semáforos com monitores, Produtor-consumidor com bounded-buffer como monitor, Continuação da execução de signal e wait, Semáforos via monitores; revisitado, Bounded-buffer com monitores; revisitado, Execução a seguir a um signal, Monitores clássicos, and Diferentes variantes de monitores."
