  4328,"Структурированное обучение: Structured","https://github.com/yandexdataschool/nlp_course/blob/2026/resources/_under_construction/19/week07_structured/structured.pdf",github.com,cs.CL,cs.CL cs.LG cs.AI cs.DS computer-science large-language-models algorithms machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"Структурированное обучение: Structured. Beamer lecture slides, 2019; 197 pages, in Russian. Part of YSDA Natural Language Processing course: week02 Language Modeling - Lecture: Language Modeling: what does it mean? Left-to-right framework. Subject (translated): machine learning. Sections: Деревья зависимостей; Transition-based parsing; ML for transition-based parsing; Структурированное обучение; Итоги. Slides cover План, Далее,, Где еще, Машинное обучение, Perceptron algorithm, Проблемы, Exact inference, Beam search, Max-violation, and Dynamic oracle."
