  4644,Summary - Victor Kitov,"https://github.com/yandexdataschool/MLatImperial2018/blob/master/Lectures/14-Summary.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning slides github,null,2018,null,"Summary - Victor Kitov. Beamer lecture slides, 2018; 15 pages. From a repository described as: You can run this repository on https://everware.ysda.yandex.net (if you have account) by clicking the button above. Sections: Data preprocessing; Supervised prediction methods; Extensions; Evaluation. Slides cover Method types, Data visualization, Common issues, Metric methods, Linear methods, Rule-based methods, Generalizations, Ensembles, General concepts, and Classi er evaluation."
