  4814,Image enhancement - Preparing the images for analysis,"https://github.com/Quantitative-Big-Imaging/Quantitative-Big-Imaging-2017/blob/master/Lectures/02-Slides-ImageEnhancement.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis lecture-notes slides problem-list github,A. Kaestner,2017,null,"Image enhancement - Preparing the images for analysis. Beamer lecture slides by A. Kaestner, 2017; 80 pages. From a repository described as: Here are the lectures, exercises, and additional course materials corresponding to the spring semester 2016 course at ETH Zurich, 227-0966-00L: Quantitative Big Imaging. Sections: Noise and Artifacts; Basic filtering; Scale spaces; Verification. Subsections include Real images are noisy, Artifacts, Real space filters, Basic filters, Frequency space filters, Wavelets, Parameterized scale spaces, Filtering as a regularization problem, Non-local means, and How good is my filter?. Slides cover 3D and 4D imaging produce large amounts of data, Measurements are rarely perfect, Noise types, A type of outlier noise, Signal to noise ratio, Numerical artifacts, What is a filter?, Low-pass filter kernels, Euclidean separability, and Filter example: Spot cleaning."
  4815,"沙漠商队旅行问题: Voronoi","https://github.com/Salensoft/thu-cst-cracker/blob/master/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8B/%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%282%29/hw/%E5%9B%BE%E8%AE%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%C2%A0/voronoi.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS math.CO computer-science mathematics algorithms combinatorics graph-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2017,null,"沙漠商队旅行问题: Voronoi. Beamer slides, 2017; 14 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Salensoft/thu-cst-cracker. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory; algorithms and data structures. Sections: Problem; Definition; Properties; Solution. Subsections include Delaunay Triangulation, and Voronoi Diagram. Slides cover 在沙漠中有n 个绿洲。有时商队从一个绿洲到另一个绿洲。假, Delaunay Triangulation, Voronoi Diagram, 对于给定的P,DT(P) 和VD(P) 是唯一的, 回忆一下Kruskal 算法,该算法首先将边按照边权从小到大排, 一个平面点集的MST 例子如下图所示, and Voronoi diagram - Wikipedia."
