  5047,Separating and Supporting Hyperplanes,"https://github.com/Hsins/NTU-Courses/blob/main/2016%20Fall/CommE5050%20-%20Convex%20Optimization/handout/03_Convex-Sets-%28III%29-Convex-Functions-%28I%29.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC math.MG mathematics convex-analysis slides github,null,2016,null,"Separating and Supporting Hyperplanes. Beamer slides, 2016; 53 pages. Part of NTU Courses: Materials (slide, handout, homework, cheatsheet.) of the courses I took or audited at National Taiwan University. Sections: Separating and Supporting Hyperplanes; Dual Cones; Convex Functions – Basics. Subsections include Separating hyperplane theorem, Supporting Hyperplanes, Definitions and Basic Properties, Dual generalized inequalities, Minimum and minimal elements via dual inequalities, Definition, First-Order Conditions, Second-Order Conditions, and Examples. Slides cover Separating Hyperplane Theorem, Separating Hyperplane Theorem – Proof, Strict Separation of Convex Sets, Theorem of alternatives for strict linear inequalities, Supporting Hyperplane Theorem, and Definition."
