  5110,"Boosting: Part 7: B Boosting","https://github.com/davidrosenberg/mlcourse/blob/gh-pages/Archive/2016/Lectures/7b.boosting.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2016,null,"Boosting: Part 7: B Boosting. Beamer lecture slides, 2016; 38 pages. From the course-materials archive davidrosenberg/mlcourse. Sections: Boosting Introduction; AdaBoost; Test Performance of Boosting; Boosting Fits an Additive Model; Robustness and AdaBoost; Population Minimizer. Slides cover Ensembles: Parallel vs Sequential, The Boosting Question: Weak Learners, AdaBoost: Setting, AdaBoost - Rough Sketch, AdaBoost: Classifier Weights, Adaboost: Example Reweighting, AdaBoost with Decision Stumps, AdaBoost: Does it actually minimize training error?, Typical Train / Test Learning Curves, and Adaptive Basis Function Model."
  5111,"Gradient Boosting, Continued","https://github.com/davidrosenberg/mlcourse/blob/gh-pages/Archive/2016/Lectures/8.Lab.more-boosting.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR math.ST stat.ME mathematics statistics probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2016,null,"Gradient Boosting, Continued. Beamer lecture slides, 2016; 16 pages. From the course-materials archive davidrosenberg/mlcourse. Sections: Review: Gradient Boosting; Gradient Tree Boosting; GBM Regression with Stumps; Variations on Gradient Boosting. Slides cover The Gradient Boosting Machine, Unconstrained Functional Gradient Stepping, Projected Functional Gradient Stepping, The Gradient Boosting Machine: Recap, Common form of gradient boosting machine takes, Sinc Function: Our Dataset, Fitting with Ensemble of Decision Stumps, Step Size as Regularization, Stochastic Gradient Boosting, and Column / Feature Subsampling for Regularization."
