  5132,"Inference and Representation: An Odyssey","https://github.com/joanbruna/infrep17/blob/master/labs/lab14/Lab14.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,Rahul G. Krishnan,2016,null,"Inference and Representation: An Odyssey. Beamer slides by Rahul G. Krishnan, 2016; 23 pages. Part of Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569). Sections: What else is there in ML?; The grand finale. Subsections include Autoencoding, Course Review, and Debugging ML models. Slides cover Application Specific Techniques, Semi-supervised learning, and Domain Adaptation (Covariate Shift)."
