  5134,"Inference and Representation: Bayesian Networks: Lab3","https://github.com/joanbruna/infrep17/blob/master/labs/lab3/Lab3.pdf",github.com,math.ST,math.ST stat.ME math.PR mathematics statistics probability slides github,Rahul G. Krishnan,2016,null,"Inference and Representation: Bayesian Networks: Lab3. Beamer slides by Rahul G. Krishnan, 2016; 26 pages. Part of Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569). Sections: Parameterizing Conditional Probabilities; ML estimation; Structure Learning; Markov Random Fields. Slides cover Parameterizations of Conditional Probability, Logistic Regression, Deep Convolutional Network, Noisy-Or Parameterization, Learning Bayesian networks, Suppose that we know the Bayesian network structure G, We have the closed form ML solution, Regularization as Bayesian Inference, and Normal Priors as L2 Regularization."
