  5136,"Inference and Representation: Latent Dirichlet Allocation","https://github.com/joanbruna/infrep17/blob/master/labs/lab5/Lab5.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning slides github,Rahul G. Krishnan,2016,null,"Inference and Representation: Latent Dirichlet Allocation. Beamer slides by Rahul G. Krishnan, 2016; 14 pages. Part of Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569). Sections: Latent Dirichlet Allocation; Variants of LDA; Ask what your topic models can do for you. Slides cover LDA (Blei et. al), Generative Model, Choosing K, Author-topic model (Rosen-Zvi et al., UAI ’04), Most likely author for a topic, Perplexity as a function of number of observed words, Adding supervision to LDA, Supervised Topic Models, Evaluation, and Design Question."
