  5141,Matrix 5 (oneman233/seu-master),"https://github.com/oneman233/seu-master/blob/main/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5ppt/matrix%205.pdf",github.com,math.RA,math.RA math.NA mathematics linear-algebra slides github,null,2016,null,"Matrix 5 (oneman233/seu-master). Beamer slides, 2016; 111 pages. From a repository described as: 项目的起因是我厌倦了网上各种收费的东南大学课程资料,于是希望做一个开源的仓库出来,这里的一切资料都可以自由使用和分享,但我并不拥有相关版权。. Sections: 向量范数; 矩阵范数; 收敛定理; 矩阵函数; 线性微分方程组. Subsections include 长度与范数, Cn上的范数, V上的范数, 序列的收敛性, 矩阵p范数, 相容性, 算子范数, 三个重要的算子范数, 矩阵序列的收敛性, and 幂序列."
  5142,"Concurrent Join Calculus in Scala: Join Calculus Talk 2016","https://github.com/winitzki/talks/blob/master/join_calculus/join_calculus_talk_2016.pdf",github.com,math.CA,math.CA cs.DC cs.LO mathematics computer-science real-analysis concurrency formalization operating-systems survey slides talk github,Sergei Winitzki,2016,null,"Concurrent Join Calculus in Scala: Join Calculus Talk 2016. Beamer talk slides by Sergei Winitzki (Scala by the Bay 2016), 2016; 28 pages. Part of Talk slides for various meetup presentations: Abstract: I give an introduction to Join calculus, a declarative formalism for concurrent programming. Join Calculus is a development of Pi-calculus that is higher-level and easier to use in practice. Slides cover What is \"Join Calculus\"?, Parallelism vs. Asynchrony vs. Concurrency, Concurrency vs. Parallelism vs. Asynchrony, Dining philosophers, Problems with concurrency, How I learned to forget deadlocks and to love concurrency, Join Calculus: The new hope, Join Calculus: The genesis, Join Calculus in a nutshell, Example: concurrent counter, Using JoinRun: basic features, Using JoinRun: more features, JoinRun: Examples I, and JoinRun: Examples II."
  5143,"Logic programming and types: An introduction to Mercury","https://github.com/winitzki/talks/blob/master/mercury/mercury-talk.pdf",github.com,math.LO,math.LO math.CA cs.PL mathematics computer-science mathematical-logic real-analysis programming-languages concurrency survey slides talk github,Sergei Winitzki,2016,null,"Logic programming and types: An introduction to Mercury. Beamer talk slides by Sergei Winitzki, 2016; 14 pages. Part of Talk slides for various meetup presentations: Abstract: I give an introduction to Join calculus, a declarative formalism for concurrent programming. Join Calculus is a development of Pi-calculus that is higher-level and easier to use in practice. Slides cover Logic programming as a DSL for logic puzzles (Prolog), Logic programming refresher, Mercury in a nutshell: a Prolog dialect with static types, Modes, determinism, types, I/O, Example: integer factorial, Static determinism analysis, Functions and expressions, Algebraic types and polymorphism, Example: “reversible computation”, Type classes à la Haskell, No higher-kinded types, and Limitations of Mercury."
