  5215,20pt CodeChef题目选讲,"https://github.com/huzecong/oi-slides/blob/master/2014-codechef-problems/slide.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides github,"THU CST 胡泽聪 Email:",2015,null,"20pt CodeChef题目选讲. Beamer slides by THU CST 胡泽聪 Email:, 2015; 103 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 本仓库收集了我从2013至2018年的所有信息学竞赛讲课课件。本科期间靠讲课~~骗~~挣了一些钱,但考虑到之后大概不会再出去讲课,受 Trinkle23897/oislides 启发,在此公开。. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Sections: Warmup; Average; Intermediate; Hard. Subsections include About the problems, June Challenge 2013 - Little Elephant and Mouse, September Challenge 2013 - Merciless Chef, January Challenge 2014 - Meteor, March Lunchtime 2014 - A Game With a Sheet of Paper, August Challenge 2013 - Sereja and Ballons, May Lunchtime 2014 - Brand New Game, December Challenge 2013 - Lucy and the Flowers, February Challenge 2014 - Little Elephant and Movies, and July Cook-Off 2014 - Tree Again. Slides cover 关于题目, LEMOUSE, LEMOUSE - Solution, MLCHEF, MLCHEF - Solution, METEORAK, METEORAK - Solution, SHGAME, SHGAME - Solution, and SEABAL."
  5216,"Outline: Introduction: Ppts Ss Chapt3","https://github.com/j10ccc/zjut-icicles/blob/main/%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%8E%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FA%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%8C%E8%AF%AD%EF%BC%89/Slides/ppts_ss_chapt3.pdf",github.com,math.CA,math.CA mathematics harmonic-analysis slides github,null,2015,null,"Outline: Introduction: Ppts Ss Chapt3. Beamer slides, 2015; 74 pages. Part of zjut-icicles 浙江工业大学课程攻略共享计划: 初入浙江工业大学的你们是否对未来感到迷茫,面对种种纷繁复杂的课程是否手足无措? - 内向的你是否羡慕社牛同学从学长学姐那儿找到各种课程资料,担心自己从起跑线就卷不过他们?. Sections: Fourier series; Discrete-time FS; Why transformed?; Fourier transform; Discrete-time FT; FS and FT."
