  5304,"Fractional Occupation Numbers: Early Thoughts","https://gitlab.com/mussard/talks_and_notes/-/blob/master/doc/talk_201501.pdf",gitlab.com,math.RA,math.RA math.NA mathematics linear-algebra slides talk gitlab,null,2015,null,"Fractional Occupation Numbers: Early Thoughts. Beamer talk slides, 2015; 14 pages. From a repository described as: You will find all talks, notes and posters I produced during my successive academic jobs. Slides cover Remember, Daily work, Fractional Occupation Numbers : Motivation (some failures of Exc[n]), Fractional Occupation Numbers : Origins, Flat-plane condition, ◮49 atomisation energies, and SCF (simple change in the density matrix)."
