  5782,Nexa mot Bitcoin og Ethereum,"https://gitlab.com/jQrgen/nexa-presentations/-/blob/main/docs/nexa-vs-bitcoin-ethereum/Nexa-vs-Bitcoin-Ethereum-NO.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.CL,cs.CL cs.AI cs.LG math.CT computer-science mathematics large-language-models topos-theory slides gitlab,null,2026,null,"Nexa mot Bitcoin og Ethereum. Slides (PDF), 2026; 20 pages, in Dutch. Part of Presentations, talks, articles and papers: Live site: https://jqrgen.github.io/presentations/. Slides cover Kritikken av krypto er stort sett riktig, I stor skala er Nexa inntil 13 000× mer energieffektiv enn Bitcoin, Samme joule, ulik nevner, NTNU-forskning: den grønneste kilowattimen er den du aldri trenger, Ingen spesialbygd maskinvare, ingen fjell av e-avfall, Rettferdig start: null premine, null ICO, null venturekapital, Skala: 42 000 transaksjoner i sekundet på dagens maskinvare, Betalinger som føles som Vipps: under to sekunder, rundt 3 NEXA, Tokens og NFT-er er bygget inn i protokollen, ikke skrudd på utenpå, Utstedelsesretten er også en mynt: autoritetsbatonger, Open outcry-handel over CAPD: rop ut et tilbud, hvem som helst kan, Token Secrets: selg hemmeligheten sammen med tokenet, Hva du kan bygge med det: praktiske bruksområder, and Smartkontrakter uten EVM."
  5783,Nexa vs Bitcoin and Ethereum,"https://gitlab.com/jQrgen/nexa-presentations/-/blob/main/docs/nexa-vs-bitcoin-ethereum/Nexa-vs-Bitcoin-Ethereum.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.CL,cs.CL cs.AI cs.LG cond-mat.str-el computer-science physics large-language-models condensed-matter databases topos-theory slides gitlab,null,2026,null,"Nexa vs Bitcoin and Ethereum. Slides (PDF), 2026; 20 pages. Part of Presentations, talks, articles and papers: Live site: https://jqrgen.github.io/presentations/. Slides cover The critique of crypto is mostly right, At scale, Nexa is up to 13,000× more energy efficient than Bitcoin, Same joules, different denominator, NTNU Norway research: the greenest kilowatt-hour is the one you, No single-purpose hardware, no mountain of e-waste, Fair launch: zero premine, zero ICO, zero venture capital, Scale: 42,000 transactions per second on today's hardware, Payments that feel like Vipps: under two seconds, about 3 NEXA, Tokens and NFTs are built into the protocol, not bolted on, Minting rights are coins too: authority batons, Open outcry trading over CAPD: shout an offer, anyone can take it, Token Secrets: sell the secret together with the token, What you can build with it: practical use cases, and Smart contracts without the EVM."
  5784,"Presentations, talks, articles and papers, Patch","https://gitlab.com/jQrgen/nexa-presentations/-/blob/main/docs/talks/files/patch.pdf",gitlab.com,math.CT,math.CT math.LO mathematics topos-theory slides talk gitlab,null,2026,null,"Presentations, talks, articles and papers, Patch. Talk slides (PDF), 2026; 13 pages. From a repository described as: Live site: https://jqrgen.github.io/presentations/. Sections: Patch; Ready to conquer the world; The idea; Approach; What went wrong?; What did we learn?; Where is the team now?; What was the project/the idea?; What went wrong? (2); What Could you do differently/what did you learn?; I love the Patch team. Slides cover “MyStory before snapchat launched MyStory”, People, and Patch: “Social sharing for a group for friends” <- (Worst slogan ever)."
