  5889,"Machine: Learning: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures, Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures","https://github.com/DerAndr/machine_learning_course_basics/blob/main/lectures/lecture_01_eda/slides/lecture.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning large-language-models numerical-analysis lecture-notes book slides github,Andrey Holz,2025,null,"Machine: Learning: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures, Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures. Lecture slides (PDF) by Andrey Holz, 2025; 64 pages. Part of Machine Learning Course: An introductory machine learning course with connected textbook pages, focused interactive reviews, lecture notes and slides, and hands-on notebooks. Sections: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures; Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures; Слайд 3, Agenda; Слайд 4, Data Analytics pipeline: CRISP-DM; Слайд 5; Слайд 6, What is EDA ?; Слайд 7, What is the purpose of EDA?; Слайд 8, Key points of EDA; Слайд 9, Data Types and Basic Analysis; Слайд 10, Most common types of data; Слайд 11, Key Statistical Measures in EDA (numerical data); Слайд 12, Zero skewness. Slides cover Machine, Data Analytics pipeline: CRISP-DM, Key points, Zero skewness, How to calculate statistics?, Pay attention to, UNIVARIATE ANALYSIS, KDE (Kernel Density Estimation), Box plot &, and Bivariate Analysis."
  5890,"Machine Learning Lectures: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures, Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures","https://github.com/DerAndr/machine_learning_course_basics/blob/main/lectures/lecture_06_classification_part_2/slides/lecture.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning constructive-mathematics lecture-notes survey book slides github,Andrey Holz,2025,null,"Machine Learning Lectures: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures, Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures. Lecture slides (PDF) by Andrey Holz, 2025; 53 pages. Part of Machine Learning Course: An introductory machine learning course with connected textbook pages, focused interactive reviews, lecture notes and slides, and hands-on notebooks. Sections: Слайд 1, Machine Learning Lectures; Слайд 2, Machine Learning Lectures; Слайд 3, Common Challenges for Classification Tasks; Слайд 4, Agenda; Слайд 5, Binary Imbalanced Classification; Слайд 6, Introduction to Binary Imbalance; Слайд 7, Evaluation Metrics for Imbalanced Binary Classification; Слайд 8, Why ROC AUC is Good for Imbalanced Data; Слайд 9, Why Precision-Recall Curve is Good for Imbalanced Data; Слайд 10, Techniques to Address Imbalance; Слайд 11, Oversampling & Undersampling; Слайд 12, Synthetic Minority Oversampling Technique (SMOTE). Slides cover Machine, Common Challenges for Classification Tasks, Evaluation Metrics for Imbalanced Binary Classification, Techniques to Address Imbalance, Choosing Between Oversampling and Undersampling, Live Coding, Understanding Multiclass Classification, Multiclass Classification Evaluation Metrics, Micro-Averaging, and Evaluation Metrics for Multilabel Classification."
  5891,学习要求,"https://github.com/ElderMedic/openHZAU/blob/master/%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E3%80%8A%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E3%80%8B%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6%28%E5%90%AB%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%29-by%20Huang%20F/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%A0%20%E7%9C%9F%E6%A0%B8%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9-2025%E6%98%A5.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability slides github,null,2025,null,"学习要求. Slides (PDF), 2025; 83 pages, in Chinese. Part of Project openHZAU: 在圣埃克苏佩里的童话里,小王子遇到了一个收集星星只为能够买更多星星的生意人。小王子对此疑惑不解。小王子只拥有一朵花,他每天都给它浇水。他还有三座火山,他每天都会打扫。“我拥有火山和花,我对我的火山有用处,对我的花也有用处”,他说,“但是你对你拥有的星星并没有用处”。. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 学习要求, 第一节 真菌的一般形态, 三、 酵母状细胞, 花中四君子, 酵母菌的无性繁殖, 真菌有性孢子的类型, 3、子囊孢子, 担子菌双核菌丝的锁状联合, 真菌的繁殖小结, 真菌类别, (三)壶菌门, 匍枝根霉(R. stolonifer)生活史, 2、脉孢菌属(Neurospora), and 题目:虫草素通过“劫持”细菌的腺苷激酶而杀死结核分枝杆菌."
  5892,"微生物学基础: Fundamental of Microbiology","https://github.com/ElderMedic/openHZAU/blob/master/%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E3%80%8A%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E3%80%8B%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6%28%E5%90%AB%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%29-by%20Huang%20F/%E7%BB%AA%E8%AE%BA-2025%E6%98%A5.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics slides github,null,2025,null,"微生物学基础: Fundamental of Microbiology. Slides (PDF), 2025; 47 pages, in Chinese. Part of Project openHZAU: 在圣埃克苏佩里的童话里,小王子遇到了一个收集星星只为能够买更多星星的生意人。小王子对此疑惑不解。小王子只拥有一朵花,他每天都给它浇水。他还有三座火山,他每天都会打扫。“我拥有火山和花,我对我的火山有用处,对我的花也有用处”,他说,“但是你对你拥有的星星并没有用处”。. Sections: 幻灯片 2: 你认为该怎么学习本课程呢?; 幻灯片 6: 考核方式及成绩评定; 幻灯片 47: 课后作业. Slides cover 你认为该怎么学习本课程呢?, 以组为单位进行小组讨论,撰写课程论文,字, 学习助手, 中国大学慕课MOOC,官网或手机App,直接搜索, What are microorganism?, 微生物的特点(characteristics), 微生物学的发展历史, 初创期:微生物形态认识时期, “自然发生”学说, and 巴氏消毒法."
  5893,"微生物学基础实验: 共七次课","https://github.com/ElderMedic/openHZAU/blob/master/%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E3%80%8A%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E3%80%8B%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6%28%E5%90%AB%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%29-by%20Huang%20F/1%E9%9D%A9%E5%85%B0%E6%B0%8F%E6%9F%93%E8%89%B2-%E9%BB%84%E5%87%A42025.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization slides github,null,2025,null,"微生物学基础实验: 共七次课. Slides (PDF), 2025; 18 pages, in Chinese. Part of Project openHZAU: 在圣埃克苏佩里的童话里,小王子遇到了一个收集星星只为能够买更多星星的生意人。小王子对此疑惑不解。小王子只拥有一朵花,他每天都给它浇水。他还有三座火山,他每天都会打扫。“我拥有火山和花,我对我的火山有用处,对我的花也有用处”,他说,“但是你对你拥有的星星并没有用处”。. Subject (translated): optimization. Sections: 幻灯片 1: 微生物学基础实验; 幻灯片 2: 实验课成绩组成; 幻灯片 3: 虚拟仿真实验(约4学时); 幻灯片 5: 实验课注意事项; 幻灯片 6: 实验一 细菌的革兰氏染色; 幻灯片 18: 优秀实验报告范例. Slides cover 实验课成绩组成, 虚拟仿真实验(约4学时), 1、理论课上学完原核微生物的分离(第二章内容)后2周内, 实验课注意事项, 实验一 细菌的革兰氏染色, 革兰氏染色法之所以能将细菌分为革兰氏阳性菌(G+)与, 结晶紫初染, 细胞壁中肽聚糖层厚且交联度高,, 三、实验菌种, and 四、试剂及染料."
