  5897,"Part 6: 理论构造PRP (HITLittleZheng/HITCS)","https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E5%AD%A6/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90/%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E5%AD%A6%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86-2025%E7%A7%8B-%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/06-1%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0PRP.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR computer-science security-and-privacy lecture-notes slides github,null,2025,null,"Part 6: 理论构造PRP (HITLittleZheng/HITCS). Slides (PDF), 2025; 14 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): cryptography. Slides cover 单向函数(One-Way Function), 单向函数(One-Way Functions), OWF定义, 候选单向函数, 课堂练习, 必要的假设, 核心断言(Hard-core predicate), 任意单向函数存在核心断言, 从OWP到PRG, 从PRG到PRF, 从PRF到PRP, and 本节小结."
