  6525,Exceptions,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/02.%20%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"Exceptions. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 27 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): operating systems. Slides cover Topic, 处理器其实只做了一件事情, 截止目前:我们已经知道两种改变, 计算机系统的各层次上都存在异常控制流, 一个异常是为了响应某个事件(即处理器状态的改变)而将控制权转移到操作系统内核, Exception Table, 由处理器外部的事件引起, 由执行指令发生的事件引起的, X86-64/Linux 系统调用, 系统调用举例:打开文件, 故障异常举例:缺页故障, 故障异常举例:无效内存引用, and Processes."
