  6527,信号和非本地跳转,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/04.%20%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%92%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC.pdf",github.com,eess.SP,eess.SP electrical-engineering signal-processing lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"信号和非本地跳转. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 50 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): signal processing. Slides cover Topic, 命令解释器, 内核通过更新目标进程的上下文中的某些状态向目标进程发送(传递)信号, 在每个进程的上下文中,都会维护标识信号挂起和阻塞的位向量, 按下Ctrl-C(Ctrl-Z)会导致内核, 接收信号的实现, 处理信号, 对信号处理程序的另一种视角, 临时阻塞信号, 如果函数是可重入的(例如,所有变量都存储在堆栈帧上)或者不会被信号中断,则该, 必须等待所有已终止的子进程, SIGCHLD信号处理函数, and 逻辑是正确的,但是性能很差(忙等待浪费CPU计算资源)."
  6528,地址翻译,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/06.%20%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"地址翻译. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 44 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Slides cover Topic, 虚拟地址空间, 地址翻译中用到的符号, 1. 处理器发送虚拟地址至MMU, 访问TLB, 多级页表, 举例:简单的内存系统, 案例研究:Core i7/Linux 内存系统, Core i7 第4级页表项, and 内存映射."
  6529,动态内存分配,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/07.%20%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"动态内存分配. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 75 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Topic, 基本概念, 隐式空闲链表, 显式空闲链表, 分离的空闲链表, 垃圾收集, and 与内存相关的错误."
  6530,用户空间I/O,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/08.%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4IO.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"用户空间I/O. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 49 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Topic, Linux文件是包含了m个字节的序列, 优雅地将文件映射到设备,使得内核能够提供一个简单的接口称为Unix I/O, 目录由一个链接数组组成, 打开文件将会通知内核你准备访问该文件, 写入文件将字节从内存复制到当前文件位置,然后更新当前文件位置, RIO包, Metadata, Sharing, and Redirection, and 标准I/O."
  6531,Network,"https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440168_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%802/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/10.%20%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,Li Youmeng,2024,null,"Network. Slides (PDF) by Li Youmeng, 2024; 34 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): computer networks. Slides cover 大多数网络应用基于客户端-服务器模型, 网络主机的硬件组织, 网络是一种由盒子和电线按照地理位置组织的分层系统, 覆盖一个建筑或是整个校园, 多个不兼容的局域网可以通过称为路由器(router)的专用计算机进行物理连接。, 如何在不兼容的局域网(LAN)和广域网(WAN)上发送数据?, 在互联网中传输协议封装后的数据, 最著名的互联网应用, 骨干网(Internet backbone ), 主机映射到一组32位的IP地址, 32位IP地址存储在一个IP地址结构体中。in_addr, IPv4地址空间被分为五种类型, 互联网在一个称为DNS的全球分布式数据库中维护着IP地址和域名之间, and 简单情况:域名和IP地址之间的一对一映射."
