  6594,"第三章: 并行计算范式与性能评估","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%BE/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/slide/2024_%E7%8E%8B%E5%BC%BA_%E6%96%BD%E5%B0%91%E6%80%80/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B3-%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E8%8C%83%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.AR cs.PF computer-science high-performance-computing computer-architecture slides github,null,2024,null,"第三章: 并行计算范式与性能评估. Slides (PDF), 2024; 41 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): parallel computing; computer architecture. Slides cover } 并行编程模型(Parallel Programming Models), 程序(Program) vs. 进程(Process) vs. 线程(Thread), 并行硬件上的并行编程模型, 共享内存模型(线程), 编程模型与执行模型, 混合模型, 多程序多数据模型(MPMD), 局部性原理(Locality), C/C++数组在内存中的布局, 局部性原理示例2, 了解问题和程序, 了解问题- 示例, 并行程序设计的要素, and 性能度量."
  6595,"第四章: 基于OpenMP的并行编程","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%BE/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/slide/2024_%E7%8E%8B%E5%BC%BA_%E6%96%BD%E5%B0%91%E6%80%80/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B4-%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8EOpenMP%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture slides github,null,2024,null,"第四章: 基于OpenMP的并行编程. Slides (PDF), 2024; 53 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover } 基于OpenMP的并行编程, } 针对多任务的多线程使你的计算机可以同时, 常用Linux 命令, OpenMP的发展历程, OpenMP组件, OpenMP指令, 第一个基于OpenMP实现的版本, 基于OpenMP的梯形法则程序, 如果按下面这种方式使用,就没有临界区了!, 归约操作, OpenMP指令- Parallel For, and } 要求程序员指定程序块中每个变量的作用域。."
