  7834,"Software Containers: Hands-on","https://github.com/CSSE6400/software-architecture/blob/main/public/resources/containers-tutorial.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"Software Containers: Hands-on. Tutorial slides (PDF), 2022; 16 pages. Part of Software Architecture: This repository hosts the course material for the Software Architecture course (CSSE6400) at the University of Queensland. Slides cover If docker installed on your computer: If docker not installed, Docker caches the images locally So, running it again, will be faster!, Clean up docker images, Clean-up via Docker Desktop, Let’s write our own docker file, For Linux distros (Ubuntu, etc), Our Dockerfile, Let’s build our own container, For those with Docker installed on Windows (No WSL), Let’s run our own container, First, exit the container with CTRL-D or CTRL-C, and Then we need to tag the image with our docker username."
