  7862,Introduction to Computer Systems,"https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%93%88%E5%B7%A5%E5%A4%A7%E8%AE%A1%E7%BB%9F%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FPPT/ch08-2-%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81-%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%9D%9E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC-2022.04.12.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems lecture-notes survey slides github,null,2022,null,"Introduction to Computer Systems. Slides (PDF), 2022; 58 pages. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Slides cover Linux 进程体系."
  7863,"Introduction to Computer Systems: 主要内容 (HITLittleZheng/HITCS)","https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%93%88%E5%B7%A5%E5%A4%A7%E8%AE%A1%E7%BB%9F%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FPPT/ch09-1%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98-%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B504.20.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes survey slides github,Zheng Guibin,2022,null,"Introduction to Computer Systems: 主要内容 (HITLittleZheng/HITCS). Slides (PDF) by Zheng Guibin, 2022; 42 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 主要内容, 数字图像帧(digital picture frame)等, 现代服务器、笔记本、智能电话等, 地址空间, DRAM 缓存的组织结构完全是由巨大的不命中开销, Page fault缺页: 引用虚拟内存中的字,不在物理内, 页面不命中导致缺页(缺页异常), 分配一个新的虚拟内存页(VP5)。, 核心思想: 每个进程都拥有一个独立的虚拟地址空间, 虚拟地址空间, 地址翻译:页面命中, 页表条目(PTEs) 与其他内存数据字一样缓存在L1中, TLB 不命中, and 使用K级页表的地址翻译."
  7864,"计算机网络复习教程: Ywy_c_asm","https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/%E8%AE%A1%E7%BD%91%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0/%E5%90%88%E8%AE%A2%E6%9C%AC-%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,Yan Weiye,2022,null,"计算机网络复习教程: Ywy_c_asm. Slides (PDF) by Yan Weiye, 2022; 62 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): computer networks. Slides cover 本教程是2022年秋季学期哈工大计算学部金牌讲师团为2020级的计算机网络课程所开设的期末, 关于物理层, 快速使用指南, 3.分组交换的时间量分析, 6.HTTP协议, 9.DNS协议, 12.UDP协议, 15.SR协议, 17.TCP动态控制机制-拥塞窗口的维护(重点), 21.IP地址划分, 24.ICMP协议, 27.链路层概述, 以太网是最主要的有线局域网技术,提供无连接服务,可使用基于同轴电缆的总线型结构, and 35.PPP协议."
  7865,最优化方法,"https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E7%94%9F%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%28%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E7%89%88%29/%E7%BB%84%E5%90%88%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E5%87%B8%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E6%9D%A8%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E7%9A%84KKT%E7%9A%84PPT%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E5%87%B8%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%89.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"最优化方法. Slides (PDF), 2022; 49 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 有约束最优化方法, 问题 min f(x), 若(x*,y*)是条件极值,则存在λ* ,使, 特别地,有如下特征, 5.约束优化问题的二阶条件, 定理:(二阶充分条件), and 以x(k)为初始点,解."
  7866,"面向对象设计基础: 1.ADT","https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0-2022%E6%98%A5-%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%B2%E5%BA%A7-5_8.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL cs.SE computer-science programming-languages software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,Yan Weiye,2022,null,"面向对象设计基础: 1.ADT. Slides (PDF) by Yan Weiye, 2022; 20 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): software engineering; programming languages and compilers. Slides cover 1.ADT, 例子-简单字母集合, 2.类与接口, 3.方法规约(spec), 4.AF/RI/rep, 5.表示独立性与表示泄露, 6.继承与重写, 6.继承与重写-“我是什么类型”, 总结:Java中常用类的接口实现与继承, and 7.ADT的等价性与equals()."
  7867,"可复用性与可维护性: 可复用性与可维护性, 第 9 章 可复用性","https://github.com/HITLittleZheng/HITCS/blob/main/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0-2022%E6%98%A5-%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%B2%E5%BA%A7-9_12.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE computer-science software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"可复用性与可维护性: 可复用性与可维护性, 第 9 章 可复用性. Slides (PDF), 2022; 53 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HITLittleZheng/HITCS. Subject (translated): software engineering. Sections: 可复用性与可维护性; 第 9 章 可复用性; 软件复用的概念; Liskov 替换原则(LSP); 委托(delegation); 白盒框架与黑盒框架; 可维护性概念; 面向对象设计原则:SOLID; 正则表达式; 创建型模式; 结构型模式; 行为型模式. Slides cover 第9 章可复用性, 防止出现以下情况, 数组的子类型化, 组合与委托, 复合复用原则(CRP), 元字符和字符集简写, 基础匹配示例, 工厂模式, 装饰器模式, and 模板模式."
