  7984,01 Overview,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/01_overview%282%29.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR math.CT math.LO computer-science mathematics security-and-privacy topos-theory survey slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"01 Overview. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 32 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Learning Objectives, Prerequisites, Instructor, Attack & Defense, Security vs safety, Scope, Morris Worm, Microsoft Zune Crash, Programming Bug: Poker Site Flaw, People are making same mistakes, OpenSSL Heartbleeding, Complexity, Extensibility, and Topics."
  7985,03 Ret2libc,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_03_ret2libc.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR math-ph math.AG mathematics physics random-matrix-theory stacks slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"03 Ret2libc. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 55 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Review, What We Have Learnt So Far, Stack Canary, Runtime Mitigation: DEP (NX), Ret2libc without ASLR, A Vulnerable Program, Step I: Find the Address of the System Function, Step II: Find the String “/bin/sh”, Function Prologue and Epilogue, Ret2libc with ASLR, The Previous Attack Does Not Work Now, Global Offset Table, Two Views of an ELF File, and Dynamic Linking."
  7986,"ZJUCourse 课程资料整理, Rop","https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_04_rop.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR math-ph math.AG mathematics physics random-matrix-theory stacks slides github,null,2022,null,"ZJUCourse 课程资料整理, Rop. Lecture slides (PDF), 2022; 39 pages. From a repository described as: 浙江大学 20 级信息安全(图灵班)在读,分享一下本科期间学习笔记 - 大一主要还是纸质笔记,到大一下逐渐开始用 typora 记笔记,但是大部分都是以 PDF 的版本提供,因为当时笔者不知道如何将 Markdown 源文件的图片存为相对路径;大家如果需要整合进自己的笔记,推荐使用 Bob(Mac 可用),可以做到 OCR 识别文字;到大二下开始全面将笔记转到飞书,并采用飞书的个人知识库,同时开放复制,方便大家基于我的笔记基础上进行补充修改,并且因为共享文档的原因,大家可以对笔者的笔记异步进行评论和交流,如果笔者的笔记出现一些错误,欢迎纠正! -…. Slides cover Review, What We Have Learnt So Far, Runtime Mitigation: DEP (NX), How to Attack: Rethink the Stack Layout, Function Prologue and Epilogue, Code Injection vs Code Reuse, Code Reuse: ROP, Return-Oriented Programming, Normal Machine Instructions, and Code Reuse in General."
  7987,2022 09 Static Analysis,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_09_static_analysis.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics graph-theory slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"2022 09 Static Analysis. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 55 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Program Analysis, Question, Static Analysis, Control Flow Graph, Basic Block Example, Example: Leaders, Example: CFG, Depth First Traversal, Dominance, Example 2, Call Graph, Interprocedural CFG (ICFG), and Inlining."
  7988,2022 09 Symbolic Execution,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_09_symbolic_execution.pdf",github.com,math.CA,math.CA math-ph mathematics physics asymptotics-and-resummation slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"2022 09 Symbolic Execution. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 45 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Symbolic/Concolic Execution, Software has bug, Symbolic execution: a middle ground, Applications of Symbolic Execution, Early work on symbolic execution, Resurgence of Symbolic Execution, Three Challenges, Search Strategies: Random Search, Challenge 2: Complex Code and Environment, Concretization, Internal of Symbolic Executors: KLEE, Tool Design KLEE - Tracking Symbolic States, Install KLEE, and Compiling to LLVM bitcode."
  7989,2022 10 Fuzzing,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_10_fuzzing.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE computer-science software-engineering slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"2022 10 Fuzzing. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 50 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Testing, Fuzzing, Generating inputs for programs, Structured inputs, Generating better inputs for programs, Branch Coverage, Coverage wall, Example, Sanitizers, Undefined Behavior Sanitizer (UBSAN), Core of AFL, and Hands On: Fuzzing example."
  7990,Principles and Implementation,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_11_SFI.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.AR cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization computer-architecture survey slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"Principles and Implementation. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 76 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Isolation via Protection Domains, Example: the Separation between OS, Isolating Untrusted Components, The SFI Sandbox Setup, SFI Enforcement Overview, An Idealized Assembly Language, Optimization: Integrity-Only Isolation, Wait! What about Program, Guard Zones: Safe Accesses, Optimization: Redundant Check, Scratch Registers, Risk of Indirect Branches, Example, and Allow Only Controlled Interaction."
  7991,Control-Flow Integrity,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_11_cfi.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR math.CO math.LO computer-science mathematics graph-theory mathematical-logic security-and-privacy slides github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"Control-Flow Integrity. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 27 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Program control flow, Simple call graph, CFI is a security policy, Enforcing CFI by Instrumentation, CFI Instrumentation Code, Overhead, Limitation, CFI in real systems, and Control Flow Guard."
  7992,2022 Smart Contract,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022_12_smart_contract.pdf",github.com,cs.CR,cs.CR cs.DB cs.LO cs.CC computer-science computability databases security-and-privacy slides talk github,Yajin Zhou,2022,null,"2022 Smart Contract. Slides (PDF) by Yajin Zhou, 2022; 65 pages. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Slides cover Ethereum, Accounts and Wallets, Transactions: Fund Transfer Between EOA, Halting problem (infinite loop - consume resources) – reason for, Eth Gas Station, EVM: Ethereum Virtual Machine, Bytecode vs. Runtime Bytecode, Function Selectors: which function to call, Ethereum (In)security, Attacks I will talk about, The DAO Attack (Simplified Version), and Why This Attack Could Happen."
  7993,"创新与创业管理强化班: 第十一讲 控制","https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/ITP/%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6/itp%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022%20ITP%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC11%E8%AE%B2%E5%8F%8A%E5%8D%B3%E5%85%B4%E8%BE%A9%E8%AE%BA.pdf",github.com,math.ST,math.ST stat.ME mathematics statistics slides github,null,2022,null,"创新与创业管理强化班: 第十一讲 控制. Slides (PDF), 2022; 22 pages, in Chinese. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Subject (translated): statistics and statistical inference. Slides cover 情境领导模型, 主要理论, 喜欢谁的领导风格?, 为什么我们需要控制?, 权变因素, 控制过程流图, 创新与创业管理强化班, and 辩论赛-赛制."
  7994,吴晓波 教授 / 吴东 副教授,"https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5%E5%A4%8F/ITP/%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6/itp%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2022%20ITP%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC4%E8%AE%B2.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning slides github,null,2022,null,"吴晓波 教授 / 吴东 副教授. Slides (PDF), 2022; 39 pages, in Chinese. Part of ZJUCourse 课程资料整理. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 思考:结合当前的外部环境,如果你要创业,你, 关于大学生创业, 第三次工业革命, 第二讲 管理与环境(外部环境), Ø根据影响程度和方式的不同进行划分, 中国制造百年史:1860年的世界第一, 百年未有之大变局, “5” 民营经济贡献了中国经济50%以上的税收, 人工智能, 传统的管理方法及其理论将受到挑战,IT将重新定义管理, 需求结构的变化:对美好生活的高品质需求正处于真正爆发的前夜, and 创新资源(人力资源、科技投资资源)投入."
  7995,"吉林大学自动化专业生存攻略 | JLU-OpenAuto, 公开课开题报告: 弯曲变形","https://github.com/Sakura-shem/JLU-OpenAuto/blob/master/03-%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8A/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%AD%A6/PPT/%E7%AC%AC10%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E5%8F%98%E5%BD%A2%20%281%29.pdf",github.com,math.DS,math.DS math.CA mathematics ode-and-dynamical-systems slides github,null,2022,null,"吉林大学自动化专业生存攻略 | JLU-OpenAuto, 公开课开题报告: 弯曲变形. Slides (PDF), 2022; 33 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 有些是需要在网上搜索的电子书,每次见到一门新课程,Google 一下教材名称,有的可以立即找到,有的却是要花费许多眼力;有些是历年试卷或者 A4 纸,前人精心收集制作,抱着能对他人有用的想法公开,却需要在各个群或者私下中摸索以至于从学长手中代代相传;有些是上完一门课才恍然领悟的技巧,原来这门课重点如此,当初本可以更轻松地完成得更好. Subject (translated): ordinary differential equations and dynamical systems. Slides cover 弯曲变形, 一.工程中弯曲变形实例, 利用变形, 只要求解出一个,就可以根据v, θ关系求解出, 综合力学、数学两方面, 当梁内l 段EI C,, 弹性支撑, 1.列出挠曲线微分方程, 4.得转角方程和挠度方程, (1)当F作用在中点时, 例3.桥式起重机大梁在自重q及吊重F作用下,试求, 例5.用叠加法求图示外伸梁C截面的挠度fC转角 C。, 10.4 用叠加法求弯曲变形, and 1.求B截面转角."
  7996,"工程力学: 第7章扭转与剪切","https://github.com/Sakura-shem/JLU-OpenAuto/blob/master/03-%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8A/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%AD%A6/PPT/%E7%AC%AC7%E7%AB%A0%20%E6%89%AD%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%8E%E5%89%AA%E5%88%87.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis slides github,null,2022,null,"工程力学: 第7章扭转与剪切. Slides (PDF), 2022; 57 pages, in Chinese. Part of 吉林大学自动化专业生存攻略 | JLU-OpenAuto: 有些是需要在网上搜索的电子书,每次见到一门新课程,Google 一下教材名称,有的可以立即找到,有的却是要花费许多眼力;有些是历年试卷或者 A4 纸,前人精心收集制作,抱着能对他人有用的想法公开,却需要在各个群或者私下中摸索以至于从学长手中代代相传;有些是上完一门课才恍然领悟的技巧,原来这门课重点如此,当初本可以更轻松地完成得更好. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Slides cover 第7章扭转与剪切, 一. 工程实例, 三. 变形特点, 1.求力偶矩, 二. 切应力互等定理, Before, 切应力互等定理, 三. 圆轴扭转时的强度条件, 一.两横截面间相对扭转角, 校核DB段, 二. 矩形截面杆的扭转, 一. 剪切构件的受力和变形特点, 实用计算方法: 内力分布复杂, τ不能推导,只能作出尽量反, and 2.校核插销挤压强度."
  7997,"工程力学: 第8章弯曲内力","https://github.com/Sakura-shem/JLU-OpenAuto/blob/master/03-%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8A/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%AD%A6/PPT/%E7%AC%AC8%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E5%86%85%E5%8A%9B.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis slides github,null,2022,null,"工程力学: 第8章弯曲内力. Slides (PDF), 2022; 54 pages, in Chinese. Part of 吉林大学自动化专业生存攻略 | JLU-OpenAuto: 有些是需要在网上搜索的电子书,每次见到一门新课程,Google 一下教材名称,有的可以立即找到,有的却是要花费许多眼力;有些是历年试卷或者 A4 纸,前人精心收集制作,抱着能对他人有用的想法公开,却需要在各个群或者私下中摸索以至于从学长手中代代相传;有些是上完一门课才恍然领悟的技巧,原来这门课重点如此,当初本可以更轻松地完成得更好. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Slides cover 第8章弯曲内力, 8.1 平面弯曲的概念和实例, 变形前后梁的轴线位于同一平面内, 3. 静定梁的基本形式, 解:1.求支反力, 例4`列图示内力(FQ, M) 方程,作FQ` M 图, 事实并非如此,因为F 和M事实上不可能集中, 一. 正确求出支反力。, 面积增量法, and 例14 试画出图示梁的剪力图和弯矩图."
  7998,"第16章 电磁感应和电磁波: 第十六章 电磁感应和电磁波","https://github.com/SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A/%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E2%85%A0/resource/ppt/%E7%AC%AC16%E7%AB%A0%20%E7%94%B5%E7%A3%81%E6%84%9F%E5%BA%94.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"第16章 电磁感应和电磁波: 第十六章 电磁感应和电磁波. Slides (PDF), 2022; 44 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SambacFeng/SWU-SE-HELPER. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Slides cover §16.1 法拉第电磁感应定律, (1)理解并掌握法拉第定律和楞次定律;, 1、法拉弟电磁感应定律;, 原磁通增加,感应电, 2)若闭合回路的电阻为 R ,感应电流为, 求:动生电动势。, 由法拉第电磁感应定律, 二、感生电场和感生电动势的计算, 由一个回路中电流变, 解:设螺线管内通有电流, 例16.6 计算一个螺绕环的自感。设环的截面积, and 电磁学的发展历史."
  7999,"软件系统分析与设计: 第五章静态建模","https://github.com/Snowfly-T/SUDA-SE-lessons/blob/main/SOEN2009%20%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%AE%B2%E4%B9%89/Lecture05.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides github,null,2022,null,"软件系统分析与设计: 第五章静态建模. Lecture slides (PDF), 2022; 81 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 本人是苏州大学软件工程专业 2020 级的本科生,使用的也是 2020 级的软件工程培养方案,这里的资料也都是我个人上课时获得的相关资料。对于 2021 级、2022 级及以后的本科生,培养方案应有所不同,因此本仓库应仅能作为参考。另外,由于本人系转专业学生,因此有部分课程的实际修读学期与推荐修读学期不符。. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Review:use case modeling, 了解面向对象方法的分析和设计之间的关系, 类的表示方法, 描述该属性在哪些范围内可见, (4)[{特征描述}]:任选项,描述该操作的特征,, 边界类boundary, 公司名称:String, 递归关联, 组合聚集(组成), 对象图和类图的比较, 接口的关系, and 5.6 包与子系统."
