  8382,核酸的种类和生物功能,"https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E5%BE%AE%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/5%2B%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0%2B%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%86%E5%AD%90-%E6%A0%B8%E9%85%B8.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"核酸的种类和生物功能. Slides (PDF), 2022; 77 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 核酸的种类和生物功能, 1879年Kossel经过10年的努力, 搞清楚核质中有四种, 1909年Levene发现酵母的核酸含有核糖。, DNA功能的多样性, 核酸的基本组成, 两类核酸的比较, 3. 两条链通过碱基间的氢键相连,A, 由于DNA双螺旋为右旋,负超螺, RNA的种类和重要功能, 核酸的水解, 碱基、核苷、核苷酸和核酸在240~290 nm的紫外波段有强烈的光吸收,, 变性DNA在适当条件下,又可使两条彼此分开的链重新缔合成为双螺, and 核酸测序技术."
  8383,"生物工程基础: 细胞反应动力学的定义及分类","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%A0%2B%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%94%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B%E5%AD%A6-3.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"生物工程基础: 细胞反应动力学的定义及分类. Slides (PDF), 2022; 47 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 细胞反应动力学的定义及分类, 细胞生长动力学, 比生长速率μ的意义, 细胞生长的模型分类, 从工程角度看,理想的细胞生长模型应具备下列条件, Monod模型, Monod方程中 , 求解, Monod方程 =, 与Monod模型类似的其它非结构模型, 影响细胞生长动力学的因素, and 例: 乙醇唯一碳源进行面包酵母培养,获得的数据如下."
  8384,"生物工程基础: 主要内容","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%AB%A0%2B%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%94%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E7%8E%B0%E8%B1%A1-%E6%94%BE%E5%A4%A7.pdf",github.com,physics.class-ph,physics.class-ph physics.flu-dyn physics thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"生物工程基础: 主要内容. Slides (PDF), 2022; 73 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): engineering thermodynamics and heat transfer. Slides cover 主要内容, 5.4 氧的供需关系分析, 8.5 与混合性能有关的工业反应器选型, 生物反应器放大的原则是相似性,放大方法的理论基础是相似原理。, 放大中的关键问题, (1)计算试验罐的KLa, 公称体积V(m3), 缩小-放大法是一种着眼于过程机制研究的一种放大研究方法。由于, 对工业反应器作机制分析,在测定和计算并比较过程的特征时, and 一些模拟反应器的设计."
  8385,"生物工程基础: 连续操作反应器中组分浓度变化","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E7%AB%A0%2B%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%94%E5%99%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"生物工程基础: 连续操作反应器中组分浓度变化. Slides (PDF), 2022; 51 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 连续操作反应器中组分浓度变化, 恒化器方式较适用于底物浓度较低的情况。原因是当底物浓度较低时,, 单级CSTR中连续培养基本模型, 加料中底物浓度的影响, 由此,便建立了操作变量与状态变量之间的对应关系式。, 对于CSTR与离心或沉降组合的细胞循环系统,, 多级CSTR串联, 两级CSTR串联系统与单级CSTR的细胞产率的比较, 反应器中组分浓度分布决定反应速率, and 对于管式填充床固定化酶反应器作拟均相简化,由CPFR的操作."
  8386,Projet en Contexte International,"https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%8D%93%E8%B6%8A%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%88%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B_2021ODIN/%E4%BC%A0%E7%83%AD%E4%B8%8E%E4%BC%A0%E8%B4%A8/%E4%BC%A0%E7%83%AD%E4%B8%8E%E4%BC%A0%E8%B4%A8%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B/Analyse-Dimensionnelle-Cours-Hybride.pdf",github.com,physics.class-ph,physics.class-ph physics.flu-dyn physics thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"Projet en Contexte International. Lecture slides (PDF), 2022; 53 pages, in French. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): engineering thermodynamics and heat transfer. Slides cover La méthodologie expérimentale, Schéma simplifié de la création et de la validation, Intérêt de l’analyse dimensionnelle , International Organization for Standardization,, Paramètres et unités de base, Facteur multiplicatif, Exemple : le tube en U, Faire l’inventaire des paramètres indépendants influant sur, Exemple : un corps dans un écoulement permanent, and Quelques nombres sans dimension."
  8387,"Industrial Software Development: Isde Tutoring 01","https://github.com/unica-isde/isde/blob/master/tutor/isde_tutoring_01.pdf",github.com,cs.CL,cs.CL cs.AI cs.LG computer-science large-language-models lecture-notes slides github,null,2022,null,"Industrial Software Development: Isde Tutoring 01. Slides (PDF), 2022; 44 pages. From a repository described as: The course will start on Sept. 28, 2026. Slides cover Organization, Today: Setup and Python basics, Setting up the interpreter, Exercise, Indexing lists and strings, Operations with strings and lists, Tuples, Control structures, ATTENTION: anything different than 0 or False is considered True!, Loops, and Functions."
  8388,"编译系统: 哈尔滨工业大学陈鄞","https://github.com/yink12138/HITCS_Papers/blob/master/%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE/%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B9%A0%E9%A2%98%28%E5%B8%A6%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%E7%89%88%29.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL cs.CL cs.AI cs.LG computer-science programming-languages large-language-models slides github,null,2022,null,"编译系统: 哈尔滨工业大学陈鄞. Slides (PDF), 2022; 331 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 上大学以后,作为专业做题家的我第一次对考试产生了恐惧,人类的恐惧来源于未知,而我的恐惧自然来自于不知道考试题会怎么考。但老师们的精力是有限的,他们在出题前大多会参考往年考试的题目,比如线代考试最后一题的答案连续五年相同。经我个人经历检验,做好往年题与考高分之间有很强的正相关性,因此往年题是期末复习不可不看的重要资料。但当我看见某张记忆高价贩卖期末假题和某SDN高价贩卖期末真题时,我就在想,如果有一天我能得到真题,我一定要公开所有,重铸做题家荣光,我辈义不容辞。. Subject (translated): programming languages and compilers. Slides cover 第1 讲习题, 将下面的C++程序划分成正确的词素(token)序, 将14行分成两行,负数分开为两部分,负号和常量, 对于下列各(增广)文法, 结论1:不满足LL(1)文法条件,故该文法不是LL(1)的, I4和I7状态既有移进, (1)语义规则里有继承属性,故不满足, L.isleft = true, S->'{'{L.next=S.next}L(label(L.next)'}', 增加继承属性S.loop,表示当前是否在while循环中(true/false)。, 使用SPOC讲义6.4节(回填)中的翻译方案对下图进行翻译时,我们为每条语句, 运行时刻栈元素隶属, and 第三轮迭代."
