  8618,"Linux系统程序设计: Linux系统程序设计, 参考教材","https://github.com/2811668688/ZJU-CS/blob/main/linux%E7%9F%AD%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8Bppt/ch9%20%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages slides github,null,2021,null,"Linux系统程序设计: Linux系统程序设计, 参考教材. Slides (PDF), 2021; 94 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 这里是我对浙江大学混合班(主修计算机科学与技术)一些课程的资料整理 (2020-2024). Subject (translated): programming languages. Sections: Linux系统程序设计; 参考教材; 幻灯片编号 4; 系统调用和C函数库; 系统调用、API和C库; 库函数和系统调用; 扩展名; Linux环境下库函数的使用; 库函数; system函数; 文件操作(系统调用); 文件I/O. Slides cover Linux环境下函数的使用, 《Linux程序设计》, Linux环境下的有各种C库函数,如, 对于内核而言,所有打开文件都由文件描述符引用。文件描述符是一个非负整, 所需头文件, 1、获取文件的flags,即open函数的第二个参数, #include <sys/types.h>, 创建新进程, 有六种不同的exec函数可供使用,它们常常被统称为exec函数。, and Linux实现进程间通信(IPC Inter Process Communication)."
  8619,AMIDD-2021-02-TheCentralDogma,"https://github.com/Accio/AMIDD/blob/master/docs/assets/2021/02/AMIDD-2021-02-TheCentralDogma.pdf",github.com,q-bio.GN,q-bio.GN q-bio.QM quantitative-biology bioinformatics lecture-notes slides video github,null,2021,null,"AMIDD-2021-02-TheCentralDogma. Slides (PDF), 2021; 38 pages. From the course-materials archive Accio/AMIDD. Slides cover Follow up of questions on the video on Herceptin by Susan, AMIDD Lecture 2: The Central Dogma and Drug Discovery, Google.com, visited by ~200 million people every day, The central dogma of molecular biology, The human cell as a material entity, The central dogma of molecular biology: the human cell as an, RNA: transcription and the secondary structure, Three basic visual metaphors to display proteins, Break-out, Extending the Central Dogma with small molecules, feedback, Offline activities, A single-amino-acid difference in BRAF gene may mean, Edit distance: a deterministic view of distance between two, and With Levenshtein distance we can compare any two pieces of DNA."
