  8636,"分类与预测: 分类与预测, 分类与预测——回归分析","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA-ch6-%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E4%B8%8E%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B-%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.ST math.PR computer-science mathematics algorithms machine-learning statistics probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"分类与预测: 分类与预测, 分类与预测——回归分析. Slides (PDF), 2021; 42 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; probability; deep learning and neural networks. Sections: 分类与预测; 分类与预测——回归分析; 回归——Linear Regression线性回归分析; 回归——二元线性回归及最小二乘法; 回归——Logistic回归; 回归——Logistic回归分析及分类; 回归——Logistic回归分析; 幻灯片编号 16; 幻灯片编号 17; 幻灯片编号 18; 幻灯片编号 19; 回归——Polynomial Regression多项式回归. Slides cover 回归分析是通过建立模型来研究变量之间相互关系的密切程度、结构状态, 常用的回归模型如下, 估计参数, Y为预测值,连续变量X=(x1, x2, ., xk),之间的关系可以建模为, 线性回归模型是相对简单的回归模型,但是通常因变量和自变量之间呈, 回归——偏差(Bias)和方差(Variance), 回归——样本的数量, Lasso estimate具有shrinkage(收缩方法又称为正则化regularization)和selection(选择部分重要特, 两个线性可分的类, and 方块的类标号为+1,圆圈的类标号为−1."
  8637,"分类与预测: 集成学习","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA-ch7-%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E4%B8%8E%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%281%29.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.PR math.ST computer-science mathematics algorithms machine-learning probability statistics lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"分类与预测: 集成学习. Slides (PDF), 2021; 47 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; probability; deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover 集成学习, 集成学习的动机, Bootstrap抽样方法, Bagging误差分析, Bagging与Boosting对比, 组合策略-Stacking, 经典算法, 随机森林代码, AdaBoost, GBDT (Gradient Boosting Decision Tree), GBDT常用损失函数-分类, XGBOOST, and LightGBM."
