  8655,"JAVA 程序设计: 类与对象","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/Java%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/JavaPD-Ch04mao%20%E7%B1%BB%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%20%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E7%8F%AD.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"JAVA 程序设计: 类与对象. Slides (PDF), 2021; 94 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): programming languages. Slides cover 4.1 面向对象编程, OO Programming 概念, 4.3 类体的构成, 4.4 构造方法与对象的创建, 4.5 对象的引用与实体(重点理解), 类体内容可以有两种类型的成员:成员变量和方法, 实例方法可以操作实例变量、静态变量, 4.9 关键字this, 4.11 import语句, and 3.友好变量和友好方法."
  8656,"JAVA 程序设计: 继承与接口及泛型","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/Java%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/JavaPD-Ch05mao%20%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%8A%E6%B3%9B%E5%9E%8B%20%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E7%8F%AD.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"JAVA 程序设计: 继承与接口及泛型. Slides (PDF), 2021; 89 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): programming languages. Slides cover 主要内容, 何时用继承, 5.1 子类与父类, 5.2 子类的继承性, 5.4 成员变量隐藏和方法重写, 5.5 关键字super, 5.7 对象的上转型对象, 面向抽象的核心思想, 如果一个类实现某个接口,那么这个类必须实现该接口的所有方法,, 子类对象的上转型体现了继承的多态性,即把子类创建的对象的引用, 1. 和类有关的匿名类, 所以,程序可以将发生异常后的处理放在catch部分。, and 泛型类的类体和普通类的类体完全类似,由成员变量和方法构成."
