  8660,"JAVA 程序设计: Java GUI编程","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/Java%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/JavaPD-Ch10JavaGUI%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"JAVA 程序设计: Java GUI编程. Slides (PDF), 2021; 111 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): programming languages. Slides cover Java GUI (Graphical User Interfaces) programming, AWT (Abstract Windows Toolkit), Swing GUI containers (容器), Java早期进行用户界面设计时,使用java.awt包中提供的类。, 1.JPanel面板, 当对话框处于激活状态时,命令行无法输出信息,当对话框消失时,, 当用户单击“打开文件”按钮,将弹出一个文件对话框,用户可以把, 4.GridLayout布局, (3) JMenuItem菜单项, 我们需要一个对象对事件源进行监视,以便对发生的事件作出处理。, 5.JTextArea文本区, 3.组件的边框, 2.MouseListener接口与MouseMotionListener接口, and 5.弹出式菜单."
  8661,"JAVA 程序设计: Java网络编程基础","https://github.com/Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/Java%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/JavaPD-Ch11maoJava%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI cs.PL computer-science networking programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"JAVA 程序设计: Java网络编程基础. Slides (PDF), 2021; 52 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Alex-Shen1121/SZU_Learning_Resource. Subject (translated): programming languages. Slides cover 常用的http、ftp、file协议都是JVM支持的协议, 1.URL的构造方法, 11.2 读取URL中的资源, 程序可以通过处理HyperlinkEvent事件,来显示新的URL中的资源。, 11.5 InetAddress类, 11.6 套接字Socket, 11.7 使用多线程处理套接字连接, 该对象mail_in使用方法receive(DatagramPacket pack)接收数据包。该方, 一个具有A、B或C类地址的主机要广播数据或接收广播,都必须加入, 5.广播数据和接收数据, and 11.10 Java远程调用."
