  8879,"ZJUCourse 课程资料整理, Polarization: Conditions for Coherent Superposition","https://github.com/RyanFcr/ZJU_Course/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E7%A7%8B%E5%86%AC/%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E2%85%A1%EF%BC%88H%EF%BC%89/slides/lecture20.pdf",github.com,math.AG,math.AG math.NT mathematics abelian-varieties lecture-notes slides github,Lih-King Lim,2021,null,"ZJUCourse 课程资料整理, Polarization: Conditions for Coherent Superposition. Lecture slides (PDF) by Lih-King Lim, 2021; 31 pages. From a repository described as: 浙江大学 20 级信息安全(图灵班)在读,分享一下本科期间学习笔记 - 大一主要还是纸质笔记,到大一下逐渐开始用 typora 记笔记,但是大部分都是以 PDF 的版本提供,因为当时笔者不知道如何将 Markdown 源文件的图片存为相对路径;大家如果需要整合进自己的笔记,推荐使用 Bob(Mac 可用),可以做到 OCR 识别文字;到大二下开始全面将笔记转到飞书,并采用飞书的个人知识库,同时开放复制,方便大家基于我的笔记基础上进行补充修改,并且因为共享文档的原因,大家可以对笔者的笔记异步进行评论和交流,如果笔者的笔记出现一些错误,欢迎纠正! -…. Slides cover Conditions for Coherent Superposition, Light is a transverse electromagnetic wave. Thus far we, Circular polarization: When both constituent waves have, When their relative phase difference ε = π/2 + 2mπ, where, Coherence is a measure of the correlation between the, Polarizing Sheets, Initially unpolarized light is sent, The following figure shows a system of three polarizing sheets in the, When the light is incident at a, Appendix: A Math Description of Polarization, Linearly polarized at +45◦from the x-axis (diagonal) and, and Note that in the lecture on interference, we discussed the."
