  8921,"面向对象设计与设计模式: 什么是面向对象编程和面向对象编程语言","https://github.com/SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing/blob/main/2440042_%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E4%B8%AD%E7%BA%A7%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/02.%E9%9D%A2%E5%90%91%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1-1.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"面向对象设计与设计模式: 什么是面向对象编程和面向对象编程语言. Slides (PDF), 2021; 23 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive SuperPung/TJU-CourseSharing. Subject (translated): programming languages. Slides cover 什么是面向对象编程和面向对象编程语言, 面向对象编程中有两个非常重要、非常基础的概念,那就是类(class), 直到今天,如果不按照严格的定义来说,大部分编程语言都是面向, 面向对象分析英文缩写是OOA,全称是Object Oriented Analysis;, 分别可以解决哪些编程问题, 封装(Encapsulation), 抽象(Abstraction), 继承(Inheritance), and 多态(Polymorphism)."
