  9049,13-regression-pt1,"https://github.com/bvasiles/empirical-methods/blob/master/spring-2021/slides/13-regression-pt1.pdf",github.com,math.ST,math.ST stat.ME math.OA mathematics statistics operator-algebras software-engineering lecture-notes slides github,null,2021,null,"13-regression-pt1. Slides (PDF), 2021; 36 pages. From the course-materials archive bvasiles/empirical-methods. Slides cover Outline for Today, Leftovers from last lecture: Type I and Type II Errors, Hypothesis Tests, Type I and Type II Errors, Main topic for today, A Few Important Questions That We Might Seek To Address, Many Possible Linear Models, Residuals, Assessing the Accuracy of the Coefficient Estimates, Back to our example, and Testing the null hypothesis."
