  9084,春 Lecture1 (fkuner/BUAA_CA),"https://github.com/fkuner/BUAA_CA/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2021%E6%98%A5-lecture1.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR cs.PL computer-science computer-architecture programming-languages slides github,null,2021,null,"春 Lecture1 (fkuner/BUAA_CA). Lecture slides (PDF), 2021; 10 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 推荐阅读材料: 1. 计算机组成与设计-硬件/软件接口 2. Subject (translated): computer architecture; assembly language; programming languages and compilers. Slides cover 系统层次结构, 多核环境下的性能下降现象, DRAM 控制器, 现在我们知道底层会发生什么, 课程信息: 我们, 初步的课程安排, 重新审视系统的层次结构, 对各位的希望, and 关于作弊和学术欺骗."
  9085,春 Lecture10 (fkuner/BUAA_CA),"https://github.com/fkuner/BUAA_CA/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2021%E6%98%A5-lecture10.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture slides github,null,2021,null,"春 Lecture10 (fkuner/BUAA_CA). Lecture slides (PDF), 2021; 17 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 推荐阅读材料: 1. 计算机组成与设计-硬件/软件接口 2. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾:精确异常的解决方案, 回顾:现代流水线的两个“驼峰”, 回顾:处理存储相关性(I), 存储违例消解(II), 分层的存储体系结构, 理想存储器, 存储器Bank的组织和操作, 越大越慢, 解决方案背后的基本原则——#1, 存储局部性, 流水线设计中的cache, 分层的延迟分析, 为什么DRAM慢?, and Cache的抽象和指标."
  9086,春 Lecture11 (fkuner/BUAA_CA),"https://github.com/fkuner/BUAA_CA/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2021%E6%98%A5-lecture11.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture slides github,null,2021,null,"春 Lecture11 (fkuner/BUAA_CA). Lecture slides (PDF), 2021; 16 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 推荐阅读材料: 1. 计算机组成与设计-硬件/软件接口 2. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:为什么要有分层存储体系结构?, 回顾:cache基础, 直接映射的Cache(II), 分区Cache, 全相联的Cache:a=C/B, LRU的近似性, 牺牲者/下一个牺牲者策略(II), Cache缺失的种类, 回顾:Cache基本参数, 更“胖”的Data Store, 写缓冲(Store Buffer), 指令vs. 数据Cache, 处理“写”(Store), and 标签存储表项中有什么?."
  9087,春 Lecture12 (fkuner/BUAA_CA),"https://github.com/fkuner/BUAA_CA/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2021%E6%98%A5-lecture12.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture slides github,null,2021,null,"春 Lecture12 (fkuner/BUAA_CA). Lecture slides (PDF), 2021; 32 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 推荐阅读材料: 1. 计算机组成与设计-硬件/软件接口 2. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:直接映射的Cahce, 回顾:全相联的Cache:a=C/B, 回顾:处理“写”(Store), 如何减少各种缺失, 偏斜相联Caches (III), 块S1, S2, S3 的缺失是孤立的, 基本概念(I), DRAM 子系统的组织, 64位宽DIMM (1个Rank), 分解DIMM, 0xFFFF.F, 多Bank/通道的好处, 刷新的开销: 能耗, and 1. 分析: 分析DRAM所有行的保持时间."
  9088,春 Lecture13 (fkuner/BUAA_CA),"https://github.com/fkuner/BUAA_CA/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2021%E6%98%A5-lecture13.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture slides github,null,2021,null,"春 Lecture13 (fkuner/BUAA_CA). Lecture slides (PDF), 2021; 23 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 推荐阅读材料: 1. 计算机组成与设计-硬件/软件接口 2. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:交叉存取, 回顾:减少刷新操作, 打开vs. 关闭行策略, DRAM 电源管理, 电阻式存储器技术, 基于PCM的主存储器(I), 结果: 用PCM简单替换DRAM, 一种选择: DRAM作为PCM的cache, STOR mem[R2] R4, 思路: 在程序需要使用之前取数据, 在存储系统如何加入硬件预取器, 预取的挑战: Where (I), 软件预取(I), and 硬件预取(I)."
