  10053,"根轨迹概述: 第五章Chapter 5","https://github.com/QSCTech/zju-icicles/blob/master/%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/PPT/%E5%A4%8FC1-%E6%A0%B9%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0.pdf",github.com,eess.SY,eess.SY math.OC electrical-engineering mathematics control-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"根轨迹概述: 第五章Chapter 5. Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 48 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive QSCTech/zju-icicles. Subject (translated): control theory and control systems. Slides cover 第五章Chapter 5, 内容回顾, (1)系统分析:控制系统结构参数已知,在系统数学模型已建立的条件下,判, 根轨迹的概念, K>1——根为复数, 2条根轨迹分支, 根轨迹曲线“被拉向左边”,, Step 1:确定系统的开环传递函数G(s)H(s), 开环传递函数G(s)H(s), (2)系统的特征方程Δ(s), and 如以下单位反馈系统(可变化参数K >0)."
