  10165,"监督学习和非监督学习: 机器学习 Machine Learning, 课前回顾","https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2020%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A07-%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%E5%9B%BE%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B-2020.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR cs.LG math.ST stat.ML mathematics computer-science statistics machine-learning markov-chains probability lecture-notes book slides github,null,2020,null,"监督学习和非监督学习: 机器学习 Machine Learning, 课前回顾. Slides (PDF), 2020; 61 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): machine learning; probability. Sections: 机器学习 Machine Learning; 课前回顾; 基本采样法(Basic Sampling); 拒绝采样(Rejection Sampling); 重要性采样(Importance Sampling); 蒙特卡罗方法( Monte Carlo Method); Metropolis采样法; 马尔可夫链(Markov Chain); Metropolis-Hastings 方法; 吉布斯采样(Gibbs Sampling); 与M-H的关系; 第七讲:概率图模型 Chapter 7: Probabilistic Graphical Models. Slides cover 思想:从基本概率分布中产生新变量的分布, 高斯分布, 直接计算, 蒙特卡罗方法(Monte Carlo Method), 一个状态的边缘分布可以表示为, 在细致平稳条件两边乘以因子C, 第七讲:概率图模型, 贝叶斯网络(Bayesian network), 条件独立, and (d-separation)."
