  10179,"星地协同遥感信息处理: 徐其志","https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%81%A5%E6%84%9F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/9-%E6%98%9F%E4%B8%8A%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%20-%E7%BD%91%E4%B8%8A%E7%BC%A9%E5%87%8F%E7%89%88.pdf",github.com,math.ST,math.ST math.AG stat.ME mathematics statistics algebraic-geometry lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"星地协同遥感信息处理: 徐其志. Slides (PDF), 2020; 35 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): statistics and statistical inference. Slides cover 课程内容, On-board payload data processing encompasses the data, 1 星上信息处理—美国全球星地数传接收, 远程打击部队, 1 人类进入大数据时代—发展脉络, 1 大数据时代—时空数据挖掘和知识发现方法, 2 中国遥感事业蓬勃发展—陆地观测卫星, 3 大数据的4V特征, 3 4V特征—Volume, 3 4V特征—Variety, 1 大数据改变处理方式—时空信息重建, 2 大数据改变获取知识方式—夜光分析, and 2 大数据改变获取知识方式—TerraPattern."
  10180,春 Lecture1 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture1.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR cs.PL computer-science computer-architecture programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture1 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 34 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): assembly language; computer architecture; programming languages and compilers. Slides cover 你们为什么而来, 高级语言程序(e.g. C), 计算机系统的层次结构, 系统层次结构, 一个例子, 如果你不知道处理器是如何执行程序的,你是否, 为什么性能下降会有这么大的差异?, DRAM Bank的操作, Row Buffer, 现在我们知道底层会发生什么, 在哪里获得不断更新的课程信息?, and 你们能学到什么."
  10181,春 Lecture10 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture10.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture10 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 33 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:为什么要有分层存储体系结构?, 回顾:cache基础, “a”路组相联的Cache, 分层LRU (非MRU), 强制缺失, 每个块在SRAM的2个bank上交叉存取, 多层Cache, 写回Cache和DMA, 改善Cache “性能”, 通过软件改善命中率(I), 主存储器, 交叉存取方案, DRAM Bank 操作, and 通用(广义的)内存结构."
  10182,春 Lecture11 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture11.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture11 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 31 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:Cache基本参数, 回顾:替换策略, 回顾:如何减少各种缺失, 分布式刷新, RAIDR: 机制, Bloom Filter 操作示例, RAIDR: 基准设计, DRAM 控制器: 在什么地方?, 更多关于DRAM操作, 内存通道分区, 在并行应用中处理干扰, 基于PCM的主存储器(I), 一种选择: DRAM作为PCM的cache, and 分段的地址翻译."
  10183,春 Lecture12 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture12.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR cs.OS eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture operating-systems lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture12 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 24 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; operating systems; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:DRAM 刷新, 回顾:多核系统中的内存干扰和调度, 回顾:分段和分页, 回顾:虚拟存储和“虚存”, 地址翻译与cache, 虚拟-索引,物理-标签, 内存地址映射(单通道), 虚拟存储和DMA的交互, STOR mem[R2] R4, 思路: 在程序需要使用之前取数据, 在存储系统如何加入硬件预取器, 预取的挑战: Where (I), 软件预取(I), and 硬件预取(I)."
  10184,春 Lecture13 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture13.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.PL cs.AR computer-science algorithms programming-languages computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture13 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 32 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; programming languages and compilers; computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾:虚拟存储与cache的交互, 回顾:预取, 回顾:预取器性能, Flynn分类法, 紧耦合多处理器的主要难点, 并行编程的困难, 支持同步互斥, 顺序一致性的问题?, 互连网络, 写数据时, MSI 状态机, 复杂Cache一致性协议中的tradeoff, 更深的流水线, and 性能vs. 并行性."
  10185,春 Lecture14 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture14.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY computer-science physics electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering algorithms computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture14 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 31 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; algorithms and data structures; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 互连网络基础, 回顾:顺序一致性, 回顾:两种cache一致性方法, 互连网络基本概念, 每个节点都与其它的每个节点相连, 多级对数网络, Torus, 无缓冲偏转路由, 健忘性路由: 勇士算法, 例子:多周期性能分析, 吞吐量≠ 吞吐量, 不仅与硬件相关, 性能小结, and 简而言之,."
  10186,春 Lecture15 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture15.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture15 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 36 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 代码的大小:每条指令都有一个操作码和一组操作数,, 参考答案(续), 固定长度和可变长度ISA, 参考答案, (b) 对上述指令而言,还需要增加哪些功能单元?, 假设各类型指令所占比例如下表所示,试根据下表的两种情况分别, 假设控制单元产生控制信号的时间如下表所示,试根据表中的两种, MIPS多周期微体系结构分析, (b) 在避免不必要浪费的前提之下,该部件的延迟应减小到多少?, 考察以下高级语言代码段, 这个问题显示了在分支预测机器上预测错误的惩罚和在推断执行机器上执行无用指, 下面给出了运行在带数据cache的处理器上的程序所生成的四种不同的地址, and Bank."
  10187,春 Lecture2 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture2.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture2 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 22 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 上一讲回顾, 冯诺依曼结构/模型, 数据流模型(计算机), 冯诺依曼vs 数据流, 指令指针—ISA层面的折衷, ISA 和微体系结构的折衷, 再来看什么是计算机体系结构?, 操作码、寻址方式、数据类型, 设计要点(Design Point), 指令的执行过程, Example, and 各种不同的指令集体系结构(ISA)."
  10188,春 Lecture3 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture3.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture3 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 17 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 课程学习, 如何对论文做评价, 回顾: 冯诺依曼结构/模型, Tradeoff: 计算机体系结构的灵魂, 采用不同的寻址方式有什么好处?, 复杂的指令vs. 简单的指令, 一个例子:X86(小语义鸿沟)的串操作, ISA的演进, RISC vs. CISC, MIPS的典型特点, MIPS: 对齐访问, ISA实现, 最基本的指令处理引擎, and 指令处理“周期” vs. 机器时钟周期."
  10189,春 Lecture4 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture4.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture4 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 20 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾: ISA Tradeoffs, 回顾微体系结构:最基本的指令处理引擎, 回顾微体系结构:观察指令处理的另一个视角, 从状态单元开始, 完整的数据通路, I类型ALU指令, Load, Load-Store 数据通路, 无条件转跳数据通路, 条件分支数据通路, 1-Bit 控制信号, I-Type ALU指令的控制信号, 分支发生的控制信号, and 单周期微体系结构."
  10190,春 Lecture5 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture5.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture5 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 26 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾: “处理指令”的步骤, 回顾:性能分析, 指令执行周期, 简单的LC-3b控制和数据通路, PC<! BaseR, 关于LC-3b 数据通路的几个问题, Microinstruction, LC-3b 微序列(控制)器, 延迟可变存储, 其它: 内存中的对齐矫正, 微程序设计的多周期MIPS, 完整的数据通路(带控制信号), 水平微码, and 回顾:单周期微架构的复杂性."
  10191,春 Lecture6 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture6.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture6 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 18 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾:基本的多周期微体系结构, 回顾:理想的流水线, 回顾:相关和相关的类型, 如何处理数据相关, 相关性的检测方法(II), 数据转发/旁路, 处理数据相关, 处理写后读相关, 流水线停顿: 解决数据相关, 如何实现停顿, 通过转发解决RAW 相关, 数据转发逻辑(v2), 硬件vs.软件互锁的问题, and 分支的类型."
  10192,春 Lecture7 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture7.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL physics.flu-dyn eess.SY math.OC computer-science physics electrical-engineering mathematics aerospace-engineering programming-languages optimization lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture7 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 34 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): programming languages and compilers; optimization; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:流水线设计中的问题, 回顾:控制相关, 回顾:猜测下一个PC = PC + 4, 推断执行(II), ARM ISA中的条件执行, 愿望转跳/汇聚, 如何处理控制相关, 填充延迟槽, 分支预测, 性能分析, 静态分支预测(II), Last-Time 预测的状态机, and 能不能做的更好?."
  10193,春 Lecture8 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture8.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn cs.AR eess.SY physics computer-science electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture8 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 16 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture; aerospace engineering and aerodynamics. Slides cover 回顾:处理控制相关, 流水线中的问题: 多周期执行, 流水线中确保精确异常, ROB: 独立操作, 使用ROB的按序分发执行流水线, 解决方案III: 未来寄存器堆(FF) + ROB, 流水线的问题: 分支预测错误, 当分支译码时, 乱序执行, 乱序执行(动态调度), 现代流水线的两个“驼峰”, Tomasulo算法: 重命名, MUL 6个时钟周期流水执行, and 周期7结束时."
  10194,春 Lecture9 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing),"https://github.com/TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/2020%E6%98%A5-lecture9.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"春 Lecture9 (TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing). Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 19 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive TheBloodthirster/BUAA_Course_Sharing. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 回顾:精确异常的解决方案, 回顾:现代流水线的两个“驼峰”, 数据流图, 处理Store-Load相关性, 如何在乱序执行的机器中实现分支预测?, 真实的世界, 存储器技术: DRAM, DRAM, 存储器分层, 解决方案背后的基本原则——#2, 分层存储结构中的自动管理, 层次设计注意事项, 高速缓存(Cache), and 直接映射Cache: 放置和访问."
  10195,第11章 行为投资策略与管理,"https://github.com/ThousandC/GDUT-CSSP/blob/main/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%AD%A6/BF%20%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/c11-Behavioral%20investing.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning slides github,null,2020,null,"第11章 行为投资策略与管理. Slides (PDF), 2020; 50 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 从刚上大学到如今大四,一路上都在苦苦寻觅各种课程的资料, 有些资料是老师那里拷贝的,有些是网上找的,有些是师兄师姐传下来的,有些甚至是花钱买的,尽管如此,仍然有很多是没有办法找到的。后来当了助班,又有了许多人找我要当年的课件、试卷等。受浙江大学启发,心血来潮,决定借助GitHub这个平台进行一个计划,将手上现有的资料都整理进来,方便大家能够找到自己满意的资料,同时也欢迎大家贡献。. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 引导案例:涨停的诱惑, 案例思考, 基本面分析的局限性, (二)技术分析, 技术分析面临的质疑, 实验结果及分析, 投资者行为偏差, “当公司的股息增长率越高,增长, 表11-2 不同年龄段的资产配置情况, III-管理好自己的情绪, III.3-自我控制训练, V-自动化交易克服人性弱点, V.2-寻找智能投顾, and 超额收益来源."
  10196,"第三章金融风险识别、度量: 今日课程内容","https://github.com/ThousandC/GDUT-CSSP/blob/main/%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%A0%20%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E3%80%81%E5%BA%A6%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis slides github,null,2020,null,"第三章金融风险识别、度量: 今日课程内容. Slides (PDF), 2020; 53 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 从刚上大学到如今大四,一路上都在苦苦寻觅各种课程的资料, 有些资料是老师那里拷贝的,有些是网上找的,有些是师兄师姐传下来的,有些甚至是花钱买的,尽管如此,仍然有很多是没有办法找到的。后来当了助班,又有了许多人找我要当年的课件、试卷等。受浙江大学启发,心血来潮,决定借助GitHub这个平台进行一个计划,将手上现有的资料都整理进来,方便大家能够找到自己满意的资料,同时也欢迎大家贡献。. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Slides cover 今日课程内容, VaR方法, 几个容易混淆的概念, VaR计算方法, Pr ob, 均匀分布下的VaR 计算, 离散分布下的VaR 计算, 计算步骤, 历史模拟法优点与缺陷, 波动率加权历史模拟法, and (3)求解ST."
