  10364,"Lecture 9: Query Refinement and Relevance","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/slide/2020_QingcaiChen/Lecture%209%20query%20relevace%20feedback.pdf",github.com,cs.IR,cs.IR cs.LG cs.CL stat.ML computer-science statistics information-retrieval machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"Lecture 9: Query Refinement and Relevance. Lecture slides (PDF), 2020; 39 pages. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Slides cover Query Refinement, Relevance Feedback: Motivation, Types of Relevance Feedback, Theoretically Best Query, Rocchio's Modified Query, Adjusting Parameters 1, (geometric mean average precision), Clickthrough Example, Local Context Analysis (LCA), Selecting candidate terms, Using expanded query, Does it work?, Learning to Rank (a quick glimpse), and Machine learning for IR ranking."
  10365,"第一章: 非线性方程的数值解法","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/slide/2021_%E6%9D%A8%E4%BA%91%E4%BA%91/1.%20%E9%9D%9E%E7%BA%BF%E6%80%A7%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E8%A7%A3%E6%B3%95.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS math.NA cs.NA computer-science mathematics algorithms numerical-analysis slides github,null,2020,null,"第一章: 非线性方程的数值解法. Slides (PDF), 2020; 60 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; numerical analysis. Sections: 第一章; 幻灯片编号 2; 非线性方程根的概念; 幻灯片编号 4; 非线性方程求根的数值方法; 二分法; 幻灯片编号 11; 幻灯片编号 12; 迭代法; 幻灯片编号 15; 迭代法的全局收敛性; 迭代法的局部收敛性. Slides cover 给定非线性方程f(x)=0, 对方程(1.1.1)求根大致分为三个步骤, 二分法的计算过程为, 迭代法是一种逐次逼近的方法,它的基, ,由迭代法产生的序列都收敛于根α ,, 将方程f(x)=0改写成等价形式, 证根的存在性, 定理1.4 若φφ(xx)在方程xx= φφ(xx)的根αα的邻域, 设F(x)=x+c(x2-3),应如何选取c才, and Newton法的迭代函数是."
  10366,"第二章: 线性方程组的数值解法","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/slide/2021_%E6%9D%A8%E4%BA%91%E4%BA%91/2.%20%E7%BA%BF%E6%80%A7%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E8%A7%A3%E6%B3%95.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis slides github,null,2020,null,"第二章: 线性方程组的数值解法. Slides (PDF), 2020; 117 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Sections: 第二章; 幻灯片编号 2; 幻灯片编号 3; 计算机上求解线性方程组的有效数值方法; 幻灯片编号 5; 幻灯片编号 6; 向量的范数; 常用的向量范数; 范数的有关定理; 矩阵的范数; 幻灯片编号 12; 幻灯片编号 13. Slides cover 线性方程组, 对于线性方程组Ax=b,, 直接解法是解线性方程组的重要方法. 它是指, 例对于实矩阵A=(aij)n×n, 对方程组Ax=b仍按x1,x2,.的顺序依次消元,只是在每, 得同解上三角方程组, (分解惟一), 设δA为A的扰动,引起解x的扰动为δx,则, 设x*为方程组Ax=b的精确解. 若迭代法, and 由Gauss-Seidel迭代法得."
  10367,"第三章: 插值与逼近","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/slide/2021_%E6%9D%A8%E4%BA%91%E4%BA%91/3.%20%E6%8F%92%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%BC%E8%BF%91.pdf",github.com,math.NA,math.NA cs.NA mathematics computer-science numerical-analysis slides github,null,2020,null,"第三章: 插值与逼近. Slides (PDF), 2020; 67 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): numerical analysis. Sections: 第三章; 幻灯片编号 2; 插值的概念; 幻灯片编号 4; Lagrange插值公式; 幻灯片编号 6; 幻灯片编号 7; 幻灯片编号 8; 幻灯片编号 9; 幻灯片编号 10; 幻灯片编号 11; 幻灯片编号 12. Slides cover 用简单函数P(x)近似代替函数f(x)是数值计算中的基本, 插值是由离散数据来构造一个函数的近似函数, 线性插值(一次插值), 线性插值多项式的余项, 由定理1知, Runge现象, 设f(x)在节点xj的精确值为f(xj),计算值为, 只要给定区间[a, b]及权函数ρ(x),可由线性无, [a, b]上的一组线性无关的函数,, and 求得解为."
  10368,"第六章: 常微分方程数值解法","https://github.com/hewei2001/HITSZ-OpenCS/blob/main/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%8B/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/slide/2021_%E6%9D%A8%E4%BA%91%E4%BA%91/5.%20%E5%B8%B8%E5%BE%AE%E5%88%86%E6%96%B9%E7%A8%8B%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E8%A7%A3%E6%B3%95.pdf",github.com,math.DS,math.DS math.CA mathematics ode-and-dynamical-systems slides github,null,2020,null,"第六章: 常微分方程数值解法. Slides (PDF), 2020; 51 pages, in Chinese. Part of 哈工大(深圳)计算机专业课程攻略 | HITSZ-OpenCS: 仓库于 2021/07/06 由 HITSZ-CS-GEEK 更名为 HITSZ-OpenCS。. Subject (translated): ordinary differential equations and dynamical systems. Sections: 第六章; 幻灯片编号 2; 建立数值解法的基本思想; 幻灯片编号 4; 幻灯片编号 5; 数值解法研究的主要问题:; 幻灯片编号 7; 建立数值解法的基本途径; 幻灯片编号 9; Euler折线法; 幻灯片编号 11; 幻灯片编号 12. Slides cover 本章研究常微分方程初值问题, 本章的数值解法,它不是求(6.1.1)的解, 取一系列点, 具体数值方法的应用还应考虑, 利用Taylor展开法, 用不同的近似公式计算定积分的值,就得到解初, 由Taylor展开式知, 将其代入中Tn有, 利用Euler方法计算积分, and 整理得显格式."
  10369,"Low-Density Parity Check Codes: Design, Analysis and Complexity Issues: m2 - Deterministic signal analysis","https://github.com/hhubibi/zju-isee/blob/master/%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/%E8%8B%B1%E6%96%87%E7%8F%AD/ppt/m2%20-%20Deterministic%20signal%20analysis.pdf",github.com,math.CA,math.CA mathematics harmonic-analysis slides github,null,2020,null,"Low-Density Parity Check Codes: Design, Analysis and Complexity Issues: m2 - Deterministic signal analysis. Slides (PDF), 2020; 27 pages. From a repository described as: 本仓库源于CC98老信电版版主@hhubibi学姐的课程资料仓库,很多信电学子都在学姐的资料指引下,度过了一个个艰难的考试周。. Slides cover Signals in Time Domain, Signals in Frequency Domain, Fourier Transform, Example 1: Spectrum of Unit Impulse, Example 2: Spectrum of Constant Signal, Example 3: Spectrum of Sinusoidal Signal, Example 4: Spectrum of, Example 5: Spectrum of Single Rectangular Pulse, Properties of Fourier Transform, Review Examples 2 & 4, Example 6: Spectrum of Impulse Train, Example 7: Spectrum of Periodic Signal, Example 8: Spectrum of Sampled Signal, and Energy Spectrum,."
