  10371,Zjut-icicles 浙江工业大学课程攻略共享计划,"https://github.com/j10ccc/zjut-icicles/blob/main/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%28ie.zjut%29/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%AF%BE%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%A0%E9%A2%98%E7%B2%BE%E9%80%89%2B%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking slides github,null,2020,null,"Zjut-icicles 浙江工业大学课程攻略共享计划. Slides (PDF), 2020; 87 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 初入浙江工业大学的你们是否对未来感到迷茫,面对种种纷繁复杂的课程是否手足无措? - 内向的你是否羡慕社牛同学从学长学姐那儿找到各种课程资料,担心自己从起跑线就卷不过他们?. Subject (translated): computer networks; topology. Sections: image001; image003; image006; image008; image010; image012; image014; image016; image018; image020; image022; image024. Slides cover 在电路交换的通信过程中,只要在整个连接中有一个环节(如某条链路或某个交换机), 【1-12】互联网的两大组成部分(边缘部分与核心部分)的特点是什么?它们的工作方, 在网络边缘的端系统之间的通信方式通常可划分为两大类:客户-服务器方式( C/S 方式), (1) 物理层-—-在物理层上所传数据的单位是比特(bit) 。物理层的任务就是透明地传送比, 输损耗小,抗雷电和电磁干扰性能好,无串音干扰,保密性好。此外,体积小和蜇量轻。现, I km 长的CSM幻CD 网络的数据率为I, 网络层向上提供的服务有哪两种?试比较其优缺点。, 网络凡的子网掩码M卢庄进行AND 运算, 的子网。试问, and 假定使用连续ARQ 协议,发送窗口大小是3, 而序号范围是[O, 15], 而传输媒."
  10372,"Object Oriented Programming: Part 3: Introduction to Inheritance","https://github.com/j10ccc/zjut-icicles/blob/main/%E9%9D%A2%E5%90%91%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E2%85%A1/Slides/03%20Introduction%20to%20Inheritance.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning survey slides github,Maria Agnesson,2020,null,"Object Oriented Programming: Part 3: Introduction to Inheritance. Slides (PDF) by Maria Agnesson, 2020; 16 pages. Part of zjut-icicles 浙江工业大学课程攻略共享计划: 初入浙江工业大学的你们是否对未来感到迷茫,面对种种纷繁复杂的课程是否手足无措? - 内向的你是否羡慕社牛同学从学长学姐那儿找到各种课程资料,担心自己从起跑线就卷不过他们?. Sections: BTH001 Object Oriented Programming Lesson 03 Introduction to Inheritance; Inheritance - when?; Inheritance - common; Class containing common; Inheritance - specific; Classes containing specifics; Inheritance – when?; Inheritance – base and sub classes; Inheritance continued; Generalization and Specialization; Inheritance in C++; What is inherited?. Slides cover If you realize that two or more classes have common, Create a class for the common parts, The classes Student and Employee also have specific, Create two classes for the specific parts , Now we have 3 classes, Inheritance – base and sub, An Employee is a Person, Things (properties and behavior) that are common for, All members are inherited, though with different, and An Employee object ”contains” a name and a salary."
