  10653,"申请“学术百星” 答辩报告: 发展阶段 (sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020)","https://github.com/sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020/blob/main/%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD20-21%E7%A7%8B%E5%AD%A3/%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%20-%20%E7%BE%A4%E4%BD%93%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.OC stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics algorithms machine-learning optimization lecture-notes slides github,Hua-Wei Shen,2020,null,"申请“学术百星” 答辩报告: 发展阶段 (sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020). Slides (PDF) by Hua-Wei Shen, 2020; 49 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020. Subject (translated): optimization; machine learning; algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 发展阶段, 群体智能, 集群智能, 蚁群寻食, 经过18个时间单位时的情形, 蚁群优化算法, 其中:Q为常数, wk表示第k只蚂蚁在本轮迭代中走过的路径,Lk为路径长度,, 旅行商问题的蚁群优化求解, 蚁群大小, and 粒子群优化算法."
  10654,"人工智能: 演化计算","https://github.com/sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020/blob/main/%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD20-21%E7%A7%8B%E5%AD%A3/evolution.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.PR math.RT computer-science mathematics algorithms machine-learning probability quiver-representations lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"人工智能: 演化计算. Slides (PDF), 2020; 46 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive sunbaby01/UCAS_Course_2020. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; probability; machine learning. Slides cover 演化计算(Evolutionary Computation,EC), 达尔文的自然选择学说是一种被人们广泛接受的生物进, 演化计算:一种模拟自然界生物进化过程与机制进行, 作设计等几大部分所组成,, 二进制编码(Binary encoding), 适应度函数是一个用于对个体的适应性进行度量的函数。个体的适, 极大化问题, P(xN), 两点交叉, 变异(Mutation)操作: 对选中个体的染色体中的某些基因进行变, 例5.15 用遗传算法求函数f(x)=x2 的最大值,其中x为[0,31]间的整数。, 假设交叉概率Pi为50%,则种群中只有1/2的染色体参与交叉。若规定种, 对第1代种群,其变异情况, and 例子:8皇后问题."
