  10659,"blastFoam Version 6.0, Synthetik - Applied - Technologies - blast Foam - Workshop - May - - 20200513","https://github.com/synthetik-technologies/blastfoam/blob/master/media/Synthetik-Applied-Technologies-blastFoam-Workshop-May-Final-20200513.pdf",github.com,physics.flu-dyn,physics.flu-dyn eess.SY physics electrical-engineering aerospace-engineering slides talk github,null,2020,null,"blastFoam Version 6.0, Synthetik - Applied - Technologies - blast Foam - Workshop - May - - 20200513. Talk slides (PDF), 2020; 67 pages. From a repository described as: blastFoam is a library for single and multiphase compressible flow with application to high-explosive detonation, explosive safety and airblast, as well as general compressible flows. blastFoam is developed by Synthetik Applied Technologies. Slides cover WHO WE ARE, HOUSEKEEPING, Roadmap, What just happened?, // Model Problem, Governing Equations, Detonation model, Mesh properties, and Advanced."
  10660,"人脸识别综述: 人世间找不两张完全一样的脸!","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E8%AE%B2%20%E4%BA%BA%E8%84%B8%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"人脸识别综述: 人世间找不两张完全一样的脸!. Slides (PDF), 2020; 94 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 人世间找不两张完全一样的脸!, 人脸识别交互背景, 无处不在的身份验证, Biometrics比较, 基于可见光的人脸识别, 问题分解, 人脸检测方法, 提取肤色区域, 如何快速计算任意矩形内, Adaboost学习算法流程, 类比一下, 可变形模板——以下巴检测为例, and 基于模板匹配的识别."
  10661,第六周 唇读交互技术,"https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%94%87%E8%AF%BB%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG cs.DB stat.ML computer-science statistics algorithms machine-learning databases lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"第六周 唇读交互技术. Slides (PDF), 2020; 66 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; databases; deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover 唇读和唇动身份识别概述, 马特拉奇说了什么?, McGurk效应, 例子:身份辨认, 关于唇动的两种研究方向, 积累阶段-2, 以DCT+LDA+HMM的唇读系统,在中等规模的数据库上, 传统算法介绍, Haar + AdaBoost 嘴部检测, 实时的唇部轮廓提取系统, 特征提取, 基于像素的特征, Intel AVSR OpenSource, and 基于深度学习的唇语识别."
  10662,"数据可视化: 05 图可视化","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/DataVis_05_Graph_Visualization.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics graph-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"数据可视化: 05 图可视化. Slides (PDF), 2020; 65 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): topology. Slides cover 什么是图数据, A graph or chart or diagram, 地铁线路, 图的基本概念, 相较于树型数据中明显的层次结构,图(网络)数据, 需要解决的问题, 计算节点的实际位置, Grandjean, Martin (2014), 弧长链接图, 相邻矩阵, 相邻矩阵路径追踪, 其它布局, 聚类及拓扑简化, and 聚类及拓扑简化(时序图)."
  10663,"数据可视化: 06 层次数据可视化","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/DataVis_06_Hierarchic_Visualization.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics combinatorics graph-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"数据可视化: 06 层次数据可视化. Slides (PDF), 2020; 77 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory. Slides cover 节点链接法, 层次数据, 层次数据(Hierarchical Data ), 国内公司结构图, 游戏行为树, 图的结构表达, 层次数据的可视化, 正交布局, Flare软件包的目录结构, 节点链图的问题, 树图(Treemaps)的一个问题, and Flare软件包内容的气泡可视化."
  10664,第1章 概 论,"https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/%E7%A1%95%E5%A3%AB%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0%20%E6%A6%82%E8%AE%BA.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics algorithms machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"第1章 概 论. Slides (PDF), 2020; 44 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; machine learning. Sections: 第1章 概 论; 本次课程内容; 1. 有关课程教学; 课程信息; 幻灯片编号 5; 幻灯片编号 6; 幻灯片编号 7; 课程讲解的主要知识点; 课程设置; 课程教学进度; 2. 什么是计算机视觉; 计算机视觉概念. Slides cover 1. 关于课程教学, 课程教学目的, 教师简介, 按时提交到指定邮箱, 图像处理基础、滤波与多尺度表达, 计算机视觉是利用采集的图像或视频,对物体和场景进行识别、表达和, 人类从外界获得的信息约有75%来自视觉系统, 计算机视觉可以用于测量、恢复立体结构, 机器学习大师Yann LeCun利用美国国家标准技术研究所的手写数字库, and Facebook及Google公司的人脸识别技术的研究取得显著成果."
  10665,"第4章 图像对齐问题: 第4章 图像对齐问题, 本次课程内容","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/%E7%A1%95%E5%A3%AB%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%281%29.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics graph-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"第4章 图像对齐问题: 第4章 图像对齐问题, 本次课程内容. Slides (PDF), 2020; 45 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Sections: 第4章 图像对齐问题; 本次课程内容; 1. 图像对应概念的引入—视点概念; 图像对应的引入; 图像对应概念; 图像特征与特征匹配实例; 基于特征点的对应实例; 2. 图像对应问题及应用; 图像对应看作参数拟合问题实例; 仿射变换; 图像对应的应用; 3. 特征匹配 Feature matching. Slides cover 1. 图像对应概念的引入, 视点的概念:图像采集时人眼所在的位置和方向, 两个不同视点的采样, 两幅图像分别有各自的特征点, 特征匹配问题, 希望对强度变化、噪声、像素纹理可感知性的微小变化时,使得描述的特征及匹, 计算每个格子中的点数, 常见的匹配方法, 怎样判断哪些特征点对是可靠的?, and RANSAC的基本假设是."
  10666,"第4章 图像对齐问题: 第5章 二值图像分析, 本次课程内容","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/%E7%A1%95%E5%A3%AB%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC5%E7%AB%A0%20%E4%BA%8C%E5%80%BC%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"第4章 图像对齐问题: 第5章 二值图像分析, 本次课程内容. Slides (PDF), 2020; 66 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Sections: 第5章 二值图像分析; 本次课程内容; 1. 什么是二值图像; 使用二值图像的优点; 2. 二值图像的创建; 彩色图像灰度化方法; 灰度图像二值化方法; 利用阈值二值化—— 直方图确定阈值方法; 幻灯片编号 9; 图像二值化结果; 确定阈值方法——全局阈值迭代方法; 全局阈值迭代计算的实例. Slides cover 什么是二值图像?, 去掉无关信息的干扰,不考虑颜色等干扰信息, 单阈二值化,所有像素都使用相同的阈值,适用于直方图双峰值情况, 选择一个初始化的阈值T (通常取灰度值的平均值), 游程长度编码(run-length encoding), 假设二值图像前景是一个长形状的目标,长轴方向被定义为物体的方向, 如何将一幅图像中所有被标记的点组合成物体图像, 连通成份递归算法(假设L初值为0), 距离概念, and (1)连通图像区域必须细化成连通线结构."
  10667,第6章 纹理特征及分析,"https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95_%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/%E7%A1%95%E5%A3%AB%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC6%E7%AB%A0%20%E7%BA%B9%E7%90%86%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E5%8F%8A%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG math.ST stat.ME stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"第6章 纹理特征及分析. Slides (PDF), 2020; 49 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Subject (translated): statistics and statistical inference; deep learning and neural networks. Sections: 第6章 纹理特征及分析; 本次课程内容; 1.对纹理的认识; 对纹理的认识; 幻灯片编号 5; 2. 纹理分析的目的; 3. 纹理的定义及分类; 纹理的定义; 两种主要的纹理类型; 4. 纹理特征分析; (1)统计分析方法; 共生矩阵统计方法. Slides cover 1. 对纹理的认识, 包含多个纹理区域的图象, 两种常见的定义形式, 主要步骤:先进行特征提取,再进行分析(学习、分类), 灰度级共生矩阵描述, 共生矩阵在一定程度上反映了纹理图像各灰度级在空间的分布特性, 自相关函数被用来测量纹理的周期性以及纹理基元的大小, 纹理可以看作是由基元周期性地互相编织而成。, 模型分析法:一种表征纹理的方法是确定纹理图像的解析模型。, and 1975年,美国数学家Mandelbort首次提出了分形(Fractal)的概念。."
  10668,"Deep Learning Tutorial: Part 10: Deep Learning - i","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95_%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/21/10%20Deep%20Learning-i.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,Lee Hung-yi,2020,null,"Deep Learning Tutorial: Part 10: Deep Learning - i. Tutorial slides (PDF) by Lee Hung-yi, 2020; 98 pages. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Slides cover Shadow and Deep, Neural Network, Q: How many layers? How many neurons for each, Gradient Descent, Gradient Descent - Difficulty, Fat + Short v.s. Thin + Tall, Do not always blame Overfitting, Mini-batch, Good Results on, AutoEncoder, Deep Boltzmann Machine, Let’s try it, and Learning Rates."
  10669,"Deep Learning Tutorial: Part 11: Deep Learning - ii","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95_%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/21/11%20Deep%20Learning-ii.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,Lee Hung-yi,2020,null,"Deep Learning Tutorial: Part 11: Deep Learning - ii. Tutorial slides (PDF) by Lee Hung-yi, 2020; 82 pages. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Slides cover Why Overfitting?, Panacea for Overfitting, Weight Decay, Dropout, Variants of Neural Networks, The whole CNN, CNN – Convolution, Flatten, Input, and Example Application."
  10670,"《高级机器学习》: Part 2: PRML基础知识回顾","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95_%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/21/2%203%20PRML%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%9B%9E%E9%A1%BE.pdf",github.com,cs.IT,cs.IT cs.LG math.FA math.IT computer-science mathematics information-theory machine-learning functional-analysis probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"《高级机器学习》: Part 2: PRML基础知识回顾. Slides (PDF), 2020; 30 pages. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Sections: 高级机器学习; Review – curve fitting; Review – Bayes related; Review – decision theory; Review – inference and decision; Review – information theory; Review – probability distribution; Review – linear regression model; Review – linear classification model; Review – neural network; Review – kernel methods; Review – support vector machine. Slides cover Polynomial curve fitting, Bayes’ theorem, Model selection, Information theory, Generalization of the Bernoulli, Student T, Fisher linear discriminant, Feed-forward Network Functions, Maximum Margin Classifiers, and Soft margin SVMs."
  10671,"《高级机器学习》: Part 6: 2 GPvariants - MoGP","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E5%AD%A6%E7%A1%95_%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/21/6-2%20GPvariants%20-MoGP.pdf",github.com,math.FA,math.FA mathematics functional-analysis lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"《高级机器学习》: Part 6: 2 GPvariants - MoGP. Slides (PDF), 2020; 25 pages. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecnu-PGCourseShare. Sections: A Brief Tutorial of Mixtures of Gaussian Processes; Finite mixture; Mixtures of Gaussian Processes; Infinite Mixture; iMGPE; Generative Mixture; AiMoGPE; VI for AiMoGPE; Prediction; 幻灯片编号 17; 幻灯片编号 18; Multivariate mixture. Slides cover Volker Tresp (NIPS, 2001), Indicator, Better fitting data, Carl E. Rasmussen and Z. Ghahramani, Gating network, Likelihood, Literatures, Joint distribution, and Optimizing the Hyper-parameters."
  10672,"Data Mining: 主要内容","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98/1%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0%2B%E5%BC%95%E8%AE%BA.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"Data Mining: 主要内容. Slides (PDF), 2020; 46 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): databases. Slides cover 主要内容, 需要是发明之母(Necessity is the, Evolution of Sciences, 什么是数据挖掘?, 数据挖掘和商务智能, 架构: 典型的数据挖掘系统, 公司分析&风险管理, 数据挖掘系统&工具, 数据挖掘功能, 我们能否发现所有有趣的模式?, 数据挖掘使用的主要技术, 数据挖掘系统的分类, 数据挖掘的主要问题, and 数据挖掘研究的简要历史."
  10673,"第四章数据仓库与联机: 分析处理","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98/4%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E7%AB%A0%2B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E4%B8%8E%E8%81%94%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB cs.AR computer-science databases computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,Amy Zhang,2020,null,"第四章数据仓库与联机: 分析处理. Slides (PDF) by Amy Zhang, 2020; 75 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): databases; computer architecture. Slides cover 主要内容, 从事务数据到决策知识, 基于事务数据库的决策支持系统DSS, 数据仓库的概念, 数据仓库的特征, OLTP vs. OLAP, 数据仓库的体系结构, 数据仓库开发的推荐方法, 数据立方体, 事实星座模式的例子, 对应于立方体的方体格, Typical OLAP, OLAP查询的有效处理, and Attribute-Oriented Induction: An."
  10674,"第五章挖掘频繁模式、关联: 和相关","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98/5%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%AB%A0%2B%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E9%A2%91%E7%B9%81%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E3%80%81%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.DB computer-science algorithms databases lecture-notes slides github,Amy Zhang,2020,null,"第五章挖掘频繁模式、关联: 和相关. Slides (PDF) by Amy Zhang, 2020; 64 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): databases; algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 主要内容, 频繁模式分析, 频繁模式挖掘的重要性, 极大项集与频繁闭项集, 关联规则基本模型, 频繁项集, 产生候选项集的例子, 频繁模式增长, 从FP-tree的头表开始, 单一FP-tree路径的产生, 挖掘各种类型的关联规则, 挖掘量化关联规则, 其它的兴趣度量: 提升度, and 基于约束的频繁模式挖掘."
  10675,"第五章分类: 基本概念","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98/6%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E7%AB%A0%2B%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.PR stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics algorithms machine-learning probability lecture-notes slides github,Amy Zhang,2020,null,"第五章分类: 基本概念. Slides (PDF) by Amy Zhang, 2020; 105 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; probability; deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover 基本概念, 分类vs. 数值预测, 分类—两阶段过程, 决策树生成, 信息增益, Gini 指数, 朴素贝叶斯分类, 贝叶斯信念网络, 使用顺序覆盖算法的规则归纳, 神经网络作为分类器, 后向传播和可解释性, 为什么SVM对高维数据有效?, 有关KNN算法的讨论, and 粗糙集方法."
  10676,"数据结构 辅导: 算法与数据结构","https://github.com/tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84-%E5%8F%B6%E7%90%AA/PPT/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2020,null,"数据结构 辅导: 算法与数据结构. Slides (PDF), 2020; 60 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive tianyilt/ecust-CourseShare. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 算法与数据结构, 理解问题, 递归实现, 解决一个非常简单的问题,往往也有多种方法,且不同方法之间的, 【例】学生成绩表, 逻辑结构:数据对象的逻辑组织关系。, 抽象数据类型:是指一个数学模型以及定义在该模型上的一组操作。, 例:抽象数据类型“复数”的定义, 定义:一组完成特定任务的有穷指令序列。所有算法须满足如下标准, (2)伪代码描述算法, 算法的评价标准, 与算法执行时间相关的因素, and 算法的时间复杂度通常是问题的规模n 的某个函数T(n)."
