  10707,"Dynamic Multi-threaded: Programming for Shared-Memory","https://github.com/vanderbiltscl/SC3260_HPC/blob/master/lectures/Shared.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture slides github,Sun Hongyang,2020,null,"Dynamic Multi-threaded: Programming for Shared-Memory. Lecture slides (PDF) by Sun Hongyang, 2020; 48 pages. Part of SC3260 / SC5260: Instructors Ana Gainaru (website) Hongyang Sun (website). Slides cover Abstract Multicore Architecture, Multicore Programming, Fibonacci numbers form a sequence, Compute y = Ax, Cache Coherence, Example, Race Conditions, Issues with Shared-Memory Processors, Program Characteristics, Optimize Parallel Performance, and P P PP."
  10708,Exposing Hidden Performance Opportunities in High Performance GPU Applications,"https://github.com/vanderbiltscl/SC3260_HPC/blob/master/research/p2_slides.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.LG computer-science ml-systems survey slides github,Chloe O,2020,null,"Exposing Hidden Performance Opportunities in High Performance GPU Applications. Slides (PDF) by Chloe O, 2020; 18 pages. Part of SC3260 / SC5260: Instructors Ana Gainaru (website) Hongyang Sun (website). Slides cover Objectives Introduction, Objectives The Problem, Objectives The Relevance, Unobvious Missed Parallelization, Duplicate Data Transfers, Synchronizations Overview, Synchronizations Implicit, Synchronizations Explicit, Synchronizations, and Overall Conclusions."
