  11026,"LINGO简介: LINGO软件简介","https://github.com/HangChi/BHU-SoftwareEngineering/blob/main/%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1/%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/LINGO%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6%E7%9F%AD%EF%BC%89.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization slides github,null,2019,null,"LINGO简介: LINGO软件简介. Slides (PDF), 2019; 151 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 此仓库主要包括渤海大学软件工程专业相关基础课、专业课的相关课件及资料,资料仅供参考,请自己判断其适用性。. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 内容提要, 1. LINGO入门, 安装文件20M多一点,需要接受安装协议、选择安装, 运行状态窗口, 集合的基本用法和LINGO模型的基本要素, 注:由于输入中没有给出行名,所以行名是系统自动按照行号1-, 输入程序, 本例的LINGO求解, 派生集合的定义语法, 集合操作函数, SETS, File|Ope, LINGO系统(LINGO)主菜单, and LINGO|OPTIONS|Linear Solver(线性求解程序)选项卡."
  11027,"Advanced Section #1: Linear Algebra and Hypothesis Testing (The Short Version) (Harvard-IACS/2018-CS109A)","https://github.com/Harvard-IACS/2018-CS109A/blob/master/content/a_sections/a_section7/presentation/a_section7.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE math.RA math.ST math.NA computer-science mathematics linear-algebra software-engineering statistics optimization lecture-notes slides github,William Claybaugh,2019,null,"Advanced Section #1: Linear Algebra and Hypothesis Testing (The Short Version) (Harvard-IACS/2018-CS109A). Slides (PDF) by William Claybaugh, 2019; 58 pages. Part of 2018 CS109A Course Repository. Slides cover DECISION TREES, What is a decision tree?, Misclassification Error (ME): we split the parent node’s subset by, Surrogate splits, Pruning, What are ensemble methods?, Boosting, By solving a simple 1D optimization problem, we could also find the, COMMON BAGGING TECHNIQUES, COMMON BOOSTING TECHNIQUES, In general AdaBoost has been known to perform better than SVMs, and General approach to parameter tuning."
  11028,"CS109A Introduction to Data Science: Lecture 23: Ab Testing","https://github.com/Harvard-IACS/2018-CS109A/blob/master/content/lectures/lecture23/presentation/lecture23_ab_testing.pdf",github.com,cs.SE,cs.SE math.CT computer-science mathematics software-engineering category-theory lecture-notes survey slides github,Kevin Rader,2019,null,"CS109A Introduction to Data Science: Lecture 23: Ab Testing. Lecture slides (PDF) by Kevin Rader, 2019; 41 pages. Part of 2018 CS109A Course Repository. Slides cover Association vs. Causation, Association vs. Causation (cont.), Controlling for confounding: advantages/disadvantages, Completely Randomized Design, Assigning subject to treatments, Analyzing the results, 2-sample t-test, Normal approximation to the binomial, Analyses for CRD Experiments in Python, Boxplot to illustrate ANOVA, Comparing categorical variables, Randomization test, Fisher’s exact test, and The app update roll-out problem."
