  11128,"高级人工智能: 沈华伟 (HuangCongQing/UCAS_Course_2019)","https://github.com/HuangCongQing/UCAS_Course_2019/blob/master/%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD19-20%E7%A7%8B%E5%AD%A3/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%B2%20%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"高级人工智能: 沈华伟 (HuangCongQing/UCAS_Course_2019). Slides (PDF), 2019; 63 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive HuangCongQing/UCAS_Course_2019. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 课程信息, 授课和考核, 第1周人工智能概述(9月3日), 什么是智能?, 人工智能的冬天, 认知科学, 图灵测试, 人工智能三大学派, 人工智能之哲学基础, 人工智能伦理, “准人”水平的人工智能, 人工智能案例实践, 人工智能案例实践——国际象棋, and 人工智能实践案例——围棋."
  11129,本科生计算机视觉,"https://github.com/KBDY/zhejiang/blob/master/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/2018%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%A0%E6%8F%90%E7%BA%B2.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides github,null,2019,null,"本科生计算机视觉. Slides (PDF), 2019; 20 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 来到一所大学,从第一次接触许多课,直到一门一门完成,这个过程中我们时常收集起许多资料和情报。. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 考试方式:闭卷、中文命题、中英文作答, Gestalt Laws(格式塔法则), 二值图像, 模板卷积, Hough变换直线检测, 图像频域, 局部特征Local Feature, 图像拼接Image Stitching, 光流解决的是什么问题?, 图像分割, 相机模型, 相机定标Camera Calibration, and 立体视觉."
  11130,"博弈树搜索: Lab10 博弈树搜索","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/lab10_%E5%8D%9A%E5%BC%88%E6%A0%91%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"博弈树搜索: Lab10 博弈树搜索. Slides (PDF), 2019; 21 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover Ø理论课内容回顾, 二人零和博弈问题, and Minimax搜索."
  11131,"DQN与Policy Network: 林立晖 (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate)","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/lab10_DQN%E4%B8%8EPolicy%20Network.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG math.PR cs.AI math.ST computer-science mathematics reinforcement-learning machine-learning markov-chains probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"DQN与Policy Network: 林立晖 (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate). Slides (PDF), 2019; 15 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): probability; machine learning. Slides cover Q-learning回顾, 思考:Q矩阵储存了所有的(s, a) 对所对应的Q值,大小是num_state x num_state 的,会有什么问题?, 传统方法中,对每个输入的state,我们都需要有一个对应action,才能计算(s, a) 对应的Reward,从, 价值函数近似, Deep Q-learning Network, DQN训练过程, Policy Network, Monte Carlo Tree Search (MCTS), and DQN + Policy Network + MCTS:以AlphaGo为例."
  11132,"强化学习: Lab11 强化学习","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/lab11_%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics algorithms machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"强化学习: Lab11 强化学习. Slides (PDF), 2019; 29 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; machine learning. Slides cover 遗传算法, 本质是decision making问题,即自动进行决策,并且可以做连续决策, 强化学习vs有监督学习, 房间作为图的节点,两房间之间若有门相连则对应节点间的一条边,, 类似地,构建一个与R同阶的矩阵Q,表示agent已经从经验中学到的知识。, 得到充分训练的Q之后, 第二次episode:随机选择一个初始状态,此处选状态3。让agent执行走, 当矩阵Q接近收敛状态,agent便学习到了转移至目标状态的最佳路径, Project, 一组人数1~2人,队伍名字,共同评分,推荐组队完成, Rank, and 最终提交."
  11133,"数据降维: Lab5 词向量","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/lab5_%E8%AF%8D%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG math.PR stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics machine-learning probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"数据降维: Lab5 词向量. Slides (PDF), 2019; 35 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): machine learning; probability. Slides cover 数据降维方法, PCA (Principal Component Analysis), LDA (Linear Discriminant Analysis), Word2Vec, Word2Vec – Skip-Gram, and Word2Vec – CBOW."
  11134,"林立晖: 循环神经网络 (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate)","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/lab7_%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"林立晖: 循环神经网络 (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate). Slides (PDF), 2019; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): deep learning and neural networks; machine learning. Slides cover 时序扩展, 针对对象:序列数据。例如文本,是字母和词汇的序列;语音,是音节的序列;, Basic Structure, 时序反向传播, 堆叠RNN(Stacked RNN), 输入门同理,先将当前输入经过两个激活函数,然后点乘,表示当前产生的隐状态有多少需要被保, 输出门原理依旧相同,当前输入经过激活函数,和更新后的cell state点乘得到最终输出。, 在tensorflow的RNN结构中,最终可访问的输出包括两部分,一是最后一个时刻的隐状态,二是, RNN中的Dropout不直接对网络结构进行更改,因为RNN属于自回归模型,会放大噪声,干扰自己的学习,, RNN做情感分类, and RNN做语音识别."
  11135,"人工智能: 课程信息","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Lec%201%20%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"人工智能: 课程信息. Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 56 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 课程信息, 人类的自然智能伴随着人类活动, 什么是人工智能?, 如果机器具有智能,那么它的目标就是要使, AI的起源与发展, “知识” 是通过专家来迁移的, 贷款用户:高风险或者低风险?<-> 银行家, 鸟的输入向量, 基于这些数据的分类结果,可以推出以, 一个更好的分类模型, 关键步骤, and 距离指标."
  11136,"人工智能: ——人工神经网络II (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate)","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Lec%205%20%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%20II.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"人工智能: ——人工神经网络II (KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate). Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover 人工神经网络的研究是受到模拟生物神经系, 树突是神经元细胞体的延伸,神经元通过树, 神经网络模型由大量简单的交互节点组成, 人工神经元, 训练算法的每次迭代中有两个阶段, 在前向传递阶段,从前一次迭代获得的, 对于这种类型的网络,不采用PLA的阈值函数,而, 另一个常见的激活函数是sigmoid函数, 反向传播, 训练时间长, and 从网络中提取规则:网络修剪(network."
  11137,"人工智能: 搜索可以解决的问题","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%88%E9%A5%B6%E6%B4%8B%E8%BE%89%EF%BC%89/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Lec%206%20%E7%9B%B2%E7%9B%AE%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"人工智能: 搜索可以解决的问题. Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 58 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 搜索可以解决的问题, 在游戏策略中取得较好的结果, 我们需要考虑下面几个部分来对搜索问题进行形式化定义, 规则:可以把数字移到空格里(也可以视为, 3:吸尘器世界, TreeSearch(Frontier, Sucessors, Goal? ), 上面的例子表明了状态选择的顺序会对搜索操作产生重要的, 通用的选择方式, 宽度优先搜索具有完备性和最优性, 完备性, 假设每个动作的成本≥ s > 0, 完备性: No, Start, and Arad."
  11138,"Lecture 1,数据库系统实验: Yubao Liu (刘玉葆)","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%88%98%E7%8E%89%E8%91%86%EF%BC%89/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8Cppt%E5%90%88.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases lecture-notes slides github,Genan Dai,2019,null,"Lecture 1,数据库系统实验: Yubao Liu (刘玉葆). Lecture slides (PDF) by Genan Dai, 2019; 245 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): databases. Sections: Lecture 1; Lecture 2; Lecture 3; Lecture 4; Lecture 5; Lecture 6; Lecture 7; Lecture 8_空值处理; Lecture 9; Lecture 10; Lecture 11; Lecture 12. Slides cover 实验课参考教材, 参考教材主要目录, 本节课提纲, 实验目的, 5. 查询所有选课表中的课程号(不重复显示), 一. 嵌套查询, 1. 向students表中插入元祖(学号:700045678,姓名:LiMing,email, 以school数据库为例,在该数据库中存在4张表格,分别为, 以USER2身份登录,授予USER3对表STUDENTS插入和更新的权限,并且授, and 6.查询成绩小于0的选课记录,统计总数,平均分,最大最小值。."
  11139,"Lecture 1,Fall 2017/2018 数据库系统实验: 实验课参考教材","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%88%98%E7%8E%89%E8%91%86%EF%BC%89/Lecture%201.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases lecture-notes slides github,Genan Dai,2019,null,"Lecture 1,Fall 2017/2018 数据库系统实验: 实验课参考教材. Lecture slides (PDF) by Genan Dai, 2019; 18 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): databases. Slides cover 实验课参考教材, 参考教材主要目录, 本节课提纲, 实验环境, SQL Server 2008 安装, SQL Server 2008 启动, SQL Server 2008 主界面介绍, 实验数据, 实验数据导入管理器, 3. 选择School data.MDF文件, 单击“确定”按, 1.新建数据库CREAT DATABASE <数据库名字>, 2.新建表create table <数据库名字>(<列名>,<数据类型>,.), and 3. 查询数据select <列名> from <表名或视图名>."
  11140,"Lecture 1,Fall 2017/2018 数据库系统实验: 本节课提纲","https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%88%98%E7%8E%89%E8%91%86%EF%BC%89/Lecture%2010.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases lecture-notes slides github,Genan Dai,2019,null,"Lecture 1,Fall 2017/2018 数据库系统实验: 本节课提纲. Lecture slides (PDF) by Genan Dai, 2019; 20 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): databases. Slides cover 本节课提纲, 实验目的, 实验内容, 以school数据库为例,在该数据库中存在4张表格,分别为, 实验准备, 1.建立表SC,令sno和cno分别为参照Stu_Union表以及Course表的外键,, 2.演示违反参照完整性的插入数据。, 3.在主表Stu_Union中删除数据,演示级联删除。, 4.为了演示多重级联删除,建立Stu_Card表,令card_id为主键,并令stu_id, 2)建立表ICBC_Card表, 3)通过删除Students表中一条记录,演示三个表的多重级联删除。, 要演示多重级联删除,必须去除表choices原有约束,然后建立新的外键约束,, 5.演示事务中多重级联删除失败的处理。修改ICBC_Card表的外键属性,使, and 建立事务del."
