  11265,10 Sockets and JDBC,"https://github.com/QSCTech/zju-icicles/blob/master/Java%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/10%20Sockets%20and%20JDBC.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"10 Sockets and JDBC. Slides (PDF), 2019; 45 pages. From the course-materials archive QSCTech/zju-icicles. Slides cover Identifying a machine, TCP vs. UDP, 数据传输, JDBC, PreparedStatement, Classic Service Designs, Scalability Goals, Background: Events in AWT, Reactor 3: Acceptor, A simple use of GoF State-Object pattern, Worker Thread Pools, Using PooledExecutor, and Why JNI?."
