  11271,Lecture Nine 2019,"https://github.com/SDUFE-Resource/SDUFE-Course/blob/master/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/lecture%20notes%202019/lecture%20nine%202019.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides github,null,2019,null,"Lecture Nine 2019. Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 10 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 山东财经大学课程资源的作业,笔记,课件,总结,经验等学生原创内容,并不定期更新. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover RSA exercise, CERTIFICATE, Digital signature verification, 证书从产生到撤销具有一定的生命周期,, PKI(Pubic Key Infrastructure,公钥基础设置), SSL provides, and C-->S helloserver, SSL version,."
