  11353,"Differentiable Optimization-Based Modeling for Machine Learning, Slides: My Ph.D. Contributions","https://github.com/bamos/thesis/blob/master/slides.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG math.OC math.CA stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics machine-learning optimization real-analysis control-theory survey slides talk thesis github,null,2019,null,"Differentiable Optimization-Based Modeling for Machine Learning, Slides: My Ph.D. Contributions. Slides (PDF), 2019; 69 pages. From a repository described as: + This repository is by Brandon Amos and contains the full source code and data to produce my thesis document. + The slides are available in pdf and pptx format. Slides cover My Ph.D. Contributions, Brandon Amos Optimization-Based Modeling for Machine Learning 3, Input Convex Neural Networks, Overview for the remainder of this talk, Convex optimization viewpoint of, Implicitly differentiating the KKT conditions, Should RL policies have a system, Model Predictive Control with SQP, Imitation learning with a linear model, A PyTorch MPC Solver, Background: cvxpy, Full source code example: OptNet QP, .Inputs Loss, and Thesourcecodebehindall ofmyworkisfree and publicly available."
  11354,"操作系统: zhang Chunyuan OS 1","https://github.com/beiyuouo/hainanu-course-comments/blob/main/5.%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E8%AF%BE/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/PPT/zhangChunyuan_OS_1.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems slides github,null,2019,null,"操作系统: zhang Chunyuan OS 1. Slides (PDF), 2019; 105 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 我们来自五湖四海,相聚于海南岛。每次我想选课的时候,苦于没有一个课程交流平台,都是在各种互帮互助群中询问选课问题,但是依然会踩坑。同时课程的复习资料也是不断向学长学姐所要才能得到代代相传多年的资料(我甚至还能拿到 06 年的资料)。本站也是想将这种资料在不侵犯老师和各种作者的前提下,以公开的形式分享出来。. Subject (translated): operating systems. Sections: 幻灯片编号 1; 本章主要内容; 1.1 操作系统的目标、作用; 1.1.3 操作系统发展的主要动力; 1.2 操作系统的发展过程; 1.2.1 无操作系统的计算机系统; 幻灯片编号 13; 图1-3 单道批处理系统的处理流程; 幻灯片编号 23; 图1-5 分时系统示意图; 幻灯片编号 31; 1.2.7 多处理机操作系统. Slides cover 1.1 操作系统的目标和作用, 操作系统的定义, 基本概念, 分时系统的特征, 微机操作系统, ٭在多道程序环境下多个程序如何并发运行?, ٭内存分配机制中应具有的功能和结构, 3、设备处理, and 1、无结构OS."
  11355,zhang Chunyuan OS 2,"https://github.com/beiyuouo/hainanu-course-comments/blob/main/5.%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E8%AF%BE/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/PPT/zhangChunyuan_OS_2.pdf",github.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems slides github,null,2019,null,"zhang Chunyuan OS 2. Slides (PDF), 2019; 206 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 我们来自五湖四海,相聚于海南岛。每次我想选课的时候,苦于没有一个课程交流平台,都是在各种互帮互助群中询问选课问题,但是依然会踩坑。同时课程的复习资料也是不断向学长学姐所要才能得到代代相传多年的资料(我甚至还能拿到 06 年的资料)。本站也是想将这种资料在不侵犯老师和各种作者的前提下,以公开的形式分享出来。. Subject (translated): operating systems. Sections: 本章主要内容; 2.2 进程的描述; 2.5 进程同步经典问题. Slides cover 处理机管理, 2.1 前趋图和程序执行, 2.1.2 程序的顺序执行及其特征, 1、进程的定义, 2> 具有挂起状态的进程状态转换, 进程的创建, 2.3.5 进程的挂起与激活, 1、整型信号量机制, ٭信号量集可以用于各种情况的资源分配和释放,下, and ٭管程与进程比较."
