  11413,For Students of Computer 2017,"https://github.com/chenyang1999/MyComputerCollegeCourses/blob/master/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/%E7%AC%AC1-9%E7%AB%A0%2B%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%8A%2B%E7%AC%AC2-7%E7%AB%A0%E8%AF%BE%2B%E8%AF%BE%E5%90%8E%E4%B9%A0%E9%A2%98%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88_%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E7%BA%A7%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC64%E9%A1%B5%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%AE%B2%EF%BC%89.ppt.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR math.NA cs.NA computer-science mathematics computer-architecture numerical-analysis lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"For Students of Computer 2017. Slides (PDF), 2019; 111 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive chenyang1999/MyComputerCollegeCourses. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover Ch2: Data Representation, 第一讲:数值数据的表示, “转换”的概念在数据表示中的反映, 计算机中的运算器是模运算系统, Unsigned integer(无符号整数), 浮点数(Floating Point)的表示范围, Representation for 0, 用ASCII码表示十进制数, 汉字是表意文字,一个字就是一个方块图形。, 数据的基本宽度, Byte Swap Problem(字节交换问题), 奇偶校验码, 海明校验码, and 校验位的生成和检错、纠错."
