  11486,Acreman Firedrake19,"https://github.com/firedrakeproject/firedrake/blob/main/docs/source/_static/firedrake19-slides/acreman.pdf",github.com,math.AP,math.AP math.NA physics.class-ph math.CA mathematics physics numerical-analysis pde solid-mechanics algebraic-geometry slides github,null,2019,null,"Acreman Firedrake19. Slides (PDF), 2019; 15 pages. From a repository described as: Firedrake is an automated system for the portable solution of partial differential equations using the finite element method (FEM). Firedrake enables users to employ a wide range of discretisations to an infinite variety of PDEs and obtain high performance code on CPUs. Slides cover Why REXI?, Rational approximation of exponential, REXI study, Convergence tests, Scaling tests, Future work, and Build with Intel toolchain and run DG advection example under MPI profiler."
  11487,信息安全数学基础 (fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc),"https://github.com/fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%980-%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80-%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"信息安全数学基础 (fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc). Slides (PDF), 2019; 27 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 任课教师, 为什么要学习《信息安全数学基础》?, 公开信道上的“安全”通信, 传统的对称密码体制, 密钥管理, 密钥分发, 不支持“开放系统”, “传统的”对称密码体制无法, Diffie和Hellman因为提出“公钥密码”这一概念, RSA获得图灵奖, 公钥密码体制, 公钥密码体制的基本思想, and 公钥密码体制的优势."
  11488,"信息安全数学基础: 第一章整数","https://github.com/fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc/blob/master/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80-%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%981%EF%BC%88%E6%95%B4%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%89.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"信息安全数学基础: 第一章整数. Slides (PDF), 2019; 66 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive fycm123/postgraduate-curriculum-uestc. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 1.2 整数中的算法, 是任意两个整数,, 为4和7的倍数。, 证明:存在性。当, (4)对于任意两个整数, 是三个整数,若, 是两个整数,不妨设, 利用这几个初始值及递推关系式(1.3),就可依次计, 证明:显然, 1.3素数、算数基本定理, 解小于等于, 截止到2016年1月,GIMPS共搜索到15个梅森素数。现, 假如在素数王国里素数只能找邻近的同类结婚,那3、5, and 是一个递减序列,所以一定存在某个."
