  11564,"现代计算机网络: 1.3.1以太网及其发展","https://github.com/lyandut/HUST-Invictus/blob/master/%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A3%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/2019%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Ch1-3%E6%8A%A5%E6%96%87%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,Li zhitang,2019,null,"现代计算机网络: 1.3.1以太网及其发展. Slides (PDF) by Li zhitang, 2019; 42 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive lyandut/HUST-Invictus. Subject (translated): computer networks; topology. Slides cover 1.3.1以太网及其发展, 直连网络存在两个问题, 而且交换机提供了另外一个好处:每个host到Switch是独立的带宽。所, 教科书3.1节介绍了三种交换的方法, 高速局域网:快速以太网100Mbps, 高速局域网: 1000Mbps以太网, 100Gbps以太网, 广播域和冲突域, 1.3.3 交换机生成树协议, 1.3.3 交换机生成树协议-选举, and 1.3.3 交换机生成树协议-选举过程."
