  11777,Intro-nlp-2019,"https://github.com/yandexdataschool/nlp_course/blob/2026/resources/slides/lecture_intro.pdf",github.com,cs.CL,cs.CL cs.LG cs.AI cs.IT computer-science large-language-models information-theory machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"Intro-nlp-2019. Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 39 pages. Part of YSDA Natural Language Processing course: week02 Language Modeling - Lecture: Language Modeling: what does it mean? Left-to-right framework. Slides cover David Talbot ShAD2019, ›What is NLP?, Natural Language Processing, ›Machine Learning, ›Ambiguity, A computer that understands you like your mother, Syntactic Differences, and ›Information Theory (1940s)."
