  11779,"王宏志: 大数据管理概述","https://github.com/yink12138/HITCS_Papers/blob/master/%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%28%E4%B8%80%29.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB math.FA computer-science mathematics databases functional-analysis slides github,HZ Wang,2019,null,"王宏志: 大数据管理概述. Slides (PDF) by HZ Wang, 2019; 134 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 上大学以后,作为专业做题家的我第一次对考试产生了恐惧,人类的恐惧来源于未知,而我的恐惧自然来自于不知道考试题会怎么考。但老师们的精力是有限的,他们在出题前大多会参考往年考试的题目,比如线代考试最后一题的答案连续五年相同。经我个人经历检验,做好往年题与考高分之间有很强的正相关性,因此往年题是期末复习不可不看的重要资料。但当我看见某张记忆高价贩卖期末假题和某SDN高价贩卖期末真题时,我就在想,如果有一天我能得到真题,我一定要公开所有,重铸做题家荣光,我辈义不容辞。. Subject (translated): databases. Slides cover 大数据管理概述, 为什么要管理数据?, DBMS的主要功能, 文件内记录的组织, 查询处理, 自然连接, 应用规则, 事务(Transaction)的概念, 循环划分, 共享磁盘系统的缓存一致性协议例, 独立并行, MPP无共享拓扑架构, and 哈希Distribution:数据均."
  11780,"机器视觉与图像处理: 第2讲图像的获取","https://github.com/yinze00/ZJU-OPT/blob/master/%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0%20%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E7%9A%84%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"机器视觉与图像处理: 第2讲图像的获取. Slides (PDF), 2019; 26 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive yinze00/ZJU-OPT. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 本节内容, 视觉识别的一般过程:轮廓->形状->图形->图像, Absorption, 视细胞:视锥细胞(Cone),视, 蠕动错觉, 图像的数字化, CCD图像探测器, 每个小盆接到的, 倒空量筒, 电荷包的转移是通过变换CCD电极电压来完成的。, 电荷耦合原理, 像感器特性, 图像探测器特性, and 光源选型及使用方法."
  11781,文本数据集简单处理 & KNN (K最近邻),"https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%80/lab1%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8EKNN/lab1.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics algorithms machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"文本数据集简单处理 & KNN (K最近邻). Slides (PDF), 2019; 35 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; machine learning. Slides cover 实验课程内容, 简单的文本数据集处理-编码, 简单的文本数据集处理-TF(Term Frequency), 简单的文本数据集处理:TF-IDF 矩阵, KNN是有监督的机器学习模型, and SemEval 实验数据分析."
  11782,"Lab3: 感知机学习算法与逻辑回归","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%89/lab3%20%E6%84%9F%E7%9F%A5%E6%9C%BA%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92/lab3%20PLA%26LR.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS math.PR computer-science mathematics algorithms probability lecture-notes slides github,MQ L,2019,null,"Lab3: 感知机学习算法与逻辑回归. Slides (PDF) by MQ L, 2019; 21 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; probability. Slides cover Lab1报告存在的一些问题, PLA针对二元分类问题:y= +1, −1, 将阈值θ转化成模型待学习的参数, PLA算法步骤, Wt+1 ←Wt+ yi ≠signWt, 原始的PLA不适用于非, 原始的PLA不适用于非线性可分的数据集,两种解, 硬分类模型:非概率模型,通常有一个决策函数, 对于一个软分类模型,我们假设对某个样例x来说,属, 策函数将加权分数映射到另一个更合理的数据空间,, 在逻辑回归里使用的是:logistic function, 利用逻辑回归函数构建预测函数hx,hx相当于样本属于正类的概率,, 考虑整个训练集的似然函数, and 使用梯度下降法来优化问题,首先另目标函数对参数进行求导,."
  11783,"无信息搜索&启发式搜索: Lab 9无信息搜索&启发式搜索","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B9%9D/lab_9%E6%97%A0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%26%E5%90%AF%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%8F%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics algorithms machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"无信息搜索&启发式搜索: Lab 9无信息搜索&启发式搜索. Slides (PDF), 2019; 33 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; machine learning. Slides cover 搜索问题定义, 无信息搜素策略, 启发式搜索策略, A* 搜索算法, IDA* 搜索算法, and 启发式函数设计."
  11784,lab2 DT,"https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%BA%8C/Lab2%20%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96%E6%A0%91/lab2_DT.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,Microsoft Office 用户,2019,null,"lab2 DT. Slides (PDF) by Microsoft Office 用户, 2019; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): machine learning; deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover 实验课安排, 批改报告, 简单回顾, 建树步骤, 如左图所示,根据age特征的不同取值,将, 特征选择, ID3举例, CART举例, 处理连续型特征, 在决策树生成过程中进行。, 决策树有哪些避免过拟合的方法?, and 课外拓展."
  11785,"林立晖: 循环神经网络 (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook)","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%ADproject/lab7_%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"林立晖: 循环神经网络 (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook). Slides (PDF), 2019; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): deep learning and neural networks; machine learning. Slides cover 时序扩展, 针对对象:序列数据。例如文本,是字母和词汇的序列;语音,是音节的序列;, Basic Structure, 时序反向传播, 堆叠RNN(Stacked RNN), 输入门同理,先将当前输入经过两个激活函数,然后点乘,表示当前产生的隐状态有多少需要被保, 输出门原理依旧相同,当前输入经过激活函数,和更新后的cell state点乘得到最终输出。, 在tensorflow的RNN结构中,最终可访问的输出包括两部分,一是最后一个时刻的隐状态,二是, RNN中的Dropout不直接对网络结构进行更改,因为RNN属于自回归模型,会放大噪声,干扰自己的学习,, RNN做情感分类, and RNN做语音识别."
  11786,"DQN与Policy Network: 林立晖 (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook)","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%ABproject/lab10_DQN%E4%B8%8EPolicy%20Network.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG math.PR cs.AI math.ST computer-science mathematics reinforcement-learning machine-learning markov-chains probability lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"DQN与Policy Network: 林立晖 (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook). Slides (PDF), 2019; 15 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): machine learning; probability. Slides cover Q-learning回顾, 思考:Q矩阵储存了所有的(s, a) 对所对应的Q值,大小是num_state x num_state 的,会有什么问题?, 传统方法中,对每个输入的state,我们都需要有一个对应action,才能计算(s, a) 对应的Reward,从, 价值函数近似, Deep Q-learning Network, DQN训练过程, Policy Network, Monte Carlo Tree Search (MCTS), and DQN + Policy Network + MCTS:以AlphaGo为例."
  11787,"人工智能: ——人工神经网络II (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook)","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Lec%205%20%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%20II.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"人工智能: ——人工神经网络II (ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook). Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): deep learning and neural networks; machine learning. Slides cover 人工神经网络的研究是受到模拟生物神经系, 树突是神经元细胞体的延伸,神经元通过树, 神经网络模型由大量简单的交互节点组成, 人工神经元, 训练算法的每次迭代中有两个阶段, 在前向传递阶段,从前一次迭代获得的, 对于这种类型的网络,不采用PLA的阈值函数,而, 另一个常见的激活函数是sigmoid函数, 反向传播, 训练时间长, and 从网络中提取规则:网络修剪(network."
  11788,人工智能,"https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/Lec%206%20%E7%9B%B2%E7%9B%AE%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"人工智能. Lecture slides (PDF), 2019; 58 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 搜索可以解决的问题, 在游戏策略中取得较好的结果, 我们需要考虑下面几个部分来对搜索问题进行形式化定义, 规则:可以把数字移到空格里(也可以视为, 3:吸尘器世界, TreeSearch(Frontier, Sucessors, Goal? ), 上面的例子表明了状态选择的顺序会对搜索操作产生重要的, 通用的选择方式, 宽度优先搜索具有完备性和最优性, 完备性, 假设每个动作的成本≥ s > 0, 完备性: No, Start, and Arad."
  11789,"粉笔手绘: 第十讲— 分布式文件系统","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/DS-CH-10.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"粉笔手绘: 第十讲— 分布式文件系统. Slides (PDF), 2019; 40 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 第十讲— 分布式文件系统, 如果有一笔钱,可以用来购买商业软件,你会把钱用来购, NTFS, 体系结构, NFS架构, 基于集群的分布式文件系统, GFS的特点, 文件系统中的进程, 分布式文件系统中的RPC, NFS嵌套挂载, NFS自动挂载, 文件共享语义, 同步解决方案, and 文件锁定."
