  11791,"Distributed Systems: 分布式系统","https://github.com/ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook/blob/master/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/DS-CH-13.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC computer-science distributed-systems lecture-notes slides github,null,2019,null,"Distributed Systems: 分布式系统. Slides (PDF), 2019; 128 pages. From the course-materials archive ysyisyourbrother/SYSU_Notebook. Sections: kubernetes. Slides cover 第13讲— Kubernetes: Container Orche, What are Containers? (Part 3: Shipping an Image), 2. Using the cluster, App: MyApp, Services, Many apps are HTTP/HTTPS, ReplicaSet, A higher-level storage abstraction, User, and Goal: manage app configuration."
