  12058,"USTC: Chapter 13","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/slides/%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86/ch13-uncertainty.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability lecture-notes book slides github blog,null,2018,null,"USTC: Chapter 13. Lecture slides (PDF), 2018; 33 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 不确定性(Uncertainty), 不确定性, 处理不确定性的方法, 不确定性下的决策, 语法(Syntax), 先验概率(Prior probability), 高斯(Gaussian) 分布, 条件概率的定义, 枚举推理, X 表示所有随机变量,典型地,我们感兴趣的问题是, 条件独立性(Conditional independence), 贝叶斯规则(Bayes' Rule), Wumpus World, and 观测与查询."
  12059,"USTC: Chapter 14a","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/slides/%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E3%80%81%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86/ch14a-bayesian.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR math.CO math.ST mathematics probability probabilistic-combinatorics statistics lecture-notes book slides github blog,null,2018,null,"USTC: Chapter 14a. Lecture slides (PDF), 2018; 30 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 贝叶斯网络(Bayesian networks), 网络拓扑编码了条件独立断言, 全局语义( Global Semantics), 局部语义( Local Semantics), 马尔科夫覆盖( Markov blanket), 构建贝叶斯网络, 假设我们选定了M, J, A, B, E 的次序, 在非因果(noncausal) 方向上判断条件独立, 不确定情况:噪声或(noisy-or) 逻辑关系能够刻画多个不交互的子句, 需要一个条件概率密度函数, 给定Cost,Buys? 的概率应该是“soft” threshold 的, and Sigmoid (or logit) 分布在神经网络中经常使用."
