  12086,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 1","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E8%84%91%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/slides/IBRS_1.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG q-bio.NC stat.ML computer-science quantitative-biology statistics cognitive-science machine-learning lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2018,null,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 1. Slides (PDF), 2018; 37 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 爱因斯坦大脑的故事, 神经系统各部分的联系, 人脑的解剖学定位术语, 大脑解剖学分区, 功能分区, 顶叶中的躯体感觉区, 颞叶中的听觉加工区, 哺乳动物的大脑进化特点, 基底神经节(basal ganglia), 由丘脑(thalamus)和下丘脑, 脑干(brainstem), 脑桥(pons)和延髓(medulla), and 负责将最终的运动指令下达给肌."
  12087,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 2","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E8%84%91%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/slides/IBRS_2.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2018,null,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 2. Slides (PDF), 2018; 36 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): machine learning. Slides cover 正常人的知觉中,多模态感觉信息的融合非常重要, 视觉功能异常的例子, 感受器直接暴露于外界,而且嗅神经不经过下丘脑直接到达, 嗅觉的不对称表征机制, 口腔中有~10000个味觉细胞,大部分, 躯体感觉加工, 听觉的编码特性, 听觉定位的神经编码-Konishi模型, 视觉信息传递和加工, 初级视觉皮层的信息加工, 皮质视觉区, 皮质视觉区的细胞特异性, 人类视觉区的特异性, and 人类的视觉缺陷现象."
  12088,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 3","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E8%84%91%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%A4%E7%9F%A5%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%BA/slides/IBRS_3.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2018,null,"CSE 181 Project guidelines: IBRS 3. Slides (PDF), 2018; 22 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 胼胝体连接左右大脑半球皮质,包含超过2亿条神经纤维, 胼胝体切断后的功能影响, 胼胝体的功能, 大脑半球的语言功能特异化, 视觉空间加工, 大脑半球在复杂认知上的特异性, 左侧大脑半球的解释器假说, 大脑半球在视觉信息层级表征上的特异性, 视觉信息层级表征特异性的原理, and 视觉表征的空间频率假说."
