  12180,Figures – Chapter 5,"https://github.com/Bladz1/Troy-University-Resources/blob/main/CS-3332/Modules/Cao-Tuan-Dung/CS3332_Chapter_05.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning book slides github,Ian Sommerville,2018,null,"Figures – Chapter 5. Lecture slides (PDF) by Ian Sommerville, 2018; 52 pages. Part of Troy University Resources: Đến thời điểm này, repo chúng ta đã chỉnh tề, môn học đã ngay ngắn, cả ngành ta cùng hành quân vươn tới tương lai rực rỡ, vì bảng điểm của chúng ta, vì sự vươn mình của toàn bộ sinh viên Troy. > — Adapted from [General Secretary Tô Lâm][to-lam-wikipedia]. Slides cover Topics covered, System modeling, Existing and planned system models, Use of graphical models, Process perspective, Use case modeling, Use cases in the MHC-PMS involving the role, Sequence diagram for Transfer Data, Classes and associations in the MHC-PMS, Generalization, Object class aggregation models, Data-driven modeling, Event-driven modeling, and States and stimuli for the microwave oven (a)."
  12181,Figure – Chapter 6,"https://github.com/Bladz1/Troy-University-Resources/blob/main/CS-3332/Modules/Cao-Tuan-Dung/CS3332_Chapter_06.pdf",github.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases book slides github,Ian Sommerville,2018,null,"Figure – Chapter 6. Lecture slides (PDF) by Ian Sommerville, 2018; 52 pages. Part of Troy University Resources: Đến thời điểm này, repo chúng ta đã chỉnh tề, môn học đã ngay ngắn, cả ngành ta cùng hành quân vươn tới tương lai rực rỡ, vì bảng điểm của chúng ta, vì sự vươn mình của toàn bộ sinh viên Troy. > — Adapted from [General Secretary Tô Lâm][to-lam-wikipedia]. Slides cover Topics covered, Software architecture, Architectural design, Advantages of explicit architecture, Architectural design decisions, Architecture and system characteristics, The organization of the Model-View-Controller, Layered architecture, The architecture of the LIBSYS system, A repository architecture for an IDE, A client–server architecture for a film library, An example of the pipe and filter architecture, Examples of application types, and The structure of transaction processing."
