  12423,"离散数学: 推理就是根据一个或几个已知的判断","https://github.com/Tuning-Luna/HFUT_XC_Study_Things/blob/main/%E3%80%90%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%91%E7%A6%BB%E6%95%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6/%E7%BD%91%E8%AF%BEPPT/1.13.pdf",github.com,math.CO,math.CO mathematics combinatorics graph-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"离散数学: 推理就是根据一个或几个已知的判断. Slides (PDF), 2018; 13 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive Tuning-Luna/HFUT_XC_Study_Things. Subject (translated): discrete mathematics, combinatorics and graph theory. Slides cover 推理就是根据一个或几个已知的判断, 推理的过程就是证明永真蕴含式的过程。, 两个推理规则, 基础重言蕴涵式(I类公式), 基础等价公式(E类公式), P Q Q, 推理方法, 一.直接推理, 例1 求证P→Q,Q→R,P R, and 推理格式."
