  12529,"Introduction au deep learning Eleves (2018-2019) [Mode de compatibilité]","https://github.com/erachelson/MLclass/blob/master/7%20-%20Deep%20Learning/Introduction%20to%20Deep%20Learning%20by%20Marc%20Spigai%20%28French%29/Introduction%20au%20deep%20learning%20%282018-2019%29.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML computer-science statistics machine-learning functional-analysis lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"Introduction au deep learning Eleves (2018-2019) [Mode de compatibilité]. Slides (PDF), 2018; 44 pages, in French. From a repository described as: You must download and install an Anaconda distribution for the latest version of Python before the course (https://anaconda.org/). Alternatively (to downloading Anaconda), you'll need a working Python installation (latest version) with at least, Numpy, Scipy, Matplotlib and Jupyter installed. Subject (translated): deep learning and neural networks. Slides cover Logique du cours, 2011: reconnaissance de panneaux de, Mais que s’est-il donc passé pour que le Deep, Véhicule 1, Idée générale du Deep Learning avec les CNN, CNN: Travaux Y. Lecun, Trait. Images MNIST, Trait. Images panneaux de signalisation, Une réponse: le Transfer Learning, Apprentissage non supervisé, Mais qu’ont-ils donc fait ?, Quelques buzz en cours, and Ou en est on aujourd’hui (nov 2018)? Le Pour."
