  12574,"Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569), Lecture8: Lecture 8 Objectives","https://github.com/joanbruna/ir18/blob/master/slides/lecture8.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML math.PR cs.DS computer-science statistics mathematics machine-learning algorithms control-theory markov-chains lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569), Lecture8: Lecture 8 Objectives. Lecture slides (PDF), 2018; 75 pages. From a repository described as: We will study latent graphical models (Latent Dirichlet Allocation, Gaussian Processes), state-space models for (Kalman Filter, HMMs), Gibbs Models, Deep generative models (Variational autoencoders, GANs) covering both the methods (inference, sampling algorithms, learning, exponential families) and…. Slides cover Lecture 8 Objectives, Variational Inference, Exponential Families and Maximum Entropy, Legendre Transform, Variational Inference and Duality, EM is thus a coordinate ascent on the lower bound, Mean Field Variational Bayes, MCMC vs Variational Inference, Latent Graphical Models, Auto encoders: Geometric Interpretation, Variational Autoencoders, and Examples."
  12575,"Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569), Lecture9: Lecture 9 Objectives","https://github.com/joanbruna/ir18/blob/master/slides/lecture9.pdf",github.com,cs.LG,cs.LG stat.ML cs.DS eess.SY computer-science statistics electrical-engineering machine-learning algorithms cognitive-science control-theory lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"Inference and Representation (DS-GA-1005, CSCI-GA.2569), Lecture9: Lecture 9 Objectives. Lecture slides (PDF), 2018; 78 pages. From a repository described as: We will study latent graphical models (Latent Dirichlet Allocation, Gaussian Processes), state-space models for (Kalman Filter, HMMs), Gibbs Models, Deep generative models (Variational autoencoders, GANs) covering both the methods (inference, sampling algorithms, learning, exponential families) and…. Slides cover Lecture 9 Objectives, Latent Graphical Models, Auto encoders, Auto encoders: Geometric Interpretation, Variational Autoencoders, Examples, Extension to Semi-Supervised Learning, Conditional Random Fields (CRF), CRF Examples, CRF Examples: Named-Entity Recognition, and Learning under the Exponential Family."
  12576,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 本讲要点","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/01-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%B2-%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 本讲要点. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 69 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 本讲要点, 通过学习本课程, Phone(73), “现代电子计算机之父”冯·诺依曼, UNIVAC的存储器等部件, 计算机的主要类别, 二、超级计算机, 超级计算机的典型代表, MIPS, PDP-8, and 1970年代,微处理器兴起."
  12577,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第六讲数字电路设计","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/06-%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E8%AE%B2-%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E7%94%B5%E8%B7%AF%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%281%29.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR math.AG math.LO computer-science mathematics computer-architecture birational-geometry mathematical-logic slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第六讲数字电路设计. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 66 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): digital logic design; computer architecture. Slides cover 第六讲数字电路设计, 通过学习本课程, 几位重要的人物, 与门(AND gate), 异或门(Exclusive-OR gate, XOR gate), 包含多种功能的运算单元, D触发器应用示例:移位寄存器, D触发器(D flip-flop,DFF), 正在写入“1”, 第二阶段(2), 第四阶段(2), 第五阶段(2), and 第六阶段(1)."
  12578,"运算器和控制器: 慕课回顾和扩展","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/07-%E6%85%95%E8%AF%BE%E5%9B%9E%E9%A1%BE-%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8.pdf",github.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"运算器和控制器: 慕课回顾和扩展. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 32 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 4-bit RCA的门电路实现, 4-bit RCA的关键路径(延迟最长的路径), 如何提前计算“进位输出信号”, 超前进位加法器(Carry-Lookahead Adder,CLA), (2)乘法器和除法器, Remainder, 32-bit 乘法器的优化3:硬件的“循环展开”, 乘法的进一步优化, 带符号数的乘法和除法, MIPS乘除法的专用寄存器:Hi,Lo, and 符号扩展类指令说明."
  12579,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第七讲流水线优化技术","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/08-%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E8%AE%B2-%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E7%BA%BF%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR math.OC cs.LG computer-science mathematics computer-architecture optimization slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第七讲流水线优化技术. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 46 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 第七讲流水线优化技术, 通过学习本课程, 早期的x86 CPU, 处理器流水线深度的变化, Intel Core i7, 转移指令, 超标量处理器实例, 减小转移指令影响的技术举例(1), 转移条件判定的预测, 历史信息转移预测器的简化示例, 历史位设定分析(2), 转移预测技术的实现要点, BTB的基本操作(2), and Pentium BTB的工作机制示意图."
  12580,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第九讲输入输出接口","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/09-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E8%AE%B2-%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR computer-science computer-architecture slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第九讲输入输出接口. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 69 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 第九讲输入输出接口, 通过学习本课程, 第一台微型计算机:Altair 8800, I/O接口的产生原因, I/O端口及其编址方式, 统一编址的特点, I/O指令的地址译码过程示例, 数据输出过程, 串/并行通信的比较(1), 串/并行通信的比较(4), 差分信号的抗干扰特点, 与系统总线的连线(3), and (1)方式选择控制字."
  12581,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第十讲中断和异常","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/10-%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E8%AE%B2-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR cs.OS computer-science computer-architecture operating-systems slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第十讲中断和异常. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 60 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): operating systems. Slides cover 第十讲中断和异常, 通过学习本课程, 早期的电子计算机, CPU遇到的“事件”, MIPS CPU的异常处理, 8086的中断向量表, 中断的检测(示例:x86系统), 中断请求信号, 典型的菊花链优先级结构, 中断号资源分配示例, 早期PC机中的中断控制器, 计数/定时的主要用途, 用方式2产生DRAM定时刷新信号, and 用方式3控制扬声器发声."
  12582,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第十一讲总线及总线标准","https://github.com/lihy11/pku-computer-architectures/blob/master/ppt/11-%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E8%AE%B2-%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%BF%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86.pdf",github.com,cs.AR,cs.AR cs.DC cs.LG computer-science computer-architecture ml-systems slides github,Lu Junlin,2018,null,"北京大学本科生主干基础课: 第十一讲总线及总线标准. Slides (PDF) by Lu Junlin, 2018; 61 pages, in Chinese. Subject (translated): computer architecture. Slides cover 第十一讲总线及总线标准, 通过学习本课程, 总线的基本概念, 简单的系统示意图, 基于总线的典型系统示意图, ISA总线, AGP(Accelerated Graphics Port), PCIe总线物理层采用差分信号传输, AMBA总线标准, 时序图1-a:读1个数据的传输, 从模块未准备好的典型情况, 多个连续的传输, 主模块控制信号:HTRANS, and Burst传输的应用(1)."
  12583,"等级保护新标准2.0: 条例解读","https://github.com/lyandut/HUST-Invictus/blob/master/%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86/%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%96%B0%E6%A0%87%E5%87%862.0%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%BB.pdf",github.com,eess.SY,eess.SY cs.CR math.OC electrical-engineering computer-science mathematics control-theory security-and-privacy lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"等级保护新标准2.0: 条例解读. Slides (PDF), 2018; 58 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive lyandut/HUST-Invictus. Subject (translated): control theory and control systems; cryptography. Slides cover 等级保护发展历程与展望, 等级保护2.0标准体系, 等级保护2.0标准定级要求, 等级保护2.0扩展要求解析-云计算, and 等级保护2.0扩展要求解析-移动互联."
  12584,"SEED: 计算机安全教育的教学实验平台","https://github.com/lyandut/HUST-Invictus/blob/master/%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A3%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/lab2/lab02-SYN%20flood%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%8ASYN%20cookie%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"SEED: 计算机安全教育的教学实验平台. Slides (PDF), 2018; 16 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive lyandut/HUST-Invictus. Subject (translated): computer networks. Slides cover 纽约雪城大学杜文亮(Du, Wenliang)教授设计和实现,从2002年, SEED内容包含一下几类, 网络安全主要包括10大实验, 2.TCP/IP Attack Lab, VirtualBox新建虚拟机, 导入SEED 虚拟机镜像文件,运行虚拟机, 普通用户登陆,有特权操, 利用GNS3配置如图网络, ###配置IP地址命令, SEED Ubuntu target上启动telnet服务, 3.进一步观察linux内核tcp syn cookie机制, and 4. 实验报告要求."
