  12700,"Ray Tracing: Lin Lu (吕琳)","https://github.com/sdu-openlab/OpenCourse/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E5%AD%A6/%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99/sildes/RayTracing.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.GR computer-science distributed-systems computer-graphics slides github,null,2018,null,"Ray Tracing: Lin Lu (吕琳). Slides (PDF), 2018; 20 pages. Part of SDUCS 课程资料共享计划 (仅 openlab): 本计划旨在维护一个公开的、易于获取的和大家能够共同完善、积累的课程共享资料宝库。. Slides cover Recall, Ray Tracing, Ray Trees, Computation, Ray Casting, A Simple Ray Caster Program, Ray-Surface Intersections, and The Devil’s in the Details."
  12701,王道论坛 - 直播PPT最终版v2 1,"https://github.com/stellarkey/912_project/blob/master/1%20%E6%8B%9B%E7%94%9F%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF/%E7%8E%8B%E9%81%93%E8%AE%BA%E5%9D%9B-%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%ADPPT%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E7%89%88v2.1.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.NI cs.OS computer-science algorithms networking operating-systems lecture-notes slides github,null,2018,null,"王道论坛 - 直播PPT最终版v2 1. Slides (PDF), 2018; 23 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive stellarkey/912_project. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures; operating systems; computer networks. Slides cover 主讲人考研情况介绍, 1.主讲人考研情况介绍, 2.院校选择, 如何选择?, 3.院校信息分享与解读, CS历年招生计划, CS历年分数线, CS推荐书籍, MSE历年招生计划, MSE历年分数线, MSE推荐书籍/学习方法, 4.考研经验分享, and CS复习经验."
