  13310,"编译原理: 字母表∑是一个有穷符号集合","https://github.com/JackeyLea/NJUCS/blob/master/3.%E5%A4%8D%E8%AF%95/3.%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/1.PPT/%E5%93%88%E5%B0%94%E6%BB%A8%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6PPT/%E7%AC%AC2%E8%AE%B2%20%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E6%96%87%E6%B3%95.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2017,null,"编译原理: 字母表∑是一个有穷符号集合. Slides (PDF), 2017; 56 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive JackeyLea/NJUCS. Subject (translated): programming languages and compilers; programming languages. Slides cover 字母表∑是一个有穷符号集合, 字母表上的运算, 字母表的n次幂:长度为n的符号串构成的集合, 如果x和y是串,那么x和y的连接(concatenation), 句子 名词短语 动词短语, 产生式( production)描述了将终结符和非终结符组合成串的方法, 下述符号是终结符, 语言的定义, 名词短语 动词短语, 由文法G的开始符号S推导出的所有句子构成, 2.2 文法的定义, 上下文有关文法(Context-Sensitive Grammar , CSG ), 正则语言(3型语言), and 根节点的标号为文法开始符号."
  13311,"代码生成器的主: 要任务","https://github.com/JackeyLea/NJUCS/blob/master/3.%E5%A4%8D%E8%AF%95/3.%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/1.PPT/%E5%93%88%E5%B0%94%E6%BB%A8%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6PPT/%E7%AC%AC20%E8%AE%B2%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github,null,2017,null,"代码生成器的主: 要任务. Slides (PDF), 2017; 54 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive JackeyLea/NJUCS. Subject (translated): programming languages and compilers. Slides cover 指令选择, 三地址语句序列, 寄存器分配和指派, 三地址机器模型, 变量名a, 在寄存器r中内容加上c后所表示的位置上存放的内存位置, 代码生成器的主, 三地址语句, M是标号为L的三地址指令所产生的, 寄存器描述符( register descriptor ), and 对于指令“OP Rx , Ry, Rz”."
  13312,"libpku - 贵校课程资料民间整理, 强连通分支、桥和割点: 北京大学信息学院 郭炜","https://github.com/KBDY/beijing/blob/master/%E6%9A%91%E6%9C%9F%E8%AF%BE/acm-icpc%E6%9A%91%E6%9C%9F%E8%AF%BE/%E5%BC%BA%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%88%86%E9%87%8F.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides github,null,2017,null,"libpku - 贵校课程资料民间整理, 强连通分支、桥和割点: 北京大学信息学院 郭炜. Slides (PDF), 2017; 79 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: 来到一所大学,从第一次接触许多课,直到一门一门完成,这个过程中我们时常收集起许多资料和情报。. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 北京大学信息学院 郭炜, 在有向图G中,如果任意两个不同的顶点, 做一遍DFS,用dfn[i]表示编号为i的节点在DFS过程中, 有向图强连通分支的Tarjan算法, 有向无环图中唯一出度为0的点,一定可, 有向无环图中所有入度不为0的点,一定, and //无重边连通无向图求割点和桥的程序."
  13313,配置RIP路由协议,"https://github.com/KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate/blob/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%BC%A0%E6%B0%B8%E6%B0%91%EF%BC%89/05%E3%80%81RIP%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C/%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/RIP%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE.pdf",github.com,cs.NI,cs.NI computer-science networking lecture-notes slides github,null,2017,null,"配置RIP路由协议. Slides (PDF), 2017; 13 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive KONZEM/SYSU_Undergraduate. Subject (translated): computer networks. Sections: 幻灯片编号 1; RIPv2配置方法; 水平分割; 自动汇总; 连续子网; 非连续子网; 把交换机当路由器用; 环回接口; 调试用命令; 显示路由信息; 显示协议; 其它命令. Slides cover R1(config)# router rip, R1(config-if)# no ip split-horizon !取消水平分割。默认采用水平分割。, RIPv2的默认行为是在有类网络边界上进行自动汇总(auto-, Router1, 可以把交换机当成路由器用。这时,需要把交换机接口变, 为环回接口配置IP地址。环回接口是路由器内部的软接口,, R1# debug ip rip [event] !显示rip运行[发送或接收]情况, R1# show ip route !查询IP路由表, R1# show ip protocols !显示协议的情况, and !update invalid hold-down flush默认值为30秒, 180秒, 180秒, 240秒."
  13314,"Chapter 11.8 光的偏振: 机械横波与纵波的检验实验","https://github.com/NJUPTFreeExams/NJUPT-General-Free-Exams/blob/master/public/%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%89/%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%8B%E8%AF%BE%E4%BB%B6/%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0/%C2%A711.8-1%20%E5%85%89%E7%9A%84%E5%81%8F%E6%8C%AF%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%20%E9%A9%AC%E5%90%95%E6%96%AF%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%8B.pdf",github.com,math.PR,math.PR mathematics probability lecture-notes book slides github,null,2017,null,"Chapter 11.8 光的偏振: 机械横波与纵波的检验实验. Lecture slides (PDF), 2017; 15 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive NJUPTFreeExams/NJUPT-General-Free-Exams. Subject (translated): probability. Slides cover 机械横波与纵波的检验实验, 自然光, 部分偏振光:光矢量, 具有二项色性的物质(如硫酸金鸡纳硷)能吸收某方向, 立体电影, 三、马吕斯定律, 例自然光光强I0,P1⊥P3,现以与P1成30, and 1. 自然光、部分偏振光、线偏振光."
