  13328,"RDSS: Abstract","https://github.com/PKUanonym/REKCARC-TSC-UHT/blob/master/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F/Week_1-Qt/hw/2017/%E4%BC%98%E7%A7%80%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/%E7%BF%81%E5%AE%B6%E7%BF%8C/RDSS.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github,null,2017,null,"RDSS: Abstract. Lecture slides (PDF), 2017; 20 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive PKUanonym/REKCARC-TSC-UHT. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Abstract, 听说大家读Paper都先看Experiment, 对比结果, 上一章ppt似乎没有什么说服力, 校内OJ排名, ——五分钟听会,十分钟写完, RDSS依赖于, 为什么会有Dancing Link?, 人是怎么做数独的, 说出来你们肯定不相信, 然后.把这些限制从小到大排个序,得到一个序列, 使用二进制压位能够提升性能, 为什么叫RDSS, and ——反正已经怒踩Dancing Link了."
