  13804,"并行计算: 并行计算, 离散傅里叶变换(DFT)","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PC11.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2016,null,"并行计算: 并行计算, 离散傅里叶变换(DFT). Slides (PDF), 2016; 28 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Sections: 并行计算; 离散傅里叶变换(DFT); DFT的顺序代码; 串行FFT递归算法(1); 串行FFT递归算法(2); 串行FFT递归算法(3); 串行FFT递归算法(4); 串行FFT递归算法(5); 串行FFT递归算法(6); 串行FFT非递归算法(1); 串行FFT非递归算法(2); 串行FFT非递归算法(3). Slides cover 第十一章 快速傅里叶变换, 给定向量A=(a0,a1,.,an-1)T,DFT将A变换为, FFT的蝶式递归计算图(由计算原理推出), SISD上的FFT分治递归算法, 蝶式计算示例, 算法11.3(P270): 输入: ak处于Pk中; 输出bk处于Pk中, 满足k mod 2 = k mod 4的处理器为P0和P1, 同时计算, 算法分析, and 蝶形网络."
  13805,"并行计算: 并行计算 Parallel Computing, 第四章 并行计算性能评测","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PC4.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.PF math.AG computer-science mathematics high-performance-computing algebraic-geometry schemes lecture-notes slides github blog,Xu Yun,2016,null,"并行计算: 并行计算 Parallel Computing, 第四章 并行计算性能评测. Slides (PDF) by Xu Yun, 2016; 30 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): parallel computing. Sections: 并行计算 Parallel Computing; 第四章 并行计算性能评测; CPU的某些基本性能指标; 存储器性能; 并行与通信开销; Ping-Pong Scheme; 并行开销的表达式:点到点通信; 并行开销的表达式:整体通信; 机器的成本、价格与性/价比; 算法级性能评测; Amdahl 定律(1); Amdahl定律(2). Slides cover 第一篇 并行计算的基础, 4.1 并行机的一些基本性能指标, 工作负载, 并行和通信开销:相对于计算很大。, 通信启动时间 t0, 机器的成本与价格, Amdahl’s Law 表明, 出发点:Base on Fixed Execution Time, 出发点: Base on Memory Bounding, and 参考的加速经验公式: p/log p≤S≤P."
  13806,"并行计算: PC7 Supplement","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PC7_Supplement.pdf",github.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.DC cs.PF computer-science algorithms high-performance-computing lecture-notes slides github blog,Xu Yun,2016,null,"并行计算: PC7 Supplement. Slides (PDF) by Xu Yun, 2016; 38 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): parallel computing; algorithms and data structures. Sections: Slide Number 1; 基本设计技术; 7.1 划分设计技术; 7.3 平衡树设计技术; Slide Number 16; Slide Number 17; Slide Number 18; Slide Number 19; Slide Number 20; Slide Number 21; Specialized Circuit; Recursive Circuit. Slides cover 7.1 Partitioning Principle, 设计思想, 方法: n个元素A[1.n]分成等长的p组,每组满足, 2.1奇偶归并网络构造, 2.3 奇偶排序网络, 3.2 双调归并网络构造(依据Batcher定理), 3.4 双调排序网络, 奇偶排序, Properties, and Step 2."
  13807,"并行计算: 并行计算, 十三、并行程序设计基础","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PP1.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.PL cs.PF computer-science high-performance-computing programming-languages lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2016,null,"并行计算: 并行计算, 十三、并行程序设计基础. Slides (PDF), 2016; 31 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): parallel computing; programming languages. Sections: 并行计算; 十三、并行程序设计基础; 并行程序设计基础; 并行程序设计难的原因; 并行语言的构造方法; 并行层次与代码粒度; Slide Number 8; 并行程序开发策略; 并行编程风范; 相并行(Phase Parallel); 主-从并行(Master-Slave Parallel); 主-从式(Master-Slave). Slides cover 13.1 并行程序设计概述, 技术先行, 缺乏理论指导, 并行层次, 主从并行(Master-Slave Parallel), 主进程:串行、协调任务, 父进程把负载分割并, 一组进程, 初始状态:一件工作, 数据并行模型(Data Parallel), and SIMD的自然模型,也可运行于SPMD、MIMD机器上."
  13808,"并行计算: PP2 MPI","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PP2-MPI.pdf",github.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.PF computer-science high-performance-computing lecture-notes slides github blog,null,2016,null,"并行计算: PP2 MPI. Slides (PDF), 2016; 73 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): parallel computing. Sections: 并行计算; 十五、分布存储系统并行编程; 分布存储系统并行编程; SPMD和MPMD; MPI简介; 6个基本函数组成的MPI子集; MPI消息; MPI消息(数据类型); MPI消息(消息标签); MPI消息(通信域); MPI消息(消息状态); 点对点通信. Slides cover 14.1 基于消息传递的并行编程, SPMD, MPI的版本, 消息发送:MPI_Send函数用于发送一个消, MPI提供了两个附加类型:MPI_BYTE和, MPI_Datatype EvenElements;, 添加标签使得服, 一个在MPI中创建新通信域的例子, MPI的点对点通信(‘Point-to-Point, and 就绪通信模式:发送操作只有在接收进程相."
  13809,"并行算法实践: PP3 OMP","https://github.com/15172658790/Blog/blob/branch_1/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB/%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/slide-gzsun2017Spring/PP3-OMP.pdf",github.com,cs.PL,cs.PL computer-science programming-languages lecture-notes slides github blog,AN Hong,2016,null,"并行算法实践: PP3 OMP. Slides (PDF) by AN Hong, 2016; 59 pages, in Chinese. From the course-materials archive 15172658790/Blog. Subject (translated): programming languages and compilers. Sections: OpenMP编程指南; OpenMP概述; OpenMP体系结构; 什么是OpenMP; OpenMP的历史; OpenMP的目标; OpenMP并行编程模型; OpenMP程序结构; 一个简单的OpenMP程序实例; 编译制导; 作用域; 并行域结构. Slides cover OpenMP编程风络, OpenMP应用编程接口API是在共享存储体系结构上的, 基于线程的并行编程模型(Programming Model), 运行结果 (setenv OMP_NUM_THREADS 8), 并行域中的代码被所有的线程执行, Reduction子句的格式, and 运行库例程."
