  14992,String Searching,"https://gitlab.com/iBz-041/YTU-Comp-Engineering/-/blob/master/2x4/BLM2512%20-%20Data%20Structures%20and%20Algorithms/Slides%20due%20to%20COVID19/53SubstringSearch.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms lecture-notes slides gitlab,Kevin Wayne,2014,null,"String Searching. Slides (PDF) by Kevin Wayne, 2014; 55 pages. Part of Yıldız Technical University Computer Engineering Course Work: Lecture Notes - Lecture Materials - Homeworks - Solutions - Example Questions - And other useful informations about department and lecturers. Slides cover ROBERT SEDGEWICK | KEVIN WAYNE, Substring search, Substring search applications, Algorithmic challenges in substring search, QcMMWhatMisMinterpretationMofMz–wMstateMafterMreadingMinMtxt[i]u, IncludeMoneMstateMforMeachMcharacterMinMpatternMVplusMacceptMstateWc, MatchMtransitioncMMIfMinMstateMjMandMnextMcharMcMeeCpatRcharitLjMaMgoMtoMMjOUc, PropositioncMMKMPMsubstringMsearchMaccessesMnoMmoreMthanMM + NMchars, Intuitionc, and Boyer-Moore: mismatched character heuristic."
  14993,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Review (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/ARM.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms databases economics-and-finance machine-learning slides gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Review (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 73 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Review, Mining Association Rules in Large, Market Basket Analysis, Basic Concepts, Apriori: A Candidate Generation-and-Test, Apriori Algorithm — An Example, Example: Counting Supports of Candidates, DHP: Reduce the Number of Candidates, Transaction Reduction, Exercise, Benefits of the FP-tree Structure, Cons, and Mining Multiple-Level Association Rules."
  14994,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Data Warehouse (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/Data_Warehouse.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DB,cs.DB cs.DS computer-science databases algorithms machine-learning slides gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Data Warehouse (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 61 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Data Warehouse and OLAP Technology, Knowledge Discovery (KDD) Process, What is Data Warehouse?, Data Warehouse—Subject-Oriented, Data Warehouse vs. Operational DBMS, Exercise, Conceptual Modeling of Data Warehouses, Cube Definition Syntax in DMQL, A Concept Hierarchy for Numeric Values, Data Warehouse: A Three-Layer Architecture, Metadata Repository, Data Warehouse Design Process, and Indexing OLAP Data: Bitmap Index."
  14995,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Intro (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/Intro.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.DB cs.LG math.CO computer-science mathematics algorithms databases graph-theory machine-learning book slides problem-list gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Intro (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 58 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Welcome, Information, Textbook and References, About the Project, Syllabus (Tentative), What Motivated Data Mining –, Why Not Traditional Data Analysis?, Exercises, Ex.2 Credit Scoring, What Kinds of Patterns?, Data Warehouses, Time Series, World-Wide Web, and Graph."
  14996,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Preprocessing (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/Preprocessing.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.CA math.CT computer-science mathematics algorithms category-theory machine-learning real-analysis survey slides gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Preprocessing (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 75 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Review, Data Preprocessing Overview, Forms of Data Preprocessing, Measuring the Dispersion of Data, Example, Graphic Displays of Basic Statistical, Noisy Data, Cluster Analysis, Data Integration, Correlation Analysis (Categorical Data), Data Cube Aggregation, Data Compression, Data Reduction Method (1), and Sampling: Cluster or Stratified Sampling."
  14997,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Classification (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/classification.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG math.ST computer-science mathematics algorithms machine-learning statistics slides gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Classification (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 77 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Review, Classification and Prediction, Classification, Supervised vs. Unsupervised Learning, Classification by Decision Tree Induction, Algorithm for Decision Tree Induction, Gain Ratio for Attribute Selection (C4.5), Approaches to Determine the Final Tree, Bayesian Theorem: Basics, Naïve Bayesian Classifier: An Example, Defining a Network Topology, Backpropagation, Neural Network as a Classifier, and Bagging: Boostrap Aggregation."
  14998,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Clustering (iamfaith/MachineLearning)","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/books/Data%20Mining/ppt/clustering.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.LG computer-science algorithms machine-learning slides gitlab,Ying Liu,2014,null,"Performance Evaluation and Characterization of Scalable Data Mining Algorithms: Clustering (iamfaith/MachineLearning). Slides (PDF) by Ying Liu, 2014; 83 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Slides cover Review, Cluster Analysis, What is Cluster Analysis?, Requirements of Clustering, Interval-valued Variables, Nominal Variables, Solution, Centroid, Radius and Diameter of a, Comments on the K-Means Method, Hierarchical Clustering, BIRCH: integrated hierarchical clustering, BIRCH, CURE: Clustering Using Representatives, and Density-Reachable and Density-Connected."
  14999,"ContextSense: Unobtrusive Discovery of Incremental Social Context using Dynamic Bluetooth Data","https://gitlab.com/iamfaith/MachineLearning/-/blob/master/papers%20about%20activity%20recognition/%E8%AF%BE%E9%A2%98%E7%BB%84%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0/ContextSense-unobtrusive%20discovery%20of%20incremental%20social%20context%20using%20dynamic%20bluetooth%20data%5B%E9%99%88%E6%8C%AF%E5%AE%87%20%E5%BF%BD%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%8E%20%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%20%E7%8E%8B%E5%8F%8C%E5%85%A8%20%E8%92%8B%E9%91%AB%E9%BE%99%20Campbell%20Ubicomp%202014%20%E9%99%88%E7%9B%8A%E5%BC%BA%20%E8%AF%BE%E9%A2%98%E7%BB%84%5D.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.LG,cs.LG cs.LO math.LO stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics fuzzy-logic machine-learning slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"ContextSense: Unobtrusive Discovery of Incremental Social Context using Dynamic Bluetooth Data. Slides (PDF), 2014; 4 pages. From a repository described as: 1.1 Machine Learning的一些理解 机器学习的概念自不用多说。这里我仅提到一点,机器学习在学科分类上是属于实现人工智能的一种重要方法,注定它和AI是不可分的。其实,传统的AI一直都侧重解决三个步骤的问题:知识的表示、知识的获取和知识的学习。其中,机器学习涵盖了知识的获取和学习两大部分,是AI的核心部分。其实说白了,ML解决的就是怎么从已知推断未知,它走的是归纳(induction)这个自上而下的过程,AI中还有一个相对立的知识体系叫做演绎(deduction),这个主要是自动推理的范畴,和机器学习基本关系不大,是较独立的一支。. Sections: ContextSense Design; Experiment Results. Subsections include Feature extraction, One-Class Classification, Fuzzy ISODATA Clustering, ELM-based Class-Incremental Classifier, Data Collection, Parameter Settings, and Comparison. Slides cover Context-aware computing has been drawing increasing."
