  15001,"Spark Streaming: BigData Techcon SF","https://gitlab.com/kevintvh/Presentations-1/-/blob/master/Spark%20Streaming/Spark%20Streaming.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DC,cs.DC computer-science distributed-systems slides gitlab,Richard Summerhayes,2014,null,"Spark Streaming: BigData Techcon SF. Slides (PDF) by Richard Summerhayes, 2014; 96 pages. Part of Dean Wampler's Presentations: This repo contains some of the presentations I've given over the years at conferences, user groups, etc. Not all of them are here yet. Slides cover Typesafe provides, Why Scala?, Resilient Distributed Datasets, WordCount.scala, Event Handling, SparkStreaming.scala, RDD Control vs. Transformation Methods, Streaming Resiliency, and Streams with Checkpointing."
