  15033,Foss4gfr 2014 Pentaho Chevallot Ben Hmid,"https://gitlab.com/osgeo-fr/archives/presentations_foss4gfr/-/blob/gh-pages/2014/J2_B_16_30_DEVELOPPEMENT_TABLEAUX_BORD_RAPPORTS_GEODECISIONNELS_ET_DATAVIZ_PENTAHO_DECIGEO/foss4gfr_2014_pentaho_chevallot_ben_hmid.pdf",gitlab.com,math.ST,math.ST stat.ME mathematics statistics lecture-notes slides gitlab,Pascal CHEVALLOT,2014,null,"Foss4gfr 2014 Pentaho Chevallot Ben Hmid. Slides (PDF) by Pascal CHEVALLOT, 2014; 23 pages, in French. From the course-materials archive osgeo-fr/archives/presentations_foss4gfr. Subject (translated): statistics and statistical inference. Slides cover Décisionnel ? Géodécisionnel ?, Gestion des données au quotidien : ETL késako ?, Des dimensions,, Du forage de données, Traditionnellement, vues analytiques –, Traditionnellement,, Le « monde » des SIG et, Un constat : chaînon manquant de Pentaho , Les données et les flux sont là, massifs et ouverts , Les technologies sont matures et variées , Ici utilisation des bassins de vie, Ici utilisation des aires urbaines, Ici utilisation des SCOT, and Exemple de tableau de bord – Cercles proportionnels."
  15034,从TCP角度理解性能优化 叔度,"https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/%E4%BB%8ETCP%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96-%E5%8F%94%E5%BA%A6.pdf",gitlab.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"从TCP角度理解性能优化 叔度. Slides (PDF), 2014; 49 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 杭州某用户带宽2Mbps,在想要下载一个位于北京的1个, 在杭州办公室ping淘宝北京电信CDN, 真空中30万公里每秒, 带宽和非洲接轨, 应用最广泛的协议是HTTP, 面向字节流, 11个状态, CM4机房(杭州)和CM5机房(青岛), BDP(Bandwidth Delay Product), 窗口从一个小的值开始, 慢启动期间, 慢启动结束就进入拥塞避免, 运营商导致我们的网络丢包严重, and 操作的对象是socket读写缓冲区."
  15035,"QCon: 实时高可用金融交易系统架构与设计2014Qcon","https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/%E5%AE%9E%E6%97%B6%E9%AB%98%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A12014Qcon.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"QCon: 实时高可用金融交易系统架构与设计2014Qcon. Slides (PDF), 2014; 35 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): databases. Slides cover 传统交易系统, 消息中间件, 应用用中间件, 创新交易系统, 互联网网技术的冲击, 消息总线, 总线协议, 拥塞控制, 库一一级的模块化, 示示例:主排队机事件流, 示示例:消息流, Amdahl’s law, 应用用协议, and 性能——吞吐."
  15036,"准备好发射了吗?: 面向生产环境的SOA系统设计","https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/%E9%9D%A2%E5%90%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E7%9A%84SOA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1.pdf",gitlab.com,math.OC,math.OC cs.LG mathematics computer-science optimization slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"准备好发射了吗?: 面向生产环境的SOA系统设计. Slides (PDF), 2014; 42 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): optimization. Slides cover 典型SOA应用, 服务使用者, 服务是基础架构单元, 交付前,你胸有成竹吗, 响应时间优化, 在设计阶段就必须估算与优化性能, 吞吐量分析, 资源使用分析, 在设计阶段就必须估算与优化容量, 故障空间组合爆炸, 幂等服务, 基于资源的并发控制(乐观), 时间控制, and 分布事务(TCC模式)."
