  15038,FacebookGTIDPercona Live2014,"https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/FacebookGTIDPerconaLive2014.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DB,cs.DB computer-science databases survey slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"FacebookGTIDPercona Live2014. Slides (PDF), 2014; 52 pages. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Slides cover Global Transaction ID at Facebook, Introduction to GTID, MySQL 5.6 GTID sets, Benefits and Use-cases, Hierarchical replication chains, Master failover with GTID + mysqlbinlog, Crash-safe master via loss-less semisync, Facebook GTID improvements, Binary log1, Slave connect performance, Crash-safe slave, Crash-safe slave: scenario 2, Automation and Monitoring, and Monitoring."
  15039,"Java常见问题排查: Java常见问题排查[毕玄]1397440786","https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/Java%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5%5B%E6%AF%95%E7%8E%84%5D1397440786.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.AR,cs.AR cs.DS computer-science computer-architecture algorithms slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"Java常见问题排查: Java常见问题排查[毕玄]1397440786. Slides (PDF), 2014; 46 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Java常见问题, NoSuchMethodException, 应用没响应, 调用另一应用超时, GC overhead limit exceeded/Java Heap Space, Unable to create new native thread, PermGen Space, Direct buffer memory, Map failed, CPU us高, CPU sy高, and CPU iowait高."
  15040,Linux Performance Tools,"https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/Linux%20Performance%20Tools.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.OS,cs.OS computer-science operating-systems slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"Linux Performance Tools. Slides (PDF), 2014; 85 pages. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Slides cover Massive AWS EC2 Linux cloud, Brendan Gregg, Command Line Tools, Observability: collectl, Advanced Tracers, Tuning Methods, and Imagine Linux with Tracing."
  15041,张寿松 BtcTrade创始人,"https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/QCon-%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B8%81-%E5%BC%A0%E5%AF%BF%E6%9D%BE.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS computer-science algorithms slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"张寿松 BtcTrade创始人. Slides (PDF), 2014; 32 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover 关于比特币的问题, 为什么需要比特币?, 【一】为什么需要比特币, 比特币地址, 内在价值, 比特币算法还没被发现有缺陷,安全问题只是风险。比特币的工作, 大名鼎鼎的交易延展性问题,mtgox号称因为这个问题丢失了很多币, 中本聪原本希望挖矿分布在世界各地,这样系统会更安全。可是现, 矿工实际上所做的工作是算SHA256,也不做些有意义的事,就在揉, 比特币并不是真正的匿名,每一个交易都写在任何一个钱包中了,, 总量的控制对与比特币来说就没有了信贷扩张。银行吸收存款,然, 比特币的价格波动大,不论是上涨还是下跌,对于延迟付款的买卖, and 【四】其他虚拟币(山寨币)."
  15042,"Akka 分片集群的实现: 以spray-socktio 为例","https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/QConBeijing2014_dcaoyuan-akka-clustering.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DC,cs.DC cs.PF computer-science high-performance-computing slides gitlab,Caoyuan Deng,2014,null,"Akka 分片集群的实现: 以spray-socktio 为例. Slides (PDF) by Caoyuan Deng, 2014; 39 pages, in Chinese. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Subject (translated): parallel computing. Slides cover 大数据/ 消息的实时流式处理, Actor Model, Actor - 适合并行计算的最小颗粒, Akka 的Actor 实现, 分片- IdExtractor / ShardResolver, 分片 – 带EntryId 的消息, 持久化 – persist / recover, 连接层节点挂掉, 状态层节点挂掉, 新增节点, 确保消息可靠传递?, 与业务逻辑的接口- RxJava, and 性能分析- 单服务器."
  15043,Quote or be quoted,"https://gitlab.com/qwfys/wonderful-slides/-/blob/master/scala/Quote%20or%20be%20quoted.pdf",gitlab.com,math.CO,math.CO math.CA mathematics graph-theory harmonic-analysis slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"Quote or be quoted. Slides (PDF), 2014; 56 pages. From a repository described as: a slide collection that contains all the slides that I think they are wonderful. Slides cover SIP-11 Extensible String Interpolation Syntax, Joy basics, Basic quotation, Macro quotation, Unquoting, Lifting, Splicing, Feature interaction: splicing + lifting, Status, Pattern matching: unquoting, Pattern matching: splicing, Pattern matching: (un)lifting, and Eval."
  15044,"Методы и программные средства, поддерживающие комбинированный анализ бинарного кода","https://gitlab.com/saruman9/docs_for_DW/-/blob/master/IR/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%8B%20%D0%B8%20%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BC%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5%20%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0%2C%20%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B6%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%8E%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%B5%20%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9%20%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%20%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%20%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0.pdf",gitlab.com,cs.DS,cs.DS cs.AR computer-science algorithms computer-architecture slides gitlab,null,2014,null,"Методы и программные средства, поддерживающие комбинированный анализ бинарного кода. Slides (PDF), 2014; 14 pages, in Russian. Subject (translated): algorithms and data structures. Slides cover Рис. 2. Различные уровни представления и диапазоны применения методов, нового поколения, характеризуемого номером. Для каждого поколения, позволяет абстрагироваться от особенностей набора команд целевой машины, применяться в процессорных архитектурах x86, MIPS, ARM, PowerPC и, выравнивание грамматик, то есть сопоставление элементов двух грамматик и, вершина рабочего пространства: корень дерева, отвечающий, освободить объект ресурса (здесь важно напомнить о том, что среда работает, соответственно, данные лицензии. По характерным адресам был определена, контрольная сумма по перечисленным выше данным (функция, and Блок-схемы представляют собой двудольные графы, совмещающие в себе."
